    mc "Besides, it's not like I knew everything when I was five. Maybe I had all the information at eleven. Or at least all I had until a few days ago."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:309
translate english c19s001_SamConvSecret_18851e4a:

    # sam "Ha tenido que ser muy duro para todos vosotros. Tanto guardar el secreto, como para las chicas descubrirlo ahora."
    sam "It must have been very hard for all of you. Both keeping the secret, and for the girls to find out now."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:310
translate english c19s001_SamConvSecret_b49800e8:

    # mc "Hubo de todo un poco, pero se lo tomaron mejor de lo que esperaba. Quizás excepto [emm], que estuvo enfadada unas horas. Aunque también menos de las que esperaba."
    mc "There was a little bit of everything, but they took it better than I expected. Maybe except [emm], who was angry for a few hours. Fewer than I expected, though."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:311
translate english c19s001_SamConvSecret_2b8b9014:

    # mc "No te preocupes por nosotros. Todos estamos bien."
    mc "Don't worry about us. We're all fine."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:318
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_fe8f1641:

    # sam "¿Qué me puedes contar de Amanda y Eva? Me han dicho que son... especiales."
    sam "What can you tell me about Amanda and Eva? I've been told they're... special."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:319
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_c4691a03:

    # mc "Lo son. Os habéis perdido algunas cosas muy emotivas estos últimos días. Te van a encantar."
    mc "They are. You've missed some very moving stuff these last few days. You're going to love them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:320
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_71dc63be:

    # mc "Pero prefiero no explicarte muchas cosas. Quiero que te formes tu propia opinión cuando las conozcas."
    mc "But I prefer not to explain a lot of things to you. I want you to form your own opinion when you get to know them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:325
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_2b8191fb:

    # sam "No puedo ser imparcial. He estado hablando con [mar] antes. Se le iluminaban los ojos hablando de ellas."
    sam "I can't be impartial. I've been talking to [mar] already. Her eyes lit up talking about them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:326
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_2d74b3d2:

    # sam "Especialmente de Amanda. Es la que es igual que [emm], ¿no?"
    sam "Especially about Amanda. She's the one who's just like [emm], isn't she?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:327
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_8f69c2cd:

    # mc "Sí. Pero son muy diferentes. Y también Amanda y Eva son diferentes entre ellas."
    mc "Yes. But they are very different. And Amanda and Eva are very different from each other, too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:328
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_4935486c:

    # sam "No podía parar de sonreír. Si alguien es capaz de poner así de contenta a tu madre... ya se ha ganado mi cariño."
    sam "She couldn't stop smiling. If someone is able to make your mother this happy... they've already earned my affection."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:329
translate english c19s001_SamConvAmEv_25d8c5cf:

    # mc "Ya te digo que son especiales. Todo el mundo en la familia las adora."
    mc "I'm telling you, they're special. Everyone in the family loves them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:333
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_2c696c32:

    # "Después de cambiarte pasas por la cocina..."
    "After you change, you go to the kitchen..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:334
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_1975db8f:

    # kim "No estaba segura de qué hacer. Es... raro..."
    kim "I wasn't sure about what to do. It's... weird..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:335
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_ab30d862:

    # kim "No creía que tú lo fueras a hacer. Ha sido una sorpresa."
    kim "I didn't think you were going to do it. That was a surprise."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:336
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_c2ce47e2:

    # mom "Lo autoricé porque lo pidió [eri]. Sabía que [nor] también lo iba a hacer, con lo que no me parecía bien dejarlas solas."
    mom "I authorized it because [eri] asked for it. I knew [nor] was going to do it too, so it didn't seem right to leave them alone."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:337
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_9ea9d7d7:

    # mc "¿Estáis hablando del topless?"
    mc "Are you guys talking about being topless?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:339
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_9d2e5159:

    # mom "Sí. De momento me ha sorprendido un poco quién se ha apuntado."
    mom "Yes. So far I've been a little surprised at who has joined."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:340
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_0618c67d:

    # kim "Y quién no se ha apuntado..."
    kim "And who hasn't enrolled..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:342
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_1e43dc19:

    # mom "No, cariño. Cada una de vosotras sois libres para decidir por vosotras mismas. Era una posibilidad y no una obligación."
    mom "No, sweetie. Each of you are free to decide for yourselves. It is a choice, not an obligation."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:343
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_de2b4947:

    # mom "Igual que nadie te va a obligar a desnudarte en el jacuzzi o la sauna de [nor]."
    mom "Just like no one is going to force you to get naked in [nor]'s hot tub or sauna."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:344
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_ee939c4f:

    # mc "En eso tiene razón, Kim. Tienes permiso para hacerlo, pero no tienes por qué hacerlo si no quieres."
    mc "She's right about that, Kim. You have permission to do it, but you don't have to do it if you don't want to."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:345
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_b70b3927:

    # kim "Pero si soy la única..."
    kim "But if I'm the only one..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:347
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_9be33c8e:

    # mom "No eres la única. Las hay que llevan un bañador de cuerpo entero. Y hay más chicas que se han decidido por un bikini igual que tú."
    mom "You are not the only one. There are some who wear a full body swimsuit. And there are more girls who have decided on a bikini just like you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:349
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_463a85dd:

    # mom "Mi madre y mi tía también llevan bikinis. Al resto aún no las he visto, pero seguro que hay más."
    mom "My mother and my aunt also wear bikinis. I haven't seen the rest of them yet, but I'm sure there are more."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:351
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_761fdd8d:

    # mom "Olivia y Betty también llevan bikinis. Al resto aún no las he visto, pero seguro que hay más."
    mom "Olivia and Betty are also wearing bikinis. I haven't seen the rest of them yet, but I'm sure there are more."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:352
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_bca264aa:

    # mc "¡Ohhh! ¿Tía Betty no va a hacer topless? *Risa* ¡Qué decepción! Nunca me lo hubiera imaginado."
    mc "Ohhh! Aunt Betty's not going to go topless? *Laugh* How disappointing. I never would have guessed that."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:354
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_99f8e0ea:

    # mom "[mc], esto es serio. Kim se siente insegura y cohibida con Jamaal y contigo aquí. Estoy segura de que si no estuvierais no tendría dudas."
    mom "[mc], this is serious. Kim feels insecure and self-conscious with Jamaal and you here. I'm sure if you weren't here, she wouldn't have any doubts."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:355
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_317656c2:

    # mc "¿Habéis visto a Jamaal?"
    mc "Have you guys seen Jamaal?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:357
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_3d9b8d5a:

    # mom "No. Aún no he bajado a la piscina desde que han llegado."
    mom "No. I haven't been down to the pool yet since they've arrived."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:358
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_ac38f7fe:

    # mc "¿Y él no ha subido a saludarte a la cocina? *Risa* ¡Qué maleducado!"
    mc "And he hasn't come upstairs to the kitchen to greet you? *Laugh* How rude of him!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:359
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_dd1da067:

    # kim "¡[mc]! ¡Eso es cruel y no es digno de ti!"
    kim "[mc]! That's cruel and beneath you!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:361
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_384a6bc5:

    # mom "No te preocupes. No lo dice con maldad y siempre están buscando excusas para meterse el uno con el otro."
    mom "Don't worry. He doesn't mean it maliciously and they're always looking for excuses to pick on each other."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:362
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_3ba4fbb1:

    # mom "Y, aunque deberían, no ponen ningún límite a lo que es correcto y lo que no."
    mom "And, even though they should, they don't put any limits on what is right and what is wrong when it comes to laughing at the other one."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:363
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_8a7e7d8f:

    # mc "Si lo pusiéramos dejaría de ser divertido. O tan divertido al menos."
    mc "If we put a limit on it, it would stop being fun. Or as much fun at least."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:365
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_93786d3a:

    # kim "Ah, OK. Nunca he entendido ese tipo de humor..."
    kim "Ah, OK. I've never understood that kind of humor..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:366
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_991ec918:

    # mc "Es fácil de entender. En el instituto éramos los perdedores. La gente se metía conmigo por gordo y con Jamaal por su velocidad y su movilidad."
    mc "It's easy to understand. We were the underdogs in high school. People picked on me for being fat and on Jamaal for his speed and mobility."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:367
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_6795a5ee:

    # mc "Si nosotros nos decíamos en broma lo que otras personas podían decirnos en serio, no tenía sentido que nos lo dijeran porque sabían que no nos iban a hacer daño."
    mc "If we jokingly told each other what other people might tell us seriously, it didn't make sense for them to actually say it to us because they knew they weren't going to hurt us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:368
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_6a9ba4ba:

    # mc "Es el tipo de humor que utiliza Kate también."
    mc "That's the kind of humor Kate uses too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:369
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_9d7f7965:

    # kim "Pese a todo sigo sin entenderlo. Yo no podría bromear con mis defectos..."
    kim "I still don't get it, though. I couldn't joke about my flaws..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:371
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_d8d5af8d:

    # kim "Pero volviendo a Jamaal, nos han presentado antes. Iba con camiseta y bermudas. ¿Por qué preguntas si lo hemos visto?"
    kim "But going back to Jamaal, I've met him before. He was in a T-shirt and shorts, why are you asking if we've seen him?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:372
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_9b39bbc6:

    # mc "Cuando puedas, baja a la piscina y mira cómo va ahora. Se te quitará cualquier tipo de complejo sobre cómo debes vestirte o qué debes ponerte."
    mc "When you can, go down to the pool and see what he's wearing now. It will take away any complexes about how you should dress or what you should wear."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:374
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_ed6bdda9:

    # mom "Y sobre [mc], creo que no debería importarte que esté aquí. No lo eduqué para que se quede mirando a una mujer mientras babea porque haga topless."
    mom "And about [mc], I don't think you should care that he's here. I didn't raise him to stare at a woman while drooling because she's topless."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:375
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_10d47669:

    # mom "Ni siquiera a una tan bonita como tú."
    mom "Not even at one as pretty as you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:376
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_4aa02246:

    # mc "Pero una mirada de reojo sí que puedo echar de vez en cuando. *Risa*"
    mc "But I can throw in a sideways glance from time to time. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:378
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_6b0243b7:

    # mom "¡[mc]!" (multiple=2)
    mom "[mc]!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:379
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_f0d34027:

    # kim "¿Ves?" (multiple=2)
    kim "See?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:380
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_45f7dfbd:

    # mc "Sólo estaba bromeando. Si te sirve de algo, prometo no mirar ni una sola vez en tu dirección."
    mc "I was just kidding. For what it's worth, I promise not to look in your direction once."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:381
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_8ac18f63:

    # mc "Independientemente de lo que hagas con el top de tu bikini."
    mc "Regardless of what you do with your bikini top."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:383
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_287e05fd:

    # kim "Cambiando de tema... ¿Cuándo vais a dar los regalos a las chicas?"
    kim "Changing the topic... When are you going to give the gifts to the girls?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:384
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_5b5edb8e:

    # mc "Después de comer. ¿Por qué?"
    mc "After lunch. Why?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:385
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_6118e1c8:

    # kim "En mi familia de Cleveland lo hacemos como en Navidad, nada más levantarnos."
    kim "With my family in Cleveland, we do it like we do for Christmas, as soon as we wake up."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:386
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_51ca3b9e:

    # kim "Pero tiene lógica hacerlo así, viniendo gente de fuera de la casa."
    kim "But it makes sense to do it this way, having people coming from outside the house."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:388
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_09d4be70:

    # mom "Hasta este año sólo habían venido Samantha, Simone, y Jamaal."
    mom "Until this year only Samantha, Simone, and Jamaal joined us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:389
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_87a9e775:

    # mc "Y Eileen cuando salíamos juntos en el instituto."
    mc "And Eileen when we were dating in high school."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:390
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_6f9a7e6e:

    # mom "Y Scarlett los últimos seis o siete años. Lo máximo que estuvimos fue... el año antes de que [mc] se marchara. Fuimos catorce."
    mom "And Scarlett for the last six or seven years. The most we had here was... the year before [mc] left. There were fourteen of us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:392
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_72685ce7:

    # kim "Este año somos 24. Lo he contado..."
    kim "This year there are 24 of us... I counted it..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:393
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_ad22e22e:

    # mc "Va a ser la celebración más grande en la historia de esta casa. No creo que lo superemos."
    mc "It's going to be the biggest celebration in the history of this house. I don't think we'll ever top it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:395
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_75812567:

    # kim "Mmmm... ¿Cuándo es el próximo cumpleaños?"
    kim "Mmmm... When is the next birthday?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:396
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_9a4de637:

    # mc "Scarlett, Simone, y Debbie en octubre. Después de ellas vas tú, en noviembre."
    mc "Scarlett, Simone, and Debbie in October. After them, it's you, in November."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:398
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_4e0da2a2:

    # kim "¿Te sabes el cumpleaños de todo el mundo?"
    kim "Do you know everyone's birthday?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:399
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_50ae5637:

    # mc "Sí... Es lógico, ¿no? Pero ¿por qué lo preguntabas?"
    mc "Yes... That's logical, isn't it? But why were you asking?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:401
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_75f8689d:

    # kim "Para los próximos cumpleaños ya estarán aquí las seis chicas que van a vivir en casa de [nor]."
    kim "By the next birthdays, the six girls who will be living at [nor]'s house will be here."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:402
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_bf8d9ef0:

    # kim "Si se quieren integrar en la familia... ¡Podríamos llegar a ser 30!"
    kim "If they want to join the family... We could grow up to be 30!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:403
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_de053f9d:

    # mc "Pero no estarán Meemaw y Betty; están ocupando sus habitaciones y tenían planes para volver a Florida. Tampoco vivirán con nosotros Kiara y Eileen, están ocupando otra."
    mc "But Meemaw and Betty will not be there; they are occupying the students' rooms and had plans to return to Florida. Nor will Kiara and Eileen be living with us; they are occupying another room."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:404
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_785b8661:

    # mc "Y yo seguramente estaré en Aruba todavía, con Eva o Amanda, o las dos."
    mc "And I'll probably still be in Aruba, with Eva or Amanda, or both."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:406
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_dd4949b4:

    # kim "No me había dado cuenta... La familia se separará tarde o temprano... pero es demasiado pronto."
    kim "I didn't realize... The family will break up sooner or later... but it's too soon."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:407
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_0fecad0a:

    # mc "Y eso no es lo peor. Lisa y Kate acaban sus carreras en un par de años..."
    mc "And that's not the worst of it. Lisa and Kate are finishing their degrees in a couple of years..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:409
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_3d0e1a6d:

    # mom "No adelantemos acontecimientos aún. Queda muchísimo para eso."
    mom "Let's not get ahead of ourselves yet. It's a long, long way off."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:410
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_c2b16046:

    # mc "Sí, sólo hace una semana que han llegado y ya estamos pensando lo que las echaremos de menos dentro de uno o dos años."
    mc "Yes, they've only been here for a week and we're already thinking how much we'll miss them in a year or two."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:412
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_526bb2f8:

    # kim "Dame algo para bajar antes de que me pongáis triste solo de pensarlo. *Risa*"
    kim "Give me something to take downstairs before you make me sad just thinking about it. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:413
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_7608029f:

    # mom "Coge ese pastel de ahí si quieres. [mc] bajará el resto mientras yo acabo de preparar unas cosas."
    mom "Take that pie over there if you want. [mc] will bring the rest down while I finish getting some things ready."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:414
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_4c864ff7:

    # mc "Y después tengo que ir a la cocina de [nor]. Le he prometido que la ayudaría."
    mc "And then I have to go to [nor]'s kitchen. I promised her I'd help her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:416
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_5c9a7435:

    # "Kim se dirige a la puerta y se para justo antes de abrirla."
    "Kim walks to the door and stops just before opening it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:417
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_d051963f:

    # kim "Pero..."
    kim "But..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:418
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_e5a94576:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa, Kim?"
    mc "What is it, Kim?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:420
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_642ce33f:

    # kim "Aunque hayamos acabado nuestras carreras... ¿podremos venir a visitaros?"
    kim "Even if we have finished our degrees... could we still come and visit you sometime?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:422
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_c9d37ae4:

    # mom "Claro que sí, cielo. Siempre seréis bienvenidas en casa."
    mom "Of course you could, sweetie. You'll always be welcome at home."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:423
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_48c1e7e2:

    # mc "Y si tenemos las habitaciones ocupadas, ya apañaremos algo. Yo ya sé lo que es dormir en el sofá."
    mc "And if the rooms are full, we'll figure something out. I already know what it's like to sleep on the couch."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:424
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_8b6aea9e:

    # mom "Y Newport ha crecido mucho en los últimos años. ¿Quién sabe si alguna de vosotras encuentra un trabajo aquí y decide quedarse?"
    mom "And Newport has grown a lot in the last few years. Who knows if any of you will find a job here and decide to stay?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:427
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_d498802f:

    # "Kim planta un sorprendente beso en tus labios tras entregarte la tarta."
    "Kim plants a surprising kiss on your lips after handing you the pie."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:429
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_02aaaf64:

    # "Y rodea la península de la cocina hasta abrazar a [mar]."
    "And she goes around the kitchen peninsula to hug [mar]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:430
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_61174454:

    # kim "¡Gracias, [mar]!"
    kim "Thanks, [mar]!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:431
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_63641cc2:

    # mom "No pasa nada, cielo."
    mom "It's all right, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:432
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_698f2269:

    # kim "*Susurrando* No se lo digas a nadie, pero... ¡Qué vergüenza! He estado a punto de decir \"Gracias, Mamá\". *Risita* Creo que paso demasiado tiempo con [emm] y [mc]."
    kim "*Whispering* Don't tell anyone, but... How embarrassing! I was about to say, \"Thank you, Mom.\" *Chuckle* I think I spend too much time with [emm] and [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:433
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_11a1c192:

    # mom "*Susurrando* Tampoco pasa nada por eso, cielo."
    mom "*Whispering* Nothing wrong with that either, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:434
translate english c19s001_MarthaKim_7cf49b5f:

    # mc "¿Qué estáis susurrando? Me gustaría recordaros que estoy aquí. *Risa*"
