    mc "We are treading carefully so we don't screw up the birthday. *Laugh* Imagine [emm] angry on a day like today."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:887
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a49e20c0:

    # emm "Por mucho que lo intentéis, hoy no voy a enfadarme por nada. Toda la familia está aquí y eso es suficiente para pasárselo bien."
    emm "No matter how hard you try, I'm not going to get upset about anything today. The whole family is here and that's enough to have a good time."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:888
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b356810d:

    # emm "A menos que mi hermano me haga un regalo... de mierda. *Risa*"
    emm "Unless my brother gives me a... shitty gift. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:889
translate english c19s003_Gifts_bcf66f4a:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que te va a gustar, no te preocupes. Aunque no lo puedas disfrutar hoy."
    mc "I'm sure you'll like it, don't worry. Even if you can't enjoy it today."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:891
translate english c19s003_Gifts_4fa7b2d5:

    # sim "¡Eso es cruel por tu parte, [mc]! *Risa*"
    sim "That's cruel on your part, [mc]! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:893
translate english c19s003_Gifts_571327f2:

    # sim "Aunque se lo merezca por sus excusas de mierda."
    sim "Even if she deserves it for her sheeppy excuses."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:894
translate english c19s003_Gifts_99cb2a14:

    # mc "También estoy seguro de que no le va a importar esperar para disfrutarlo."
    mc "I'm also sure she won't mind waiting to enjoy it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:896
translate english c19s003_Gifts_534a2ad1:

    # emm "Me voy a tener que fiar de ti, pero ahora estoy ansiosa. ¿Por qué todo el mundo come tan lento? *Risa* ¿No se dan cuenta de que cuanto más tarden en comer más tardaremos en recibir los regalos?"
    emm "I'm going to have to trust you, but now I'm anxious. Why is everyone eating so slowly? *Laugh* Don't they realize that the longer they take to eat, the longer it will take to get the presents?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:897
translate english c19s003_Gifts_69fddffa:

    # sim "Para tu próximo cumpleaños compra unos embudos y nos cebas a todos como a pollos. *Risa*"
    sim "For your next birthday, buy some funnels and feed us all like chickens in a farm. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:898
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b763bd8b:

    # emm "Ve a meterles prisa, [mc]. *Risa* Diles que estoy a punto de sufrir un infarto por la ansiedad de saber qué me habéis regalado."
    emm "Go hurry them up, [mc]. *Laugh* Tell them I'm about to have a heart attack from the anxiety of finding out what you've gifted me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:900
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e2754d2f:

    # mc "Rara forma de comportarse para la adulta de la casa. *Risa*"
    mc "Odd way to behave for the adult in the house. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:901
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5983cb22:

    # mc "Vale, voy a ello. Os veo luego."
    mc "Okay, I'll get to it. See you later."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:903
translate english c19s003_Gifts_38a76f30:

    # "Te acercas al grupo de los bromistas. Al menos bromistas cuando tú estás cerca y puedes ser el centro de sus bromas."
    "You get close to the group of pranksters. At least pranksters when you're around and can be the butt of their jokes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:904
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7b7ba207:

    # "Quizás te salve que Kate y Jamaal aún no se conocen lo suficiente."
    "Maybe, the fact that Kate and Jamaal still don't know each other well enough, will save you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:905
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d419d581:

    # mc "¿Qué tal lo estáis pasando por aquí?"
    mc "Are you having a good time around here?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:906
translate english c19s003_Gifts_399e9378:

    # jam "Bien hasta que has llegado. *Risa* Tengo a estas chicas tan guapas trayéndome comida y ahora la tendré que compartir contigo."
    jam "Well until you've arrived. *Laugh* I've got these beautiful ladies bringing me food and now I'm going to have to share it with you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:907
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1579c0c8:

    # bet "No te pases con [mc], Jamaal. *Risa* El pobre chico lleva un día de locos."
    bet "Go easy on [mc], Jamaal. *Laugh* Poor kid is having a crazy day."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:908
translate english c19s003_Gifts_004e5557:

    # kat "¿Un día? *Risa* Creo que cuando acabe la fiesta vendrán a buscarlo del manicomio más cercano."
    kat "Day? *Laugh* I think when the party's over they'll come looking for him from the nearest mental asylum."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:909
translate english c19s003_Gifts_eedcdcc5:

    # "De acuerdo. Nada te va a salvar de ser el centro de las bromas."
    "Okay. Nothing's going to save you from being the butt of their jokes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:910
translate english c19s003_Gifts_34ea3fb8:

    # mc "No te preocupes por la comida, Jamaal. Ya no como tanto como comía antes."
    mc "Don't worry about the food, Jamaal. I don't eat as much as I used to."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:912
translate english c19s003_Gifts_9dbf5d27:

    # jam "Es una suerte para todos. Tienes que llevar una vida sana y dejarnos la comida a Betty, Kate, y a mí."
    jam "It's lucky for everyone. You have to live a healthy life and leave the food to Betty, Kate, and I."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:913
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2c27d5b5:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que comes más de lo que te toca y dejas a estas señoritas sin su parte."
    mc "I'm sure you eat more than your fair share and leave these ladies without their cut."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:915
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2d7262a9:

    # kat "Yo no puedo comer mucho por tu culpa, [mc]. Me duelen tanto los brazos de tanto nadar que casi no puedo aguantar el plato. Y Jamaal es un devorador de rollitos."
    kat "I can't eat much because of you, [mc]. My arms hurt so much from swimming that I can barely hold my plate. And Jamaal is a roll gobbler."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:916
translate english c19s003_Gifts_208d246a:

    # mc "Puedes usar a Jamaal de carrito de la comida. No se va a ir corriendo a ningún sitio y es bastante estable. Pero marca cuál es tu plato."
    mc "You can use Jamaal as a food cart. He's not going to run anywhere and he's pretty stable. But mark what your food is so he doesn't eat it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:918
translate english c19s003_Gifts_4c2fc65c:

    # bet "No es mala idea. *Risa* Lo podemos llevar arriba y abajo en vez de dar tantos viajes nosotras. Le podemos poner una bandeja encima de las piernas y quitarle el pollo frito."
    bet "That's not a bad idea. *Laugh* We can drive him up and down instead of taking so many trips ourselves. We can put a tray on top of his legs and take the fried chicken away from him."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:919
translate english c19s003_Gifts_667029c7:

    # mc "Sólo si lo queréis ver llorar. *Risa* Ese pollo lo hace [mar] casi exclusivamente para él."
    mc "Only if you want to see him crying. *Laugh* [mar] cooks that chicken almost exclusively for him."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:920
translate english c19s003_Gifts_4c2aefc0:

    # mc "Pero podéis aparcarlo al lado de la mesa de la comida. Así está a la sombra y no se le cuece el cerebro."
    mc "But you can park him next to the food table. That way it's in the shade and his brain doesn't get cooked."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:922
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2fdac9e6:

    # jam "Chicas, el trato consistía en meterse con [mc], no conmigo. ¡Y con mi pollo no se juega!"
    jam "Girls, the deal was to mess with [mc], not me. And you don't mess with my chicken!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:923
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a46a6666:

    # kat "Si no te hubieras comido el último rollito de calabacín, a lo mejor hubiera respetado el trato. *Risa*"
    kat "If you hadn't eaten the last zucchini roll, maybe I would have honored the deal. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:924
translate english c19s003_Gifts_49b608bc:

    # bet "Pero es que serías un carrito de la comida fantástico. *Risa* Especialmente si te atamos las manos para que no comas. Nos ahorrarías muchos paseos."
    bet "But you'd make a fantastic food cart. *Laugh* Especially if we tie your hands so you don't eat. You'd save us a lot of walking."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:925
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8c14de26:

    # mc "Bueno, yo os dejo discutiendo la logística. Voy a saludar por allí."
    mc "Well, I'll leave you to discuss logistics. I'm going to say hello over there."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:926
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2b739f1b:

    # mcp "(Si no puedes con ellos, desvía la atención hacia uno de ellos.)"
    mcp "(If you can't handle them, divert attention to one of them.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:928
translate english c19s003_Gifts_cc2c5edb:

    # bet "Luego tengo que hablar contigo, [mc]."
    bet "I need to talk to you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:929
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3d7fbf62:

    # mc "Cuando quieras, dime que necesitas."
    mc "Whenever you want, tell me what you need."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:930
translate english c19s003_Gifts_369e3228:

    # bet "Luego. En privado."
    bet "Later. In private."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:931
translate english c19s003_Gifts_46249754:

    # mc "Perfecto. ¿Después de los regalos?"
    mc "Perfect. After the gifts?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:932
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5f64dbe0:

    # bet "Vale."
    bet "Okay."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:934
translate english c19s003_Gifts_452f0448:

    # mc "¿Cómo lo estáis pasando?"
    mc " Are you having a good time?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:935
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7823ff68:

    # kim "¡Es impresionante! Nunca había estado en una fiesta familiar tan grande."
    kim "It's awesome! I've never been to a family party this big."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:936
translate english c19s003_Gifts_77125091:

    # mom "Todo está saliendo bien, la comida no está demasiado fría, ni la bebida demasiado caliente, con lo que no me puedo quejar. Cocinar para 24 personas es complicado."
    mom "Everything is going well, the food is not too cold, and the drink is not too hot, so I can't complain. Cooking for 24 people is complicated."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:937
translate english c19s003_Gifts_ebf8d108:

    # mom "No había cocinado para tanta gente desde que dejé de trabajar."
    mom "I haven't cooked for so many people since I stopped working."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:938
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8d59ca67:

    # sam "Y además teniendo que hacer opciones veganas para Lisa. [nor] y tu madre se han lucido."
    sam "And also having to make vegan options for Lisa. [nor] and your mother have excelled themselves."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:940
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0e9d180a:

    # sam "Por no hablar del arroz hervido para Simone a última hora. ¡Pobre hija mía! Se está perdiendo esta comida deliciosa."
    sam "Not to mention the boiled rice for Simone at the last minute. Poor daughter of mine! She's missing out on this delicious meal."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:941
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5c517b7b:

    # mc "Está todo genial, Mamá. ¿Cuántos sois en vuestras reuniones familiares, Kim?"
    mc "It's all great, Mom. How many of you are at your family gatherings, Kim?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:943
translate english c19s003_Gifts_cdf6c120:

    # kim "Mi padre, mi madrastra, mi abuelo, mi hermano y yo."
    kim "My father, my stepmother, my grandfather, my brother and I."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:944
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1c57be3a:

    # mcp "(No hay madre en esa frase...)"
    mcp "(There is no mother in that sentence...)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:945
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f92831f0:

    # "Kim parece leerte el pensamiento sin que tengas que pronunciar una palabra."
    "Kim seems to read your thoughts without you having to utter a word."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:946
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6cafd409:

    # kim "Mi madre no está entre nosotros desde que nació mi hermano, cuando yo tenía dos años."
    kim "My mother has not been among us since my brother was born, when I was two years old."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:948
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5d140d85:

    # mom "¡Oh, mi niña! ¡No lo sabía! ¡Lo siento mucho!"
    mom "Oh, my girl! I didn't know! I'm so sorry!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:949
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3be81e5f:

    # kim "No pasa nada, [mar]. No la recuerdo. Solo he visto fotos y videos suyos. Era guapísima."
    kim "It's okay, [mar]. I don't remember her. I've only seen pictures and videos of her. She was stunningly beautiful."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:950
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e43896b5:

    # mom "Como tú, mi niña. Como tú."
    mom "Like you, my child. Just like you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:952
translate english c19s003_Gifts_62946987:

    # sam "Si algún día quieres hablar de ello, sabes que nos tienes aquí para lo que necesites."
    sam "If you ever want to talk about it, you know you have us here for whatever you need."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:953
translate english c19s003_Gifts_fee9f069:

    # kim "Gracias, Samantha, pero ya os digo que no os tenéis que preocupar. Hace mucho..."
    kim "Thank you, Samantha but, as I said, you don't have to worry. It's been a long time..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:954
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8fdf2e6d:

    # mc "Puede que haga mucho, pero..."
    mc "It may be a long time, but..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:956
translate english c19s003_Gifts_fb16c012:

    # kim "*Risa* Sí, [mc]. Hay que hablarlo todo. Lo sé."
    kim "*Laugh* Yes, [mc]. You have to talk it all out. I know."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:957
translate english c19s003_Gifts_22a79e71:

    # sam "Tu manía de hablarlo todo le ha devuelto la sonrisa. *Risa* Tenía que servir de algo."
    sam "Your craze for talking it all out brought a smile back to her face. *Laugh* It had to serve a purpose."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:958
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d6f34000:

    # mom "¿Por qué no vas a ver cómo les va a Eva y Amanda? Creo que esta comida también puede ser un poco abrumadora para ellas siendo su primera fiesta... normal."
    mom "Why don't you go see how Eva and Amanda are doing? I think this meal might also be a little overwhelming for them being their first... normal party."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:959
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8d027de7:

    # mcp "(Eso es lo más parecido a ordenarme que las deje solas que voy a oír. No quiere que Kim se sienta mal, pero quiere hablar con ella sin que yo esté delante.)"
    mcp "(That's as close to ordering me to leave them alone as I'm going to hear. She doesn't want Kim to feel bad, but she wants to talk to her without me being around)."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:960
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8bda4aa7:

    # mc "Voy a ver cómo se lo están pasando. Hablamos luego."
    mc "I'm going to see how they're doing. Talk to you later."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:962
translate english c19s003_Gifts_4b10166f:

    # mc "Están dos pelirrojas y una rubia en la puerta de un garaje... casi podría parecer el inicio de un chiste."
    mc "There are two redheads and a blonde at a garage door... It almost sounds like the beginning of a joke."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:963
translate english c19s003_Gifts_29292411:

    # eva "Y una de las pelirrojas mata al humorista y se acaba el chiste. *Risa*"
    eva "And one of the redheads kills the comedian and the joke is over. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:964
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3bd5ec2f:

    # sca "No me acaba de gustar ese final, Eva. Yo estaba pensando en tirar al humorista a la piscina. *Risa*"
    sca " That ending doesn't sound good to me, Eva. I was thinking of throwing the comedian in the pool. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:965
translate english c19s003_Gifts_c43d530c:

    # eil "Esperad un momento... ¿Vosotras le habéis dado el beso de buenos días?"
    eil "Wait a minute... Did you girls kiss him good morning?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:967
translate english c19s003_Gifts_de2ded86:

    # eva "Cuando hemos llegado. Después de que [emm] nos presentara a Simone."
    eva "When we arrived. After [emm] introduced us to Simone."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:968
translate english c19s003_Gifts_08e8802a:

    # sca "Yo esta mañana... cuando me lo he cruzado en la cocina."
    sca " I did it this morning... when I bumped into him in the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:969
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5410d897:

    # eil "Pues no os dejo que lo matéis ni que lo tiréis a la piscina antes de mi beso. *Risa*"
    eil "Well, I won't let you kill him or throw him in the pool before I get my kiss. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:971
translate english c19s003_Gifts_86ac7e6b:

    # eil "Buenos días, [mc]."
    eil "Good morning, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:972
translate english c19s003_Gifts_36356f93:

    # mc "Buenos días, Eileen."
    mc "Good morning, Eileen."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:974
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7af1ee95:

    # eil "Vale, todo vuestro. Merece una muerte horrible por empezar ese chiste. No puede definirnos por nuestro color de pelo. Yo soy algo más que una maravillosa pelirroja. *Risa*"
    eil "Okay, all yours. He deserves a horrible death for starting that joke. He can't define us by our hair color. I'm more than just a wonderful redhead. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:976
translate english c19s003_Gifts_164935f5:

    # eva "Creo que su sangre podría estropear el cumpleaños un poquito. Ya sabes, Alexia tendría que investigar en vez de seguir disfrutando de la comida. *Risa*"
    eva "I think his blood might spoil the birthday a little bit. You know, Alexia would have to investigate instead of enjoying the food. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:977
translate english c19s003_Gifts_842436bf:

    # eva "[mar] y [nor] se pondrían a limpiar. Es posible que alguna chica se pusiera triste... Mejor dejamos el asesinato para otro día. *Risa*"
    eva "[mar] and [nor] would start cleaning the blood. It's possible that some girl would get sad... We'd better save the murder for another day. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:978
translate english c19s003_Gifts_69dd8f15:

    # mc "Muy graciosa..."
    mc "Very funny..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:980
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7cf5470b:

    # sca "Y si lo tiramos a la piscina... ¿cuánto pesa? Seguro que salpica mucho y le moja la comida a alguien. *Risa*"
    sca "And if we throw it into the pool? How much does it weigh? I'm sure he'll splash a lot and get someone's food wet. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:981
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6e285c12:

    # mc "¡Por Dios! Creía que el grupo peligroso era el de Jamaal y Kate."
    mc "My goodness! I thought the dangerous group was Jamaal and Kate's."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:983
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0d28448b:

    # eil "Pobrecitos, suficiente tienen con aguantar el monokini de Jam. *Risa* Pero te lo tienes merecido por todos los años en los que te has metido con Jamaal."
    eil "Poor things, they have enough to put up with Jam's monokini. *Laugh* But you deserve it for all the years you've been picking on Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:984
translate english c19s003_Gifts_9f42bcd6:

    # sca "Y Kate es un amor. Nunca se mete con nadie que no sea ella misma. *Risa*"
    sca "And Kate is a sweetheart. She never picks on anyone but herself. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:985
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e7b92bbc:

    # eva "Bueno, yo tengo algunas grabaciones de Kate metiéndose con [mc]. *Risa* Son relevantes para vuestra protección. O, al menos, la de [mc]."
    eva "Well, I have some recordings of Kate picking on [mc]. *Laugh* They're relevant to your protection. Or, at least, [mc]'s."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:986
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b912b637:

    # eva "Esa chica puede ser una fiera. *Risa*"
    eva "That girl can be a beast when it comes to picking on [mc]. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:987
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3825f6bb:

    # mc "*Risa* Me parece que voy a seguir mi ronda con el resto de las chicas. Algún sitio donde me dejen respirar."
    mc "*Laugh* I think I'm going to continue my round with the rest of the girls. Somewhere where they'll let me breathe."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:988
translate english c19s003_Gifts_c2076849:

    # mc "Os veo luego. Y... Eva, luego quiero hablar en privado con Amanda y contigo. Después de los regalos."
    mc "See you later. And... Eva, I want to talk to you and Amanda in private later. After the gifts."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:990
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d994e5b8:

    # eva "¿Sobre qué? Amanda y yo aún no hemos acabado de aclarar lo que hablamos anoche..."
    eva "About what? Amanda and I still haven't finished clearing up what we talked about last night..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:991
translate english c19s003_Gifts_063fe740:

    # mc "¿Sabes lo malo de amenazar con asesinarme? Que ahora puedo tenerte intrigada hasta que tengamos esa conversación. *Risa*"
    mc "You know the bad thing about threatening to murder me? That now I can keep you intrigued until we have that conversation. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:992
translate english c19s003_Gifts_54279f0a:

    # mc "Y con ganas de más..."
    mc "And looking forward to more..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:993
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f3b5f675:

    # mc "Hasta luego chicas."
    mc "See you later, girls."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:995
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8b2f8c2f:

    # "Te giras sin darle tiempo a contestar (o a asesinarte) y te diriges al siguiente grupo."
    "You turn around without giving her time to answer (or murder you) and head to the next group."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:996
translate english c19s003_Gifts_380c62ad:

    # mc "Hola chicas. Felicidades, [eri]. Antes te has llevado a Maddie tan rápido que no me ha dado tiempo de felicitarte."
    mc "Hey, girls. Happy birthday, [eri]. You took Maddie away so fast earlier that I didn't have time to congratulate you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:997
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7c512e3c:

    # meg "¡Qué maleducado por tu parte, [mc]! *Risa* Y además llegas aquí y no nos das los buenos días a ninguna."
    meg "How rude of you, [mc]! *Laugh* And also you get here and don't kiss good morning to any of us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:998
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1c14653f:

    # lis "Dice que es el hombre de la casa y esas cosas. *Risa* Y tiene aquí a tres damiselas desatendidas."
    lis "He says he's the man of the house and that sort of thing. *Laugh* And he has three unattended damsels here."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:999
translate english c19s003_Gifts_29c11cbb:

    # eri "Como es mi cumpleaños, reclamo el primer beso. *Risa* Después os lo presto un rato."
    eri "Since it's my birthday, I claim the first kiss. *Laugh* Then I'll lend him to you for a while."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1001
translate english c19s003_Gifts_bb2d882b:

    # mc "Felicidades, [eri]."
    mc "Happy birthday, [eri]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1002
translate english c19s003_Gifts_44152844:

    # eri "Gracias, [mc]. Más vale que las beses también a ellas si no quieres que no llegue a mañana a cumplir los 19."
    eri "Thank you, [mc]. You better kiss them too, if you don't want me to die before my 19th birthday tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1004
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b9f68b48:

    # mc "Buenos días, Lisa. ¿Cuánto habéis bebido?"
    mc "Good morning, Lisa. How much did you drink?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1005
translate english c19s003_Gifts_41e50b3f:

    # lis "Buenos días. Megan y [eri] no quieren beber, con lo que yo tengo que beber por las tres, ¿no?"
    lis "Good morning. Megan and [eri] don't want to drink, so I have to drink for all three of us, right?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1006
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0ecf28f9:

    # mc "Sabes que no es necesario, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know better than that, right?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1007
translate english c19s003_Gifts_05aba25f:

    # lis "No te preocupes, tan solo he bebido tres copas de vino."
    lis "Don't worry, I've only had three glasses of wine."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1009
translate english c19s003_Gifts_c81b117b:

    # mc "Buenos días, Megan. Gracias por lo de anoche en el Jazz Corner."
    mc "Good morning, Megan. Thanks for last night at Jazz Corner."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1010
translate english c19s003_Gifts_58d15963:

    # meg "Buenos días, [mc]. Era el cumpleaños de tres de mis chicas favoritas, es lo menos que podía hacer."
    meg "Good morning, [mc]. It was the birthday of three of my favorite girls, it was the least I could do."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1012
translate english c19s003_Gifts_53439648:

    # mc "¿Estabais hablando de algo en lo que pueda participar? ¿O me vais a echar como han hecho el resto?"
    mc "Were you talking about something I can take part in? Or are you going to kick me out like the rest of them did?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1013
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a8d5d0d3:

    # eri "Estábamos hablando del topless."
    eri "We were just talking about toplessness."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1014
translate english c19s003_Gifts_83d0c4f3:

    # meg "Se han apuntado muchas más chicas de lo que cualquiera de nosotras había pensado."
    meg "A lot more girls have joined than any of us had thought."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1015
translate english c19s003_Gifts_ba742736:

    # lis "Y alguna que las tres pensábamos que lo haría, como Eva, no lo ha hecho."
    lis "And some, like Eva, that all three of us thought would do it, haven't."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1016
translate english c19s003_Gifts_9b5969f4:

    # mc "¿Quién os ha sorprendido más de las que se han apuntado?"
    mc "Who surprised you the most of those who joined?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1018
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a6d298e5:

    # eri "Yo no pensaba que [dap] fuera a hacerlo. Demasiada atención sobre ella el día que tiene que abrir los regalos."
    eri "I didn't think [dap] was going to do it. Too much attention on her on the day she has to open her presents."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1019
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f5e8f977:

    # mc "Creo que era muy consciente de por qué lo pediste, con lo que creo que también quería apoyar a tu madre."
    mc "I think she was well aware of why you asked for it, so I think she also wanted to support your mother."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1020
translate english c19s003_Gifts_c0c5a33a:

    # eri "Es posible..."
    eri "It's possible..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1022
translate english c19s003_Gifts_406ae3fe:

    # lis "A mí me ha sorprendido mucho Alexia. Cuando la conocí parecía tan seria y profesional, que no me la imaginaba así."
    lis "I was very surprised by Alexia. When I met her she seemed so serious and professional, I didn't imagine her like that."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1023
translate english c19s003_Gifts_538a8eab:

    # lis "Después hemos hablado mucho y sé que es muy abierta y simpática, pero esa primera impresión sigue contando para mí."
    lis "We've talked a lot afterwards and I know she's very open and friendly, but that first impression still counts for me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1024
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a238acdc:

    # mc "Alexia puede ser una caja de sorpresas. Después iré a hablar con ella."
    mc "Alexia can be a box of surprises. I'll go talk to her later."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1026
translate english c19s003_Gifts_497ec1ea:

    # meg "A mí me ha sorprendido Kim. Si yo tuviera un cuerpo tan perfecto como el suyo, no dudaría en enseñarlo."
    meg "I was surprised by Kim. If I had a body as perfect as hers, I wouldn't hesitate to show it off."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1027
translate english c19s003_Gifts_341cd6f6:

    # mc "Estaba preocupada por ser la única en no hacerlo, y pese a todo no lo ha hecho, con lo que debe ser importante para ella."
    mc "She was worried about being the only one not to do it, and yet she hasn't, so it must be important to her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1028
translate english c19s003_Gifts_13280cd3:

    # meg "Tienes razón, no lo había pensado así. ¿Y a ti? ¿Quién te ha sorprendido más?"
    meg "You're right, I hadn't thought of it that way. And you? Who surprised you the most?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1029
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e7898737:

    # mc "Samantha y Simone. Si me hubieran preguntado ayer, hubiera dicho que las dos habrían hecho justo lo contrario de lo que han hecho."
    mc "Samantha and Simone. If you had asked me yesterday, I would have said they both would have done just the opposite of what they have done."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1031
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b41f859c:

    # lis "Ahora sólo falta que se acabe la comida y empezar a abrir regalos. Tengo ganas de saber si hemos acertado con lo que les hemos regalado a las chicas."
    lis "Now we just need to finish the food and start opening presents. I'm looking forward to finding out if what we bought for the girls was okay."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1032
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8865ba85:

    # eri "Los regalos son lo de menos. Yo cambiaría todos los regalos por poder repetir esto más a menudo."
    eri "The gifts are the least of it. I would trade all the gifts to be able to repeat this more often."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1033
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1f0e072c:

    # meg "Tú quieres que no entre en ninguno de mis vestidos del trabajo. *Risa* [nor] y [mar] cocinan demasiado bien para mí."
    meg "You want me not to fit into any of my work dresses. *Laugh* [nor] and [mar]'s cooking is way to good not to eat it all."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1034
translate english c19s003_Gifts_92b01289:

    # mc "Con los que somos aquí, habrá celebraciones de sobras solamente con los cumpleaños. Suma el 4 de julio, Acción de gracias, Navidad, Nochevieja..."
    mc "With those of us here, there will be celebrations to spare with birthdays alone. Add July 4th, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year's Eve..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1035
translate english c19s003_Gifts_ffdbdeae:

    # mc "No vamos a ir cortos de celebraciones los próximos meses."
    mc "We're not going to be short on celebrations the next few months."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1037
translate english c19s003_Gifts_bb54d10e:

    # meg "Es fantástico, aunque tenga que comprar vestuario nuevo. *Risa*"
    meg " That's great, even if I have to buy a new wardrobe. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1038
translate english c19s003_Gifts_95f51cf3:

    # lis "Tengo ganas de pasar Nochevieja con vosotros. Me gustan más las fiestas con vestido formal que en bikini, aunque me podría acostumbrar."
    lis "I'm looking forward to spending New Year's Eve with you. I like parties in a formal dress better than in a bikini, though I could get used to this."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1039
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0b82ebad:

    # eri "Pues te llevarás una sorpresa. Lo solemos celebrar en pijama. *Risa*"
    eri "Well, you're in for a surprise. We usually celebrate in our pajamas. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1040
translate english c19s003_Gifts_27059b6c:

    # mc "¿No vais a volver a Aurora para Navidad?"
    mc "Aren't you going back to Aurora for Christmas?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1042
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2d57d172:

    # lis "Debbie y yo hemos estado hablando sobre eso. Seguramente pasemos Acción de Gracias y Navidad con mis padres, pero querríamos estar aquí para Nochevieja."
    lis "Debbie and I have been talking about it. We'll probably spend Thanksgiving and Christmas with my parents, but we'd like to be here for New Year's Eve."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1043
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f50c83ed:

    # lis "Si no os importa, claro... no sé si el Dormitorio seguirá abierto durante las fiestas."
    lis "If you don't mind, of course... I don't know if the Dorm will still be open during the holidays."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1044
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8fff7466:

    # mc "Creo que no habrá ningún problema con eso, Lisa."
    mc "I don't think there will be any problem with that, Lisa."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1046
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8089f1ae:

    # meg "¿Os está apeteciendo tanto como a mí empezar a planear todas esas fiestas? *Risa*"
    meg "Are you guys looking forward as much as I am to start planning all those parties? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1047
translate english c19s003_Gifts_83900991:

    # eri "Es un poco pronto... pero ¡sí! *Risa*"
    eri "It's a little early... but yeah! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1048
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b0d76e05:

    # lis "Aún no ha acabado tu cumpleaños y ya estamos hablando de las siguientes fiestas. *Risa* El cumpleaños de Debbie es en octubre..."
    lis "Your birthday isn't even over yet and we're already talking about the next parties. *Laugh* Debbie's birthday is in October..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1049
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b10b012a:

    # mc "Antes van los de Simone y Scarlett. Ya os pasaré una lista, pero si os vais a poner a organizar más fiestas, os voy a dejar y seguir disfrutando de esta."
    mc "Simone's and Scarlett's go first. I'll pass you a list, but if you're going to start organizing more parties, I'm going to leave you and keep enjoying this one."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1050
translate english c19s003_Gifts_83fb187a:

    # mc "Os veo luego chicas."
    mc "See you later, girls."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1052
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d6430870:

    # todas "Hasta luego, [mc]."
    todas "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1054
translate english c19s003_Gifts_c00541dc:

    # "Pasas a recargar el plato por la mesa de la comida y te acercas al siguiente grupo."
    "You stop by the food table to reload your plate and go over to the next group."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1055
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e7abd37f:

    # mcp "(Me sorprende que Maddie se haya apuntado al topless siendo su primera vez en casa.)"
    mcp "(I'm surprised Maddie decided to go topless her first time at home.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1056
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3e9d00d3:

    # mc "¿Qué tal lo estáis pasando?"
    mc "Are you having a good time?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1057
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1a1dc6dc:

    # nor "Genial, hay comida de sobras y todo el mundo está divirtiéndose. No se puede pedir más."
    nor "Great, we won't be short on food, and everyone is having fun. Couldn't ask for more."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1058
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3e62b690:

    # kia "Me encantan estas celebraciones familiares. Eileen me había hablado de ellas hace años, pero no me las imaginaba así."
    kia "I love these family celebrations. Eileen told me about them years ago, but I didn't imagine them like this."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1059
translate english c19s003_Gifts_44148589:

    # mad "Es una inmersión forzada en vuestra familia. *Risa* Aunque conocía a la mayoría de la tienda, no habíamos tenido la oportunidad de hablar mucho."
    mad "It's a forced immersion into your family. *Laugh* Although I knew most of them because they stopped by the store, we hadn't had a chance to talk a lot."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1060
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d9c43713:

    # mc "Espero que no te parezcamos demasiado raros. *Risa*"
    mc "I hope we don't seem too weird to you. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1062
translate english c19s003_Gifts_877f0b76:

    # mc "Veo que el hematoma de tu brazo ha mejorado mucho."
    mc "I see the bruise on your arm has improved a lot."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1064
translate english c19s003_Gifts_30a60798:

    # kia "Sí, el ungüento de Samantha ha obrado maravillas. Me ha dicho que amarilleará durante unos días y desaparecerá antes del próximo fin de semana."
    kia "Yes, Samantha's ointment worked wonders. She told me it will yellow for a few days and disappear before the next weekend."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1065
translate english c19s003_Gifts_17f2ab3a:

    # mc "Eso es fantástico. En una semana ya no nos acordaremos del hematoma."
    mc "That's fantastic. In a week we won't remember the bruise anymore."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1067
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b60da254:

    # mad "¿Qué te pasó? ¿Te caíste? Tuvo que ser una caída muy fuerte..."
    mad "What happened to you? Did you fall? It must have been a really bad fall..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1068
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0f70d3c3:

    # "Le haces señas de que no continúe por ahí, pero llegas tarde."
    "You signal her not to continue that way, but you're late."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1069
translate english c19s003_Gifts_bcdc6fdd:

    # kia "No... es un tema... de mi pasado..."
    kia "No... it's an issue... from my past..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1070
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6abb8ee6:

    # mc "Lo tienes que ver así. Algo que pasó y no volverá a pasar. Me ocupare... nos ocuparemos... de que no pase de nuevo."
    mc "You have to look at it like that. Something that happened and won't happen again. I'll see to it... we'll see to it... that it doesn't happen again."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1071
translate english c19s003_Gifts_25ea25b9:

    # nor "Aquí estás segura y nadie te volverá a hacer daño. Todos te vamos a proteger"
    nor "You are safe here, and no one will ever hurt you again. We will all protect you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1073
translate english c19s003_Gifts_cc8f0d0a:

    # mad "¡Oops! Lo siento, Kiara... no lo sabía..."
    mad "Oops! I'm sorry, Kiara... I didn't know..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1074
translate english c19s003_Gifts_de7961c8:

    # mc "Mejor hablar de cosas más alegres, ¿no? Luego traeré tus regalos. Supongo que son los más voluminosos."
    mc "Better to talk about happier things, right? I'll bring your presents later, Maddie. I guess they're the bulkiest ones."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1076
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6b3579c4:

    # nor "Creo que casi todo el mundo ha comido lo que podía comer ya, con lo que en veinte o treinta minutos haremos la entrega de regalos. Si quieres llevarlos a la pérgola, puedes hacerlo."
    nor "I think almost everyone has eaten what they could eat by now, so in twenty or thirty minutes we'll do the gift giving. If you want to take them to the pergola, you can do that."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1077
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a0d0098b:

    # kia "Yo tengo los míos en mi habitación. También tendré que ir a buscarlos."
    kia "I have mine in my room. I'll have to go get them, too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1078
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1938185b:

    # mad "Si quieres te ayudo a traerlos. No pesan, pero son incómodos de llevar para una sola persona."
    mad "If you want, I'll help you bring them in. They're not heavy, but they're a little bulky for one person to carry."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1079
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7b866421:

    # mc "Perfecto. ¿Vamos?"
    mc "Perfect. Shall we go?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1081
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3783c213:

    # "Llevas los regalos de Maddie a la pérgola del fondo del jardín y vas a buscar los tuyos a tu habitación."
    "You take Maddie's gifts to the pergola at the end of the garden and go get yours from your room."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1083
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6eced475:

    # "Después te acercas a algunas de las últimas chicas con las que no has hablado aún."
    "Then you approach some of the last girls you haven't talked to yet."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1084
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3a5656ef:

    # mc "¿Qué tal chicas? ¿Ya no coméis?"
    mc "What's up girls? Aren't you eating anymore?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1085
translate english c19s003_Gifts_c8440b69:

    # sai "Estoy a punto de reventar. Y aún queda el pastel."
    sai "I'm about to burst. And there's still the cake."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1086
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6896fb67:

    # ama "Con lo que había aquí se podría alimentar a un país pequeño. *Risa*"
    ama "With all the food that was here you could feed a small country. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1087
translate english c19s003_Gifts_dc8ea16c:

    # mee "Estas chicas están descubriendo cómo nos organizamos cuando hay comida por en medio. *Risa*"
    mee "These girls are figuring out how we do it when food is involved. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1089
translate english c19s003_Gifts_419fe907:

    # sai "Pero es que es imposible no querer probarlo todo. Cada plato es más delicioso que el anterior."
    sai "But it's just impossible not to want to taste everything. Each dish is more delicious than the last one."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1090
translate english c19s003_Gifts_91f54910:

    # mc "Hay que hacer sacrificios y renunciar a cosas. Yo era una bola hasta que no lo aprendí. *Risa*"
    mc "You have to make sacrifices and give up on some things. I was a ball until I learned it. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1091
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f3005491:

    # mc "Por ejemplo, va a haber tres pasteles. Solo hay que comer de uno de ellos. O una porción minúscula de cada una."
    mc "For example, there are going to be three cakes. You only have to eat from one of them. Or a minuscule portion of each."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1093
translate english c19s003_Gifts_15f43a02:

    # ama "Es lo que estaba diciéndole a Olivia. No sé cómo puede mantener una figura así, a su edad, si las comidas familiares son así."
    ama "That's what I was telling Olivia. I don't know how she can keep a figure like that, at her age, if family meals are like this."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1094
translate english c19s003_Gifts_10f59ace:

    # ama "Creo que me he engordado un par de kilos desde que os conozco."
    ama "I think I've put on a couple of pounds since I've known you guys."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1095
translate english c19s003_Gifts_462c42be:

    # mc "Bueno, Meemaw tiene un truco, cuando no está con nosotros adelgaza rápidamente. *Pretendiendo susurrar* Cocina fatal cualquier cosa más allá de una ensalada. *Risa*"
    mc "Well, Meemaw has a trick. When she's not with us, she slims down quickly. *Pretending to whisper* She cooks terrible anything beyond a salad. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1097
translate english c19s003_Gifts_9aaa3c85:

    # mee "No es cierto del todo. No sabéis apreciar las cualidades del arroz duro o del filete carbonizado. *Risa*"
    mee "That's not completely true. You don't know how to appreciate the qualities of hard rice or charred steak. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1098
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2080f8d0:

    # mc "Si que sabemos. Como materiales de construcción son geniales. Como alimento... no tanto. *Risa*"
    mc "Yes we do. As building materials they're great. As food... not so much. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1100
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1ba13645:

    # sai "¿Y tú? ¿Cómo lo estás pasando? Te hemos visto ir como un pollo sin cabeza entre todas nosotras."
    sai "How about you? How are you doing? We've seen you going like from group to group for the duration of the lunch."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1101
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d68c062a:

    # ama "Parece que quieras hablar con todas nosotras, pero no te quedas más de cinco o diez minutos con cada grupo."
    ama "You seem to want to talk to all of us, but you don't stay more than five or ten minutes with each group."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1102
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5e8507c3:

    # mee "Es que [mc] sería el perfecto anfitrión en cualquier fiesta. Quiere que todo el mundo se sienta a gusto y se lo pase bien."
    mee "It's just that [mc] would be the perfect host at any party. He wants everyone to feel comfortable and have a good time."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1103
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2374f6a3:

    # mc "¿Acaso me perdonaríais si me quedara todo el día charlando con el mismo grupo?"
    mc "Would you forgive me if I stayed all day chatting with the same group?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1105
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6535f8f6:

    # ama "*Risa* No, tendríamos que secuestrarte."
    ama "*Laugh* No, we'd have to kidnap you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1106
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d267b4bf:

    # sai "Sólo te perdonaríamos si ese grupo fuese el nuestro. *Risa*"
    sai "We would only forgive you if that group was ours. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1107
translate english c19s003_Gifts_41256648:

    # mee "Y entonces el resto de las mujeres de la familia vendrían a este grupo a secuestrarte y sería lo mismo. *Risa*"
    mee "And then the rest of the women in the family would come to this group to kidnap you and it would be the same. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1108
translate english c19s003_Gifts_9fc714f5:

    # mee "Por alguna razón, todas queremos nuestra ración de [mc]."
    mee "For some reason, we all want our share of [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1109
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0d20ae82:

    # mc "Lo acabas de decir como si fuera el cuarto pastel de cumpleaños. *Risa*"
    mc "You just said it like I was the fourth birthday cake. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1111
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a10b2e34:

    # "*Ding-Ding-Ding*"
    "*Ding-Ding-Ding*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1112
translate english c19s003_Gifts_01acbf16:

    # mar "¿Podéis prestarnos un momento de atención?"
    mom "Can we have your attention for a moment?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1113
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2989b6d2:

    # nor "Nos hemos dado cuenta de que nadie está comiendo ya."
    nor "We noticed that no one is eating anymore."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1114
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5c4f3b50:

    # mar "Suponemos que os estáis reservando para los pasteles."
    mom "We assume you're saving yourselves for the cakes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1115
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d36f0935:

    # nor "Con lo que sería el momento para que las chicas soplaran las velas."
    nor "So, it would be a good time for the girls to blow the candles out."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1116
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3b9f6dee:

    # mar "Y nos comamos el pastel antes de que este calor lo derrita."
    mom "And let's eat the cakes before this heat melts them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1117
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e889d994:

    # mom "No os preocupéis. Hay más pasteles, no sólo estos tres."
    mom "Don't worry. There are more cakes, not just these three."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1118
translate english c19s003_Gifts_492dfc10:

    # nor "Después, cuando todos vosotros estéis hartos de pastel, haremos la entrega de regalos y no os molestaremos más."
    nor "Afterwards, when you've all had your fill of cake, we'll do the gift-giving and won't bother you anymore."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1119
translate english c19s003_Gifts_fe38e22c:

    # todas "¡Sí!"
    todas "Yes!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1121
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d5a6db69:

    # "Las chicas soplan las velas rodeadas por los regalos mientras todo el mundo aplaude."
    "The girls blow out the candles surrounded by presents while everyone applauds."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1122
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b56fcced:

    # "Se reparten las porciones de pastel y todo el mundo vuelve a sus conversaciones. Todas las chicas menos Betty piden una ración pequeña. Jamaal pide una ración grande de cada pastel."
    "The slices of cake are passed around, and everyone goes back to their conversations. All the girls except Betty ask for a small slice. Jamaal orders a large slice of each cake."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1123
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0da62fda:

    # "Pruebas un pedacito MUY pequeño de cada uno. Como siempre, están deliciosos, pero la experiencia te ha enseñado que tres trozos normales son demasiados."
    "You taste a VERY small piece of each. As always, they're delicious, but experience has taught you that three regular slices are too many."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1124
translate english c19s003_Gifts_be4c42f1:

    # "El niño gordo de tu pasado grita angustiado en tu mente."
    "The fat kid from your past cries out in anguish in your mind."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1125
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1cc36a4f:

    # "Todo el mundo se vuelve a dividir en grupos para comer el pastel antes de abrir los regalos."
    "Everyone splits into groups again to eat the cake before opening the presents."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1127
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d3b54025:

    # "Te diriges al grupo de [dap]. Aún no has tenido oportunidad de charlar con ellas."
    "You head over to the [dap] group. You haven't had a chance to chat with them yet."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1128
translate english c19s003_Gifts_304d2606:

    # mc "¿Qué tal, chicas? ¿Ya os habéis comido el pastel?"
    mc "How are you girls doing? Have you already eaten your cake?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1129
translate english c19s003_Gifts_57b2d432:

    # deb "[dap] tiene prisa por que todo el mundo se lo acabe. Tiene ganas de abrir los regalos. *Risa* No nos ha prestado atención hasta que no nos hemos acabado el pastel."
    deb "[dap] is in a hurry for everyone to finish it. She's looking forward to opening the presents. *Laugh* She wouldn't pay attention to us until we finished our cake."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1130
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3a8e31b3:

    # dap "Es lógico. Solo se cumplen 19 una vez. Bueno, en mi caso dos. Hoy y mañana. *Risa*"
    dap "It's logical. You only turn 19 once. Well, in my case twice. Today and tomorrow. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1131
translate english c19s003_Gifts_394e26cf:

    # oma "Ahora solo falta que Jamaal y Betty se acaben los suyos. *Risa* Creo que la impaciencia está matando a [dap]."
    oma "Now all that's left is for Jamaal and Betty to finish theirs. *Laugh* I think impatience is killing [dap]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1132
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f6f5f399:

    # mc "Bueno, no hemos tenido tanta gente en una fiesta nunca. La comida está siendo mucho más larga."
    mc "Well, we haven't had this many people at a party ever. The lunch is getting a lot longer."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1134
translate english c19s003_Gifts_71559710:

    # dap "Y más gente son más regalos para abrir. *Risa* Va a llevar un rato..."
    dap "And more people means more presents to open. *Laugh* It's going to take a while..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1135
translate english c19s003_Gifts_842b4d8d:

    # mc "Y todavía quedará mucha tarde para seguir charlando."
    mc "And there will still be plenty of afternoon left to keep chatting."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1137
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3970537f:

    # deb "Y podríamos jugar a algo en la piscina. Estar tan cerca del agua y no meterme dentro me está matando."
    deb "And we could play something in the pool. Being so close to the water and not getting in is killing me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1138
translate english c19s003_Gifts_37d243e2:

    # mc "Habló la sirenita. *Risa* Supongo que después de abrir los regalos habrá pasado el tiempo prudencial para bañarse después de comer."
    mc "The little mermaid has spoken. *Laugh* I guess after opening the presents it will have been a prudent time to swim after eating."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1140
translate english c19s003_Gifts_46bf8553:

    # oma "Las madres latinas siempre dicen que son dos horas desde que acabas de comer hasta que te puedes bañar. Espero que [mar] y [nor] no tengan genes latinos o sean más razonables."
    oma "Latina mothers always say it's two hours from the time you finish eating until you can take a dip. I hope [mar] and [nor] don't have Latino genes or are more reasonable."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1141
translate english c19s003_Gifts_a8469e3a:

    # mc "Y que la apertura de regalos no dure tanto. *Risa*"
    mc "And may the gift opening not last that long. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1143
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b7ffe0fb:

    # dap "Creo que todo el mundo ha acabado de comerse el pastel ya. Voy a preguntarle a mi madre si podemos abrir los regalos."
    dap "I think everyone is done eating the cake now. I'm going to ask my mom if we can open the presents."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1144
translate english c19s003_Gifts_332d4f92:

    # mc "No te preocupes, ya voy yo a hacerlo."
    mc "Don't worry, I'll go ask her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1145
translate english c19s003_Gifts_6301f5f1:

    # oma "¿Ya nos abandonas? Sólo has estado un par de minutos con nosotras."
    oma "You're leaving us already? You've only been with us for a couple of minutes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1146
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f2f6bd0e:

    # mc "Tu no quieres que a [dap] le entre un ataque de ansiedad, ¿verdad? *Risa* Pero no te preocupes, después de los regalos tendré tiempo para todas vosotras también."
    mc "You don't want [dap] to have an anxiety attack, do you? *Laugh* But don't worry, after the presents I'll have time for all of you too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1147
translate english c19s003_Gifts_66ce6f9e:

    # deb "Mejor que no. *Risa* Ve a preguntarle a [nor]."
    deb "Better not have an EVEN more anxious [dap]. *Laugh* Go ask [nor]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1148
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7bce90a4:

    # mc "Ahora vuelvo."
    mc "I'll be right back."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1150
translate english c19s003_Gifts_2d2b2875:

    # "Preguntas a [mar] y [nor] sobre la apertura de regalos."
    "You ask [mar] and [nor] about the gift opening."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1151
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f097e388:

    # "Como cada año se sorprenden de lo mucho que han aguantado las chicas antes de pedir permiso para abrirlos."
    "Like every year they are surprised at how long the girls have held out before asking permission to open them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1152
translate english c19s003_Gifts_da1e9db6:

    # "Todo el mundo se reúne alrededor de la pérgola para ver cómo reaccionan las chicas a cada uno de los regalos."
    "Everyone gathers around the pergola to see how the girls react to each of the presents."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1154
translate english c19s003_Gifts_00690be5:

    # "Todas las chicas reciben ropa. Mucha ropa. En la mayoría de los casos aciertan con sus gustos."
    "Every one of the girls gets clothes. Lots of clothes. In most cases they get their tastes right."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1155
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1bd082a1:

    # "También reciben vales para ir a un spa, colonias, complementos..."
    "They also receive vouchers to go to a spa, colognes, accessories..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1156
translate english c19s003_Gifts_aad9effa:

    # "Todos los regalos son recibidos con sonrisas y abrazos de agradecimiento."
    " Every gift is received with smiles and hugs of gratitude."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1159
translate english c19s003_Gifts_25e705e9:

    # "Los cuadros de Maddie son una sensación. Las chicas están contentísimas con ellos y todo el mundo se ríe con lo adorable que está Zeus."
    "Maddie's paintings are a hit. The girls are thrilled with them, and everyone laughs at how adorable Zeus looks."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1160
translate english c19s003_Gifts_f52b2dd7:

    # "El cuadro de [dap] es diferente del que estaba pintando Maddie cuando estuviste en su casa. Le tienes que preguntar por qué."
    "[dap]'s painting is different from the one Maddie had half done when you were at her house. You have to ask her why."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1162
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e6d54ec6:

    # "Las cajas que ha traído Maddie son cuadros personalizados para las chicas. Les encantan y todo el mundo se ríe con lo adorable que está Zeus, el gato de Maddie."
    "The boxes Maddie brought are custom paintings for the girls. They love them and everyone laughs at how adorable Zeus, Maddie's cat, looks."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1163
translate english c19s003_Gifts_99b9f6d5:

    # "Las chicas dicen que los colgarán en sus habitaciones antes de acabar el día."
    "The girls say they will hang them in their rooms before the end of the day."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1165
translate english c19s003_Gifts_478da912:

    # "[emm] es la primera en llegar a tu regalo para ella."
    "[emm] is the first to arrive at your gift for her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1166
translate english c19s003_Gifts_0750d1ad:

    # emm "¿Un sobre, [mc]? No has sido tan cutre como para regalarme dinero, ¿verdad?"
    emm "An envelope, [mc]? You haven't been so cheap as to give me money, have you?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1167
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1c32212c:

    # mc "*Risa* Ábrelo y lo sabrás. Pero no, no es dinero."
    mc "*Laugh* Open it and you'll know. But no, it isn't money."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1169
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e18aee28:

    # emm "¿QUÉ? ¿Un vale de alquiler por un Ferrarini rosa? ¿Dónde has encontrado esto?"
    emm "WHAT? A rental voucher for a pink Ferrarini? Where did you find it?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1170
translate english c19s003_Gifts_79e24cc9:

    # mc "En Monterey. Es el único en todo el estado fuera de LA."
    mc "In Monterey. It's the only one in the entire state outside of LA."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1172
translate english c19s003_Gifts_52c65b1d:

    # emm "¡Me encanta! Cuando el otro día dije que quería uno no creía que existieran de alquiler."
    emm "I love it! When I mentioned the other day that I wanted one, I didn't think they existed to rent."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1173
translate english c19s003_Gifts_b460952f:

    # mc "*Risa* Hace una semana que lo reservé. Tienes que usar el vale durante los próximos siete días."
    mc "*Laugh* It's been a week since I pre-booked it. You have to use the voucher within the next seven days, confirming the date in advance."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1174
translate english c19s003_Gifts_50cede59:

    # emm "¡Pues hay que organizar un viaje a Monterey! ¡Estoy impaciente!"
    emm "Well, we have to organize a trip to Monterey! I can't wait!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1176
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8846acee:

    # "La siguiente en llegar a tu regalo es [dap]."
    "Next to arrive to your gift is [dap]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1177
translate english c19s003_Gifts_466a6e26:

    # dap "¡Hey! Esto pesa... ¿Qué es?"
    dap "Hey! This is heavy... What is it?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1178
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1724be0a:

    # mc "Lo tendrás que abrir para saberlo. *Risa*"
    mc "You'll have to open it to find out. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1180
translate english c19s003_Gifts_72ceeaed:

    # dap "¡Es el Super Gamertron 4090! ¡Es mejor que el portátil que quería comprarme!"
    dap "It's the Super Gamertron 4090! It's better than the laptop I wanted to buy to replace my old one!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1181
translate english c19s003_Gifts_1a14174b:

    # mc "Pues ya no necesitas comprártelo. Ya puedes jubilar tu viejo portátil."
    mc "Well, you don't need to buy it anymore. You can retire your old laptop now."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1182
translate english c19s003_Gifts_834fb5ec:

    # dap "Pero te has pasado mucho. ¡Es carísimo!"
    dap "But you've gone too far. It's very expensive!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1184
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3743811b:

    # dap "¡Gracias, [mc]! Es una auténtica pasada de portátil."
    dap "Thanks, [mc]! It's a real kick-ass laptop."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1185
translate english c19s003_Gifts_628fd6f6:

    # mc "Disfrútalo, pero no te pases la vida encerrada en tu habitación jugando. *Risa*"
    mc "Enjoy it, but don't spend the rest of your life cooped up in your room playing games. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1186
translate english c19s003_Gifts_72133550:

    # dap "Tranquilo, no lo haré. Hay cosas demasiado buenas aquí fuera."
    dap "Don't worry, I won't do it. There are too many good things out here."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1188
translate english c19s003_Gifts_81e3e407:

    # "La última en llegar a tu regalo es [eri]."
    "The last one to get to your present is [eri]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1189
translate english c19s003_Gifts_7324a3c8:

    # eri "¡Qué cajita más mona! ¿Un anillo?"
    eri "What a cute little box! Is it a ring?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1190
translate english c19s003_Gifts_998bae65:

    # mc "Tú también vas a tener que abrirlo para descubrirlo."
    mc "You're going to have to open it to find out, too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1192
translate english c19s003_Gifts_04d89bbe:

    # eri "¡Oh! ¡Son preciosos!"
    eri "Oh, they're beautiful!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1194
translate english c19s003_Gifts_55acbb6c:

    # eri "¡Me encanta el triskelion!"
    eri "I love the triskelion!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1195
translate english c19s003_Gifts_91052178:

    # mc "Al representar la evolución de una persona, pasado, presente, y futuro, creo que te pegan. Los diseñé y los hice fabricar para ti."
    mc "As it represents a person's evolution, past, present, and future, I thought it suits you. I designed the earrings and had them made just for you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1196
translate english c19s003_Gifts_44a5da68:

    # todas "¡Qué bonitos!"
    todas "They are beautiful!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1198
translate english c19s003_Gifts_3eacd17c:

    # eri "Déjame ponérmelos un momento."
    eri "Give me a moment to put them on."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1200
translate english c19s003_Gifts_9880e837:

    # eri "¡Muchas gracias, [mc]! ¡Se acaban de convertir en mis pendientes favoritos!"
    eri "Thank you so much, [mc]! They just became my favorite earrings!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1201
translate english c19s003_Gifts_588a4e65:

    # mc "Te quedan muy bien. Obsidiana sobre plata. Son tus colores."
    mc "They look great on you. Obsidian over silver. Those are your colors, right?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1203
translate english c19s003_Gifts_58b9e4fb:

    # "Después de eso siguen abriendo más regalos y dando más abrazos hasta que se acaban las cajas."
    "After that, they keep opening more gifts and giving more hugs until all the boxes are empty."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1205
translate english c19s003_Gifts_48da537d:

    # "Mientras unos cuantos ayudáis a las chicas a subir sus regalos a sus habitaciones, otros recogéis toda la comida y los platos sucios."
    "While a few of you help the girls carry their gifts up to their rooms, others pick up all the remaining food and dirty dishes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1206
translate english c19s003_Gifts_95c286b9:

    # "Vais a comer sobras durante unos días. [nor] y [mar] siempre cocinan demasiado."
    "You're going to eat leftovers for a few days. [nor] and [mar] always cook too much food."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1207
translate english c19s003_Gifts_d6b2303e:

    # dap "Propongo una lucha de caballos en la piscina. Podemos hacer equipos..."
    dap "I propose a horse fight in the pool. We can make teams..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1208
translate english c19s003_Gifts_5789983e:

    # mc "Mucho ejercicio después de comer, ¿no? Aunque yo me apunto."
    mc "Too much exercise after lunch, isn't it? I'm in, though."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1209
translate english c19s003_Gifts_10d194be:

    # mcp "(Tan solo espero que no pase lo mismo que la última vez.)"
    mcp "(I just hope it doesn't end up like the last time.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1210
translate english c19s003_Gifts_dbbd2da2:

    # emm "Yo montaré a [mc] como la última vez. ¡Somos invencibles! Lo siento, [eri]."
    emm "I'll ride [mc] like last time. We're invincible! I'm sorry, [eri]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1211
translate english c19s003_Gifts_cc92d099:

    # eri "Podemos hacer equipos topless contra top. No sé si cuadran los números."
    eri "We can make two teams, topless girls against girls with tops. I don't know if the numbers add up."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1213
translate english c19s003_Gifts_e886c995:

    # nor "Conmigo no contéis. Yo necesito reposar la comida un rato."
    nor "Don't count on me. I need to rest for a while after the meal."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1214
translate english c19s003_Gifts_669179a0:

    # mee "Yo también... Como dice [mc], demasiado ejercicio después de comer. Necesito un poco de descanso a la sombra."
    mee "Me too... As [mc] says, too much exercise after eating. I need some rest in the shade."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1215
translate english c19s003_Gifts_8037e8ad:

    # kat "Yo me apunto, no he comido tanto como para perderme la diversión. Aunque es difícil decidir..."
    kat "I'm in, I haven't eaten enough to miss out on the fun. It's hard to decide though..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1216
translate english c19s003_Gifts_88eadbbb:

    # jam "Conmigo tampoco contéis. *Risa*"
    jam "Don't count on me either. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1217
translate english c19s003_Gifts_11f06190:

    # "Al final, tan solo doce decidís lanzaros a la piscina. Podréis hacer dos equipos de seis."
    "In the end, only twelve of you decide to jump into the pool. You will be able to make two teams of six."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1221
translate english c19s004_PhoneMessage_d1504cf8:

    # "Mientras estáis discutiendo cómo distribuís los grupos, suena tu móvil"
    "While you are discussing how you divide up the teams, since [eri]'s idea didn't add up, your cell phone rings."

