# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1587
translate english c19s004_Betty_e359f8d2:

    # mc "¿Ha pasado algo, Tía Betty? Te veo... ¿triste?"
    mc "Has something happened, Aunt Betty? You look... sad?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1590
translate english c19s004_Betty_41d79523:

    # bet "Felicidades por haber salido a la luz con tus chicas, aunque no hayas tenido mucho que ver."
    bet "Congratulations on going public with your girls, even if you didn't have much to do with it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1592
translate english c19s004_Betty_c8e94463:

    # bet "Felicidades por haber salido a la luz, aunque no hayas tenido mucho que ver."
    bet "Congratulations on going public, even if you didn't have much to do with it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1594
translate english c19s004_Betty_cd4ae234:

    # bet "Excepto tu pequeño asentimiento antes de la revelación. Creo que le ha pasado desapercibido a la mayoría."
    bet "Except for your little nod before the revelation. I think it has gone unnoticed by most."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1596
translate english c19s004_Betty_113c75fb:

    # bet "Y felicidades por tu futura paternidad."
    bet "And congratulations on your future fatherhood."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1597
translate english c19s004_Betty_abe924e8:

    # mc "Gracias, pero..."
    mc "Thank you, but..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1598
translate english c19s004_Betty_a5f7e8c3:

    # mc "No parece que te alegres demasiado. Y no has respondido a mi pregunta."
    mc "You don't seem to be too happy about it. And you haven't answered my question."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1600
translate english c19s004_Betty_5a2702bf:

    # bet "No es eso... es que la sobredosis de noticias me ha dejado un poco anonadada."
    bet "It's not that... it's just that the overdose of news has left me a bit dumbfounded."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1603
translate english c19s004_Betty_d7480c8d:

    # bet "Has tenido suerte que la revelación de Olivia haya desviado la atención sobre la tuya."
    bet "You were lucky that Olivia's revelation drew attention away from yours."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1605
translate english c19s004_Betty_00031a46:

    # bet "Podrías haberte encontrado con un problema con las noticias simultáneas y con las chicas a las que les gustaría poder dar una noticia similar y a las que no has hecho mucho caso."
    bet "You might have run into a problem with simultaneous news, and with girls who would like to deliver similar news and whom you haven't paid much attention to."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1606
translate english c19s004_Betty_ba092666:

    # mc "Si te refieres a Kiara, aún no hemos tenido la oportunidad de hablar..."
    mc "If you're referring to Kiara, we haven't had a chance to talk yet..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1608
translate english c19s004_Betty_4357113e:

    # bet "No solo a Kiara, cielo... Ver a toda la familia aquí, y ver cómo te miraban las que no tenían noticias que dar sobre ti..."
    bet "Not just Kiara, dear... Seeing the whole family here, and seeing how the girls looked at you, the ones who had no news to give..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1609
translate english c19s004_Betty_86582942:

    # bet "Alguna parecía querer estar en posición de poder darla."
    bet "Some of them seemed to want to give news of their own."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1610
translate english c19s004_Betty_b3ca2984:

    # mc "Tú tampoco tenías ninguna noticia que dar sobre mí. *Risa* ¿También te hubiera gustado?"
    mc "You didn't have any news to give about me either. *Laugh* Would you have liked to have one, too?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1612
translate english c19s004_Betty_0cc2f8c2:

    # bet "No apliques mi psicología contra mí. *Risa triste*"
    bet "Don't apply my psychology against me. *Sad Laughter*."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1613
translate english c19s004_Betty_27aff9ed:

    # bet "Hoy han salido a la luz noticias importantes que una vieja monja nunca podrá igualar."
    bet "Today, some important news has come to light that an old nun will never be able to match."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1614
translate english c19s004_Betty_ef8b341d:

    # mc "No es una competición para ver quién da la noticia más grande."
    mc "It's not a competition to see who breaks the biggest news."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1615
translate english c19s004_Betty_b811fab2:

    # mc "Por raro que parezca, me parece más importante la noticia de Meemaw. Que quiera confiar en todos nosotros y la mudanza. Creo que la mudanza te ha sorprendido incluso a ti."
    mc "Oddly enough, I find Meemaw's news more important. That she wants to trust all of us and move here. I think the moving came as a surprise even for you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1617
translate english c19s004_Betty_97daa0f6:

    # mc "La mudanza y el cáncer. Creo que la mudanza te ha sorprendido incluso a ti."
    mc "The moving and the cancer. I think the moving has caught even you by surprise."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1619
translate english c19s004_Betty_9e0f4c0b:

    # bet "Un poco..."
    bet "A little..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1620
translate english c19s004_Betty_5c402a64:

    # mcp "(Obviamente le pasa algo de lo que no quiere hablar tan cerca del resto.)"
    mcp "(There's obviously something going on with her that she doesn't want to talk about so close to the rest.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1621
translate english c19s004_Betty_37998e47:

    # mc "Antes has dicho que querías hablar conmigo. ¿Te parece un buen momento?"
    mc "You said earlier that you wanted to talk to me. Does this seem like a good time?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1622
translate english c19s004_Betty_aa288525:

    # bet "Sí, pero... ¿podemos ir a sentarnos?"
    bet "Yes, but... can we go and sit down?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1623
translate english c19s004_Betty_890c041b:

    # mc "Por supuesto."
    mc "Of course."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1625
translate english c19s004_Betty_0fc7d311:

    # mc "Dime, ¿de qué querías hablar?"
    mc "Tell me, what did you want to talk about?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1626
translate english c19s004_Betty_8ecb9d01:

    # bet "Desde que te lo he dicho han cambiado tanto las cosas..."
    bet "Since I told you I need to talk, so many things have changed..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1627
translate english c19s004_Betty_82a2fe7f:

    # bet "Esta mañana he ido a misa... con el coche de [nor]."
    bet "This morning, I went to mass... with [nor]'s car."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1628
translate english c19s004_Betty_24821487:

    # mc "Muy valiente por tu parte. *Risa*"
    mc "That was very brave of you. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1630
translate english c19s004_Betty_8cf0bafc:

    # bet "*Risa triste* Sí... es más viejo aún que yo... o al menos tiene más achaques..."
    bet "*Sad laughter* Yeah... it's even older than me... or, at least, it has more ailments..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1631
translate english c19s004_Betty_8850bccf:

    # mc "No eres vieja, Tía Betty... digamos que eres vintage. *Risa* Pero aún estás muy bien... de salud, me refiero."
    mc "You're not old, Aunt Betty... let's just say you're vintage. *Laugh* But you're still fine... health-wise, I mean."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1633
translate english c19s004_Betty_18c81b3f:

    # bet "Bueno... hoy me he saltado un Stop al volver de misa. No ha pasado nada grave, excepto que me ha parado la policía."
    bet "Well... today I missed a stop sign on my way home from the church. Nothing serious happened, except that I got pulled over by the police."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1634
translate english c19s004_Betty_91c7642d:

    # mc "¿Estás así por una multa? No pasa nada. A Mamá le ponen como mínimo una al mes."
    mc "Are you like this because of a fine? It's okay. Mom gets at least one a month."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1636
translate english c19s004_Betty_a061466f:

    # bet "No es por la multa... cuando el agente me ha pedido la documentación... mi permiso de conducir está caducado desde hace más de un año."
    bet "It's not because of the fine... when the officer asked me for my documentation... my driver's license has been expired for more than a year."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1637
translate english c19s004_Betty_ac67df24:

    # bet "Ni me había dado cuenta de cuándo caducaba."
    bet "I didn't even notice when it expired."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1638
translate english c19s004_Betty_c73045ad:

    # bet "El agente ha sido muy amable y me ha dejado volver a casa conduciendo, pero voy a tener que hacer unas gestiones en la DMV para renovar la licencia."
    bet "The officer was very nice and let me drive home, but I'm going to have to do some paperwork at the DMV to renew my license."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1639
translate english c19s004_Betty_2f2a790c:

    # mc "Y quieres que te lleve a renovarla, no hay ningún problema."
    mc "And you want me to take you there to renew it? No problem at all."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1641
translate english c19s004_Betty_f5c29cf4:

    # bet "No hace falta. Me ha dicho que lo puedo hacer online, pero no voy a poder conducir hasta que llegue el nuevo permiso."
    bet "No need. He said I can do it online, but I won't be able to drive until the new license arrives."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1642
translate english c19s004_Betty_f8be02d5:

    # bet "Y aquí es donde se pone raro. Te iba a pedir que me llevases a Monterey antes de saber lo que le habías regalado a [emm]."
    bet "And this is where it gets weird. I was going to ask you to take me to Monterey before I knew what you had gifted to [emm]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1643
translate english c19s004_Betty_f561ecab:

    # mc "¿A Monterey? ¿Qué tienes que hacer allí? No hay ningún problema en llevarte. No lo habría aunque no le hubiera regalado el alquiler a [emm]."
    mc "To Monterey? What do you have to do there? There's no problem taking you there. There wouldn't have been even if I hadn't gifted the rental car to [emm]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1645
translate english c19s004_Betty_32b311f3:

    # bet "¿Qué te han contado de por qué dejé África?"
    bet "What did they tell you about why I left Africa?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1646
translate english c19s004_Betty_a8fa27a0:

    # mc "Nada. Creía que volviste para unas vacaciones o algo así y te quedaste por lo de Meemaw."
    mc "Nothing. I thought you came back for a vacation or something and stayed because of Meemaw's health."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1648
translate english c19s004_Betty_80b5fd53:

    # bet "Volví porque me expulsaron de Tanzania..."
    bet "I came back because I was expelled from Tanzania..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1649
translate english c19s004_Betty_7d703b8a:

    # bet "No del país, sino de la Iglesia de allí. Me abrieron expediente... por enfrentarme a un Obispo local."
    bet "Well, not from the country, but from the Church there. They opened a report against me... for confronting a local bishop."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1650
translate english c19s004_Betty_2d7a7ac6:

    # mc "¿Qué hiciste, Tía Betty?"
    mc "What did you do, Aunt Betty?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1652
translate english c19s004_Betty_dc65b1f9:

    # bet "Negarme a operar el cerebro de alguien para curarle la homosexualidad. O lobotomizarlo si no era posible hacerlo."
    bet "I refused to operate on someone's brain to cure him of homosexuality. Or lobotomize him if it was not possible to do so."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1653
translate english c19s004_Betty_f112c7ee:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Eso aún pasa?"
    mc "What? Is that still happening?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1655
translate english c19s004_Betty_2b7fcdd0:

    # bet "No, no pasa. Pero el Obispo quería demostrar al jefe de uno de los kraal, aldeas Masái, que aún sigue religiones tradicionales, el poder de Cristo..."
    bet "No, it doesn't happen. But the bishop wanted to demonstrate to the chief of one of the kraal, Maasai villages, which still follow traditional religions, the power of Christ..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1656
translate english c19s004_Betty_69646794:

    # bet "Aunque fuera de una forma rastrera y mintiéndole. Si el jefe se convertía, parte del kraal también lo haría... y el hijo gay de un jefe era una oportunidad."
    bet "Even if it was in a sneaky way and lying to him. If the chief converted, part of the kraal would too... and the gay son of a chief was an opportunity."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1657
translate english c19s004_Betty_080b2c91:

    # bet "Mucha gente en Tanzania piensa que la homosexualidad no está bien y que los homosexuales no tienen lugar en la sociedad."
    bet "Many people in Tanzania think that homosexuality is not right and that homosexuals have no place in society."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1658
translate english c19s004_Betty_3b5202cf:

    # bet "Un jefe con un hijo gay, por muy integrado que esté en la sociedad tanzana, tiene un problema grave."
    bet "A chief with a gay son, no matter how integrated he may be in Tanzanian society, has a serious problem."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1659
translate english c19s004_Betty_98971d5c:

    # mc "¡Eso es terrible! ¿Qué pasó?"
    mc "That's terrible! What happened?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1661
translate english c19s004_Betty_4bac6634:

    # bet "Que me negué a operar un cerebro completamente sano para buscar algo que no se puede extirpar."
    bet "I refused to operate on a completely healthy brain to look for something that cannot be removed."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1662
translate english c19s004_Betty_6601e231:

    # bet "Se lo dije al jefe y al chico, y eso llevó a problemas con el Obispo."
    bet "I told the chief and the boy, and that led to problems with the bishop."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1663
translate english c19s004_Betty_aa30d813:

    # bet "Él sabe que estaba mintiendo, pero en vez de reconocerlo, me echó las culpas a mí y consiguió que la Iglesia me echara de allí. Había socavado su imagen."
    bet "He knew he was lying, but instead of admitting it, he blamed it on me and got the Church to kick me out. I had undermined his image."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1664
translate english c19s004_Betty_f01efb88:

    # mc "Pero podrías haberte quedado aunque no fuera trabajando para la Iglesia, ¿no?"
    mc "But you could have stayed even if it wasn't working for the Church, couldn't you?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1666
translate english c19s004_Betty_5dbca6a5:

    # bet "No, [mc]. El permiso de residencia y trabajo lo tenía gracias a la Iglesia. Puedo visitar el país a nivel particular, pero no trabajar allí."
    bet "No, [mc]. I had the residence and work permit thanks to the Church. I can visit the country on a private level, but not work there."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1667
translate english c19s004_Betty_40a2ab04:

    # bet "Y adoro ese país."
    bet "And I love that country."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1668
translate english c19s004_Betty_b0c668cb:

    # mc "Lo que no entiendo es qué tiene esto que ver con la visita a Monterey."
    mc "What I don't understand is what this has to do with the Monterey visit."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1670
translate english c19s004_Betty_e2234509:

    # bet "Hoy he estado hablando con el Padre Matthews en la iglesia. Me ha dicho que mis papeles han llegado ya desde Florida y que debería ir al Obispado de Monterey."
    bet "I was talking to Father Matthews at church today. He told me that my papers have already arrived from Florida and that I should go to the Bishopric in Monterey."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1671
translate english c19s004_Betty_62b78b45:

    # bet "Como visita de cortesía y para informarme sobre cómo está mi expediente."
    bet "As a courtesy visit and to get an update on how my file is doing."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1672
translate english c19s004_Betty_aa98d535:

    # mc "¿Tus papeles? No lo entiendo. ¿Tienes que informar a la Iglesia de dónde vives?"
    mc "Your papers? I don't understand, do you have to inform the Church where you live?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1674
translate english c19s004_Betty_28266ce5:

    # bet "Normalmente no. Pero con un expediente sancionador en curso... Es lo mejor. No quiero parecer una monja rebelde más de lo que ya lo parezco."
    bet "Not normally. But with a sanctioning file in progress... It's for the best. I don't want to look like a rebellious nun any more than I already do."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1675
translate english c19s004_Betty_ad1e8093:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. No hay ningún problema. Puedo llevarte cuando vaya con [emm]. *Risa* Aunque no iremos al Obispado con el Ferrarini."
    mc "I understand. It's not a problem at all. I can take you there when I go with [emm]. *Laugh* We're not going to the Bishopric with the Ferrarini, though."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1677
translate english c19s004_Betty_581b8f5e:

    # bet "*Risa* No, no quedaría muy profesional."
    bet "*Laugh* No, it wouldn't look very professional. Poverty vow and stuff."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1678
translate english c19s004_Betty_c31bd86d:

    # mc "¿Y por eso estás tan... triste? ¿Una multa y una visita al Obispado?"
    mc "And that's why you're so... sad? A fine and a visit to the Bishopric?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1680
translate english c19s004_Betty_1a32b7f8:

    # bet "No es eso. Me siento inútil. Hace un año que no piso un quirófano. Lo intenté en Florida. Hay buenos hospitales católicos allí."
    bet "It's not that. I feel useless. I haven't been in an operating room for a year. I tried to work in Florida. There are good Catholic hospitals there."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1681
translate english c19s004_Betty_de9f8ba6:

    # bet "Y me dijeron que no podían darme ningún puesto hasta que no se resolviera mi expediente."
    bet "And they told me that they could not give me any position until my file was cleared."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1683
translate english c19s004_Betty_0ee07c20:

    # bet "Llevo un tiempo pensando que quizás acabe relegada en un convento. E ir a Monterey me tiene asustada."
    bet "I've been thinking for a while that I might end up relegated to a convent. And I'm scared about going to Monterey."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1684
translate english c19s004_Betty_72f3df68:

    # mc "¿Van a perder una cirujana porque te negaste a operar lo inoperable?"
    mc "Are they going to lose a surgeon because you refused to operate on the inoperable?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1686
translate english c19s004_Betty_768c79bc:

    # bet "No, es posible que releguen a una monja rebelde que desobedeció una orden de un Obispo. Y, además, lo dejó en mal lugar."
    bet "No, it is possible that they relegate a rebellious nun who disobeyed an order from a bishop. And, moreover, she embarrassed him in front of \"heathens\"."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1687
translate english c19s004_Betty_ca878c65:

    # bet "Para ellos, puedo seguir sirviendo a Dios en un convento igual que lo hago en un quirófano."
    bet "For them, I can continue to serve God in a convent just as well as I do in an operating room."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1688
translate english c19s004_Betty_09faa47d:

    # mc "¿Incluso si había razones médicas para hacerlo?"
    mc "Even if there were medical reasons for refusing doing it?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1690
translate english c19s004_Betty_72fa1c9f:

    # bet "A los Obispos eso les da lo mismo. Piensa en ellos como políticos más que como sacerdotes."
    bet "The bishops don't care. Think of them as politicians rather than priests."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1691
translate english c19s004_Betty_433100f4:

    # mc "Y que Meemaw diga que cuenta con tu sueldo para la mudanza es la gota que ha colmado el vaso, ¿no?"
    mc "And Meemaw saying she's counting on your salary for the moving is the straw that broke the camel's back, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1693
translate english c19s004_Betty_4e1fed18:

    # bet "Más o menos. Desde que llegué a Florida estoy cobrando un sueldo reducido, hasta que se resuelva el expediente. Es suficiente para colaborar, pero no para lo que quiere Olivia."
    bet "More or less. Since I arrived in Florida I've been receiving a reduced salary, until the file is sorted out. It's enough to collaborate, but not for what Olivia wants."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1694
translate english c19s004_Betty_6f20622b:

    # bet "Si acabo en un convento será aún menos. Si depende de mi sueldo..."
    bet "If I end up in a convent, it will be even less. If she depends on my salary..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1695
translate english c19s004_Betty_cd9714cc:

    # mc "Si depende de tu sueldo y éste desaparece o se reduce, el resto de la familia colaboraremos."
    mc "If she depends on your salary and it disappears or is reduced, the rest of the family will collaborate."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1696
translate english c19s004_Betty_04e2e737:

    # mc "Tenemos una empresa millonaria. Supongo que como CEO tendré un sueldo... algo más alto que el de una monja."
    mc "We have a multi-million dollar company. I guess as CEO I'll have a salary... somewhat higher than a nun's."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1698
translate english c19s004_Betty_987feb0a:

    # bet "Es tan fácil olvidarse de eso..."
    bet "It's so easy to forget about that..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1699
translate english c19s004_Betty_1ac6fd98:

    # mc "Vale. Un problema resuelto. El permiso de conducir lo renovaremos mañana online. El transporte a Monterey también está resuelto. Hay que llevar a [emm] de todos modos."
    mc "Okay. One problem solved. We will renew the driver's license online tomorrow. The ride to Monterey is also solved. We need to take [emm] there anyway."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1700
translate english c19s004_Betty_83ee38ab:

    # bet "Las casualidades que pasan en esta familia..."
    bet "The coincidences that happen in this family..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1701
translate english c19s004_Betty_ab7c5950:

    # mc "¿Algún problema más del que quieras hablar?"
    mc "Any more problems you want to talk about?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1703
translate english c19s004_Betty_71b1082b:

    # bet "No, pero un abrazo sí que aceptaría..."
    bet "No, but I would accept a hug..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1704
translate english c19s004_Betty_1fe2d1ce:

    # mc "De esos tengo muchos y no se van a agotar."
    mc "I have a lot of those and I'm not going to run out of them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1706
translate english c19s004_Betty_08928961:

    # bet "Gracias por ayudar a esta vieja, [mc]. Te has convertido en el hombre de la casa sin que nadie se diera cuenta. Sin que nadie te lo pidiera."
    bet "Thanks for helping this old lady, [mc]. You became the man of the house without anyone noticing. Without anyone asking you to."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1707
translate english c19s004_Betty_93101b7a:

    # bet "Cada día que pasa te pareces más a John..."
    bet "Every day you look more like John..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1709
translate english c19s004_Betty_21981656:

    # bet "Y ahora además también vas a ser padre. No sé cuándo vas a tener tiempo para ti."
    bet "And now you're also going to be a father. I don't know when you're going to have time for yourself."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1710
translate english c19s004_Betty_4682b4ea:

    # bet "Tienes que guardar tiempo para hacer las cosas que te gustan o al final explotarás."
    bet "You have to save time to do the things you enjoy, or you'll eventually explode."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1711
translate english c19s004_Betty_396539c5:

    # mc "Ya lo hago, Tía Betty. Dar abrazos es uno de mis mayores hobbies."
    mc "I already do, Aunt Betty. Giving hugs is one of my biggest hobbies."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1713
translate english c19s004_Betty_440839a0:

    # bet "*Risa* Te conformas con poco."
    bet "*Laugh* You settle for too little."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1714
translate english c19s004_Betty_ebf89824:

    # mc "Si el dormitorio no me da más trabajo que hacer la contabilidad y la compra, me tengo que buscar entretenimientos, ¿no? *Risa*"
    mc "If the Dorm doesn't give me any more work than doing the bookkeeping and shopping, I need to find myself some entertainment, don't I? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1715
translate english c19s004_Betty_b9126f5e:

    # mc "Y estar con mis chicas es una de las mejores cosas que hay. Sois 22 aquí. No puedo pedir estar mejor acompañado."
    mc "And being with my girls is one of the best things there is. There are 22 of you here. I couldn't ask to be in better company."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1716
translate english c19s004_Betty_a3deeba9:

    # mc "Incluso Jamaal está bien para pasar un rato. *Risa* Pero a él no voy a darle abrazos."
    mc "Even Jamaal is okay to hang out with for a while. *Laugh* But I'm not going to hug him."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1718
translate english c19s004_Betty_49ccb84e:

    # bet "Debería dejarte ir o el resto de las chicas me van a odiar por acapararte."
    bet "I should let you go, or the rest of the girls are going to hate me for monopolizing you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1719
translate english c19s004_Betty_61151f95:

    # mc "Deberías disfrutar el abrazo y callar. Después puedes hablar con Scarlett sobre la app que usó anoche. Se acabarían los problemas de acaparamiento."
    mc "You should enjoy the hug and shut up. You can talk to Scarlett later about the app she used last night. It would end the monopolizing issues."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1720
translate english c19s004_Betty_3033ba01:

    # bet "¿Que app?"
    bet "Which app?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1721
translate english c19s004_Betty_f9e38380:

    # "Le explicas la app de los turnos de baile. Alargas la explicación innecesariamente para estar más rato abrazado a ella."
    "You explain the app for the dance shifts to her. You lengthen the explanation unnecessarily to prolong your embrace with her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1722
translate english c19s004_Betty_797c1d45:

    # "La mujer que siempre da apoyo a los demás necesita apoyo hoy."
    "The woman who always gives support to others needs support today."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1724
translate english c19s004_Betty_71f2a5aa:

    # "Al cabo de un largo rato, se separa de ti reluctantemente."
    "After a long while, she reluctantly breaks away from you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1725
translate english c19s004_Betty_188003d1:

    # bet "Creo que ahora sí que debería dejarte... pero antes..."
    bet "I think I should leave you now... but first..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1727
translate english c19s004_Betty_ee227c78:

    # bet "Gracias por todo, [mc]. Deberías cobrar por esos abrazos."
    bet "Thanks for everything, [mc]. You should charge for those hugs."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1728
translate english c19s004_Betty_fe864c02:

    # mc "Ese beso me parece un buen pago. *Risa*"
    mc "That kiss looks like a good payment to me. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1730
translate english c19s004_Betty_2ad3bbab:

    # bet "De esos tengo muchos y no se van a agotar."
    bet "I have a lot of those and I'm not going to run out of them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1731
translate english c19s004_Betty_b3890ebb:

    # mcp "(Espero que Eva y tú no habléis demasiado. Me acabas de recordar a lo que hizo anoche.)"
    mcp "(I hope you and Eva don't talk too much. You just reminded me of what she did last night.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1732
translate english c19s004_Betty_f1db23b1:

    # mcp "(¡Oh, mierda! Me había olvidado de que le había dicho que tenía que hablar con ella y con Amanda! Hora de hacerlo)"
    mcp "(Oh, shit! I forgot I told her I needed to talk to her and Amanda! Time to do it)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1736
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_40cc353b:

    # "Pillas a Amanda a solas, volviendo de la casa. El resto de las chicas siguen alrededor de Meemaw."
    "You catch Amanda alone, coming back from the house. The rest of the girls are still around Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1738
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_3b172093:

    # "Se han formado grupos, supones que comentando todas las revelaciones del día."
    "They have formed groups again, you assume commenting on all the revelations of the day."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1739
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_29bbc125:

    # "Nadie se acuerda ya de la lucha de caballos a la que ibais a jugar."
    "No one remembers anymore about the horse fight you were going to play."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1740
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_251ac38c:

    # mc "Amanda, ¿puedo veros a ti y a Eva en mi habitación en cinco minutos?"
    mc "Amanda, can I see you and Eva in my room in five minutes?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1741
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_9a682629:

    # ama "¿Para qué? Aún no hemos acabado de concretar lo que hablamos anoche..."
    ama "What for? We still haven't finished fleshing out what we talked about last night..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1742
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_ac645562:

    # mc "No tiene que ver con lo de anoche, no te preocupes."
    mc "It has nothing to do with last night, don't worry."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1743
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_dca2111d:

    # mc "¿Vas a buscarla y os veo arriba?"
    mc "Can you go get her and meet me upstairs?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1745
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_2722a54e:

    # ama "De acuerdo, voy a avisarla."
    ama "Okay, I'll let her know."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1747
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_41d397cb:

    # "Unos minutos después..."
    "Some minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1748
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_2b4c2398:

    # ama "¿Qué necesitas, [mc]?"
    ama "What do you need, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1749
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_14ff3a77:

    # eva "¿Es urgente? Las chicas... la fiesta..."
    eva "Is this urgent? The girls... the party..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1750
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_83f07e4b:

    # mc "Van a ser dos minutos. Tengo algo para vosotras."
    mc "It's going to take two minutes. I've got something for you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1752
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_e961bfce:

    # eva "¿Para nosotras?" (multiple=2)
    eva "For us?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1753
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_90c9b239:

    # ama "¿Qué es? ¿Algo sobre NTR?" (multiple=2)
    ama "What is it? Something about NTR?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1754
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_c4198fb9:

    # mc "No os conocía en vuestro cumpleaños, con lo que he pensado que sería una buena idea dároslo hoy."
    mc "I hadn't met you on your birthday, so I thought it would be a good idea to give this to you today."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1755
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_09866e1d:

    # mc "No es nada... importante... Tan solo algo que se me ocurrió."
    mc "It's nothing... important... Just something that crossed my mind."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1757
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_bcdae3e2:

    # mc "Son esas dos cajas que hay encima de la mesa."
    mc "It's those two boxes on the table."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1758
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_c71034f4:

    # mc "La caja púrpura es para Eva y la azul para Amanda."
    mc "The purple box is for Eva and the blue box is for Amanda."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1760
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_e7073f13:

    # "Las chicas casi corren hacia las cajas. Las sopesan y escuchan en su interior."
    "The girls almost run to the boxes. They weigh them and listen inside."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1762
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_8a18531c:

    # "Las caras de sorpresa cuando las abren valen la pena. No sabes lo que esperaban, pero desde luego no lo que hay en las cajas."
    "The surprised faces when they open them are worth it. You don't know what they were expecting, but certainly not what's in the boxes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1763
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_dff084ed:

    # ama "¿Le has dicho algo?"
    ama "Did you say anything to him?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1764
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_8c2bc341:

    # eva "Salió la conversación el otro día..."
    eva "The conversation came up the other day..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1766
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_291fb3f1:

    # eva "Tengo que sentarme..."
    eva "I need to sit down..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1767
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_458bec5d:

    # "No es el efecto que esperabas... A lo mejor la cara de sorpresa no era por una \"buena sorpresa\"."
    "It's not the effect you were expecting... Maybe the surprised faces weren't a sign of a \"good surprise\"."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1768
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_7d9eb707:

    # mc "¿No os gustan? Creía que..."
    mc "Don't you like them? I thought..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1770
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_6ca94c36:

    # eva "¿Una muñeca, [mc]? ¿Crees que somos niñas pequeñas?"
    eva "A doll, [mc]? Do you think we're little girls?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1771
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_7c9a1719:

    # mc "No. No es lo que quería decir con ese regalo... dijiste que nunca habíais tenido una. Encontré esas que eran personalizables y... No son pistolas... creía que os gustarían..."
    mc "No. That's not what I meant by that gift... you said you never had one. I found those that were customizable and... They're not guns... I thought you would like them..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1772
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_eab1ef1c:

    # mc "No sé... quería regalaros vuestra primera muñeca... no quería ofenderos."
    mc "I don't know... I wanted to gift you your first dolls... I didn't want to offend you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1774
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_51ebcfdf:

    # eva "No creía que te acordaras... o que hubieras prestado atención..."
    eva "I didn't think you would remember... or that you would have paid attention..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1775
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_ac971ab0:

    # mc "Siempre presto atención a lo que decís, Eva."
    mc "I always pay attention to what you say, Eva."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1777
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_ddde49c2:

    # mc "¿A ti tampoco te gusta la tuya, Amanda?"
    mc "You don't like yours either, Amanda?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1778
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_128915ea:

    # ama "¿Gustarme? ¿Tampoco?"
    ama "Like? Either?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1779
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_e25c54c0:

    # ama "[mc], a veces pareces tan listo y a veces parece que no sabes de qué estás hablando... eres desconcertante."
    ama "[mc], sometimes you seem so smart, and sometimes it looks like you don't know what you're talking about... you're puzzling."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1781
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_6ed7a82f:

    # ama "Me encanta... La has vestido como el día que nos conocimos, durante el secuestro, pero sin el pasamontañas..."
    ama "I love it... You've dressed her like the day we met, during the kidnapping, but without the balaclava..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1783
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_965b482b:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]. Es increíble que te hayas tomado tantas molestias por nosotras."
    ama "Thank you, [mc]. It's amazing that you went to so much trouble for us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1784
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_17fd7601:

    # ama "Y a Eva también le gusta la suya. Pero no sabe expresar agradecimiento."
    ama "And Eva also likes hers. But she doesn't know how to express gratitude."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1785
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_cc761816:

    # mc "No..."
    mc "There's..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1787
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_a99fdb2f:

    # mc "... pasa..."
    mc "... no..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1789
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_68668214:

    # mc "... nada..."
    mc "... problem..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1790
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_d908e823:

    # eva "¡Gracias, [mc]!"
    eva "Thank you, [mc]!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1792
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_720943b8:

    # eva "¡Gracias, gracias, gracias!"
    eva "Thank you, thank you, thank you!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1793
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_c37deefe:

    # mc "Me alegra que os gusten..."
    mc "I'm glad you like them..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1795
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_bc503d70:

    # eva "Tu turno, Amanda."
    eva "Your turn, Amanda."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1797
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_dd958d13:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]."
    ama "Thank you, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1799
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_9c56d7c9:

    # ama "No sabes lo que significa esto para nosotras."
    ama "You have no idea what this means to us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1800
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_d18f7820:

    # mc "No lo puedo imaginar, pero me encantan vuestras reacciones. Aunque me habéis acojonado al principio."
    mc "I can't imagine, but I love your reactions. You guys scared the crap out of me with your first comments."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1802
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_3ed2cd9e:

    # ama "La próxima vez, añade un set de maquillaje. Últimamente, por tu culpa, parezco un mapache demasiado a menudo."
    ama "Next time, add a makeup set. Lately, because of you, I look like a raccoon too often."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1803
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_07490a72:

    # mc "*Risa* Y yo que creía que erais mercenarias duras..."
    mc "*Laugh* And here I thought you were tough mercenaries..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1805
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_07200d65:

    # eva "Ponme a luchar con guerrillas africanas y te demostraré lo dura que soy..."
    eva "Put me in a fight with African guerrillas and I'll show you how tough I am..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1806
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_37bc5e40:

    # mc "Pero una muñeca te hace llorar..."
    mc "But a doll makes you cry..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1808
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_68e44313:

    # ama "No es la muñeca en sí, [mc]. Es que hayas pensado que podrían gustarnos a nosotras."
    ama "It's not the doll itself, [mc]. It's that you thought we might like them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1810
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_6fbf7c40:

    # eva "Y que hayas pensado que nosotras también debíamos recibir regalos. El día del cumpleaños de las chicas."
    eva "And that you thought we should get presents too. On the girls' birthday."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1811
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_16628867:

    # mc "Sois tan parte de esta familia como cualquiera de nosotros. Os debemos 18 regalos de cumpleaños."
    mc "You are as much a part of this family as any of us. We owe you 18 birthday presents."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1812
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_098e99fa:

    # mc "¿Por qué no dejas la muñeca y vuelves aquí? Creo que un abrazo triple estaría bien, ¿no?"
    mc "Why don't you put the doll down and come back here? I think a triple hug would be nice, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1814
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_8e1c8d0a:

    # eva "Sí. Se está bien aquí..."
    eva "Yes. It's nice here..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1815
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_553de1bd:

    # ama "Rechazo tu idea, Eva."
    ama "I reject your idea, Eva."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1816
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_696e52fa:

    # eva "Creo que yo también la rechazo."
    eva "I think I reject it too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1817
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_704e5ecf:

    # mc "¿De qué habláis?"
    mc "What are you talking about?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1818
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_a26e8fee:

    # eva "Te hemos dicho que no habíamos acabado de concretar lo que hablamos ayer..."
    eva "We told you that we hadn't finished discussing what we had talked about yesterday..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1819
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_6517a50c:

    # ama "Mi hermana tuvo la \"genial\" idea de decirte que, o nos elegías a las dos, o a ninguna."
    ama "My sister had the \"brilliant\" idea of telling you that either you would choose both of us, or neither of us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1820
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_e96689fc:

    # eva "No contestes qué elegirías... Ese plan se acaba de ir a la mierda. De todas formas, Amanda no estaba convencida."
    eva "Don't answer what you would choose... That plan just went to hell. Amanda wasn't convinced anyway."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1821
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_54ad3bcb:

    # eva "Es lo que se me ocurrió para que no discutiéramos."
    eva "It's what I came up with so we wouldn't argue."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1822
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_c702702c:

    # mc "Y ¿por qué la rechazáis ahora?"
    mc "And why are you rejecting it now?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1824
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_1638ef54:

    # ama "No podría aceptar que rechazaras a Eva por ese ultimátum si no quieres estar conmigo pero sí con ella."
    ama "I couldn't accept you rejecting Eva, because of that ultimatum, if you don't want to be with me but you want to be with her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1825
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_aa6aab58:

    # mcp "(Cada día te pareces más a [eri].)"
    mcp "(You look more like [eri] every day.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1826
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_fa9a6811:

    # mc "¿Y tú, Eva? Si la idea fue tuya..."
    mc "And you, Eva? If the idea was yours..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1828
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_f584551c:

    # eva "Me he imaginado cómo reaccionaría yo si me pusieran entre la espada y la pared como pensaba hacerte."
    eva "I have imagined how I would react if someone put me between a rock and a hard place, as I was thinking of doing to you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1829
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_b6612b91:

    # eva "Mi reacción no hubiera sido... agradable. Ha hecho falta que me hagas llorar para que lo entienda."
    eva "My reaction would not have been... pleasant. I needed you to make me cry for me to understand it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1830
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_017af769:

    # mcp "(Y tú cada día te pareces más a [emm].)"
    mcp "(And you look more like [emm] every hour.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1832
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_54c92f55:

    # eva "No quiero que pases por eso porque nosotras nos estemos comportando como niñas pequeñas."
    eva "I don't want you to go through that because we're acting like little girls."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1833
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_72d03917:

    # mc "Gracias, Eva..."
    mc "Thank you, Eva..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1835
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_5cd7a77d:

    # ama "Al menos ahora seremos niñas pequeñas con muñecas. *Risa* Poco a poco iremos aprendiendo."
    ama "At least, now we'll be little girls with dolls. *Laugh* We'll learn step by step."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1836
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_4353756b:

    # mc "*Risa* Poco a poco. Os iremos dando un curso acelerado de \"normalidad\". O tanta \"normalidad\" como esta familia sea capaz."
    mc "*Laugh* Step by step. We'll give you a crash course in \"normalcy\". Or as much normalcy as this family is capable of."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1838
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_966d6274:

    # "El abrazo dura un rato, con conversaciones intrascendentes y risas."
    "The hug lasts for a while, involving inconsequential conversations and laughter."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1840
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_6fcceb24:

    # "La revelación de secretos se intercala entre las conversaciones."
    "The earlier revelation of secrets is woven in between the conversations."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1841
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_facc4e5a:

    # "Coinciden con lo que ha dicho Betty sobre el secreto de Meemaw dejando los tuyos en segundo plano."
    "They concur with what Betty said about Meemaw's secret leaving yours as a secondary concern."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1843
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_fca1cfd9:

    # "También te felicitan por tu futura paternidad. Has dado un buen uso a los tests."
    "They also congratulate you on your future parenthood. You've put their tests to good use."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1845
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_0cd35f80:

    # ama "Creo que deberíamos ir bajando. Las chicas se van a preguntar dónde estamos."
    ama "I think we should go downstairs. The girls are going to wonder where we are."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1847
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_5164513e:

    # ama "O si va a haber más secretos que revelar cuando bajemos. *Risa*"
    ama "Or if there are going to be more secrets to reveal when we go down. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1848
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_4693d2db:

    # mc "Sería buena idea bajar. No os olvidéis las muñecas."
    mc "It would be a good idea to go downstairs. Don't forget your dolls."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1849
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_1e102db9:

    # ama "De camino a la piscina, las dejaremos en la habitación de [emm], con nuestra ropa."
    ama "On our way to the pool, we'll drop them off in [emm]'s room, with our clothes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1851
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_c4765bf0:

    # eva "Dadme un segundo..."
    eva "Give me a second..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1853
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_59564e51:

    # eva "Ya. Podemos bajar. También dejaré esto en la habitación de [emm]."
    eva "Done. We can go downstairs. I'll also leave this in [emm]'s room."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1854
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_56a609cd:

    # mc "¿Por qué has cambiado de opinión?"
    mc "Why did you change your mind?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1856
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_eb2836da:

    # eva "Alguien me dijo que tenía que dejar con ganas de más a los chicos que me interesaran y que contara las veces que lo hacía."
    eva "Someone told me that I had to leave the guys I was interested in wanting more, and that I should count how many times I did it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1857
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_b1a421fc:

    # eva "Van dos."
    eva "This is the second one."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1859
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_6e734612:

    # "*Blam*"
    "*Blam*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1861
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_6e1fa55a:

    # mc "Creo que he creado un monstruo. *Risa*"
    mc "I think I've created a monster. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1862
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_b1b109ab:

    # ama "Es culpa tuya. *Risa*"
    ama "It's your fault. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1864
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1865
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_05886884:

    # eva "*A través de la puerta* Soy yo..."
    eva "*Through the door* It's me..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1866
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_cff3b865:

    # mc "Adelante..."
    mc "Come in..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1868
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_a27de6a1:

    # eva "He querido hacer una salida tan dramática que me he olvidado a Fee."
    eva "I wanted to make such a dramatic exit that I forgot Fee."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1869
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_728e94ab:

    # mc "*Risa* Cógela y nos vemos abajo."
    mc "*Laugh* Take her and meet me downstairs."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1870
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_edd753ce:

    # mcp "(¿Fee? ¿Ya le ha puesto nombre? ¿Es posible que sea por Fiona, la primera de las chicas que murió?)"
    mcp "(Fee? Has she already named it? Is it possible it's after Fiona, the first of the girls who died?)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1872
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_9ffd506a:

    # mcp "(La he diseñado para que se parezca a Eva, lo cual significa que también se parece a Fiona.)"
    mcp "(I designed her to look like Eva, which means she also looks like Fiona.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1874
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_4250dff2:

    # eva "Hasta luego, [mc]." (multiple=2)
    eva "See you later, [mc]." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1875
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_09450795:

    # ama "Te vemos en la piscina." (multiple=2)
    ama "See you at the pool." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1876
translate english c19s004_AmandaEva_a7dace93:

    # mc "Hasta ahora, chicas. No os quedéis jugando con las muñecas en la habitación de [emm]. O al menos no os quedéis demasiado rato."
    mc "See you in a moment, girls. Don't stay playing with the dolls in [emm]'s room. Or at least don't stay too long."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1880
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_e0e383bc:

    # "Al llegar a la piscina, te acercas a Maddie, que parece que se acaba de quedar sola."
    "When you get to the poolside, you approach Maddie, who is sitting alone by the pool."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1881
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_a7d0ffb9:

    # mc "¿Qué tal te lo estás pasando, Maddie?"
    mc " Hey, Maddie, are you having a good time?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1882
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_92bcd6b6:

    # mad "Muy bien, había algunas chicas a las que solo conocía de pasada. Hacía mucho tiempo que no estaba en una fiesta con tanta gente y con tan buen rollo."
    mad "Very good, there were some girls I only had met briefly. It's been a long time since I've been to a party with so many people and with such a good vibe."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1883
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_9c828053:

    # mad "Incluso lo del mensaje se ha solucionado de una forma... diferente a como me imaginaba."
    mad "Even the message thing has been solved in a way... different from how I imagined."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1884
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_a427241e:

    # mc "Bueno... creo que somos diferentes a lo habitual."
    mc "Well... I think we're different than regular families."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1885
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_65598d11:

    # mad "Siéntate conmigo un rato. Apenas hemos tenido tiempo de hablar."
    mad "Sit with me for a while. We've barely had time to talk."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1889
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_6eeb2c71:

    # mad "No todas las chicas descubren todos los días que el chico con el que pensabas que tenías algo especial lo tiene también con más chicas."
    mad "Not every girl finds out that way that, the guy you thought you had something special with, has it with more girls, too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1890
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_1a8d88c3:

    # mc "Nunca me he escondido sobre eso."
    mc "I've never been secretive about it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1892
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_34c91fae:

    # mc "Te dije que estaba con alguien más. No me puedes acusar de no ser sincero."
    mc "I told you I was with someone else. You can't accuse me of not being honest."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1894
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_2559aa01:

    # mc "Tu relación y la mía es diferente a cualquier otra que tenga."
    mc "Our relationship is different from any other I have."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1896
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_cadc6741:

    # mad "Pero que Betty haya querido cubrirte... ha sido alucinante."
    mad "But to see that Betty wanted to cover for you... it was crazy."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1898
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_b005c7f2:

    # mad "Ha sido alucinante que Betty haya intentado cubrirnos sin ni siquiera saber a quién cubría."
    mad "It was just crazy that Betty tried to cover for us, without even knowing who she was covering."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1900
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_ad1b6620:

    # mad "Ha sido alucinante que Betty haya intentado cubriros sin ni siquiera saber a quién cubría."
    mad "It was just crazy that Betty tried to cover for you, without even knowing which girl she was covering."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1902
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_c35adc9f:

    # mc "Lo sabía, pero eso no le quita mérito a que haya querido cubrirnos."
    mc " She knew, but that doesn't detract from the fact that she wanted to cover for us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1904
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_86978398:

    # mc "No me extrañaría que lo hubiera sospechado en todo momento, conociendo a Tía Betty."
    mc "I wouldn't put it past her to have suspected it all the time, knowing Aunt Betty."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1906
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_3494d574:

    # mad "Has tenido que alucinar mucho cuando has recibido ese mensaje, no saliendo con nadie, y con Betty confesando algo que no es cierto para cubrirte."
    mad "You must have really had to freak out when you got that message, not dating anyone, and then Betty confessing something that isn't true, just to cover for you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1907
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_482dcf08:

    # mc "Betty es así. La razón que ha dado es tan propia de ella... Ha preferido cargar con la culpa antes de que se descubriera el posible culpable."
    mc "Betty is like that. The reason she has given is so typical of her... She chose to take the blame before the possible culprit was discovered."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1909
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_62695d52:

    # mad "Es bueno tener a alguien así cerca. Todos sois alucinantes... Betty, Olivia, Martha, Norah, las chicas... Obviamente Amanda y Eva..."
    mad "It's good to have someone like her around. You're all awesome... Betty, Olivia, [mar], [nor], the girls... Obviously Amanda and Eva..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1910
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_7376f5f2:

    # mc "¿Y el resto? Creo que no conocías a Kim, Lisa, o Kate. Te he visto hablando con ellas antes."
    mc "What about the rest? I don't think you had met Kim, Lisa, or Kate. I saw you talking to them earlier."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1912
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_b82b8fac:

    # mad "A Kate y a Lisa sí que las había visto. Vinieron con Debbie hace unos días a la tienda."
    mad " I had met Kate and Lisa before. They came with Debbie a few days ago to the store."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1913
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_7b51f5a0:

    # mad "A Kim no la había visto. Es espectacular. No me extraña que sea modelo."
    mad "I hadn't seen Kim before. She's spectacular. No wonder she's a model."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1914
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_c083502f:

    # mc "Es una chica muy especial."
    mc "She's a very special girl."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1916
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_296e4b5f:

    # mad "Y muy amable. Después de los regalos, hablando con Lisa y Kim, hemos estado hablando de pintura."
    mad "And very kind. After the gifts, chatting with Lisa and Kim, we've been talking about paintings."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1917
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_4d9d0c2b:

    # mc "Lisa estudia arte, es lógico."
    mc "Lisa studies Art, it's logical."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1920
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_b80e802c:

    # mad "Les ha hablado de los cuadros de Zeus, y de los diseños de vestidos."
    mad "I have told them about the Zeus paintings, and about the dress designs."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1922
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_86e63501:

    # mad "Les he hablado de unos cuadros de Zeus que tengo en mi habitación y... no sé si sabes que diseño ropa."
    mad "I told them about some Zeus paintings I have in my room and... I don't know if you are aware that I design clothes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1923
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_fadddf46:

    # mc "No, no lo sabía..."
    mc "No, I didn't know that..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1925
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_672886fe:

    # mad "¡Pues Kim se ha ofrecido a servirme como maniquí para probar cómo quedan los vestidos en una persona real!"
    mad "Well, Kim has offered to serve as a mannequin for me to test how the dresses look on a real person!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1926
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_cb38ff1b:

    # mc "¡Eso es fantástico!"
    mc "That's great!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1927
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_2e60e84b:

    # mc "No tengo ni idea de si eso puede ayudarte, pero supongo que es mejor que verlos en papel o en un ordenador."
    mc "I have no idea if that can help you, but I guess it's better than seeing them on paper or on a computer."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1929
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_38ffef5a:

    # mad "¡Es increíble! Muchas veces, cuando tengo el vestido cortado y pre-cosido, me lo pruebo y no se parece en nada a lo que tenía en mente."
    mad "It's amazing! Many times, when I have the dress cut and pre-sewn, I try it on, and it looks nothing like what I had in mind."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1930
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_cd44ea46:

    # mad "Hacer modificaciones sobre mí misma es muy complicado, pero tener a Kim para ayudarme en eso... sería de una ayuda que no te puedes imaginar."
    mad "Making modifications on myself is very tricky, but having Kim to help me with that... it would be helpful beyond your wildest imagination."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1931
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_90e9b615:

    # mc "*Risa* Se te ve muy emocionada, con lo que empiezo a imaginármelo."
    mc "*Laugh* You look very excited, so I'm starting to picture it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1932
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_09ae50f6:

    # mc "Y voy más allá. Ya me estoy imaginando a Kim desfilando en una pasarela con tus vestidos. *Risa*"
    mc "And I'm going further. I'm already picturing Kim parading down a runway in your dresses. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1934
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_3d483a02:

    # mad "Mmmm... creo que me acabas de dar una idea muy interesante. Si encontráramos un fotógrafo... las dos podríamos sacar algo de esto..."
    mad "Mmmm... I think you just gave me a very interesting idea. If we could find a photographer... we could both get something out of this..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1935
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_4ab91928:

    # mc "Habla con [emm]. No es profesional ni nada por el estilo, pero es buena con la cámara."
    mc "Talk to [emm]. She's not professional or whatever, but she's good with the camera."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1937
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_5465ec3b:

    # mad "¿Qué? ¡No lo sabía!"
    mad "What? I didn't know!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1938
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_b67c00ab:

    # mc "La fotografía es una de sus pasiones. Creo que las tres podríais sacar algo de esto."
    mc "Photography is one of her passions. I think the three of you could get something out of this."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1939
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_bac1142b:

    # mc "[emm] aumentar su portfolio, Kim su book, y tú poder promocionar tus vestidos."
    mc "[emm] will increase her portfolio, Kim her book, and you will be able to promote your dresses."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1940
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_54a87386:

    # mad "¡Tengo que hablar con ella!"
    mad "I need to talk to her!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1941
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_7e00dc7d:

    # mc "*Risa* La he visto entrar en casa hace un momento. Supongo que no tardará."
    mc "*Laugh* I saw her go into the house just now. I guess she won't be long."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1943
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_d2896817:

    # mad "Bueno, tampoco es el momento de hablar de negocios. Además es su cumpleaños."
    mad "Well, it's not the right time to discuss business either. Besides, it's her birthday."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1944
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_d6a64fa2:

    # mc "Le harás un regalo increíble... otro regalo increíble, si le ofreces hacer fotos profesionales el día de su cumpleaños, o casi."
    mc "You'll make her an amazing gift... another amazing gift, if you ask her to do a semiprofessional photo shoot on her birthday, or close to it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1947
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_fc818920:

    # mc "Tengo una pregunta, hablando de regalos. ¿Qué ha sido del cuadro de Zeus disfrazado de superhéroe?"
    mc "I have a question, talking about gifts. What happened to the painting of Zeus disguised as a superhero?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1948
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_6b57974e:

    # mad "No me gustaba. No estaba tan personalizado como me hubiera gustado. Sabiendo que [dap] quiere dedicarse a la química me pareció una mejor opción."
    mad "I didn't like it. It wasn't as personalized as I would have liked. Knowing that [dap] wants to pursue a career in chemistry, this one struck me as a better option."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1949
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_3a40886a:

    # mc "Es una buena razón. Me ha gustado más el de químico que el de superhéroe."
    mc "That's a good reason. I liked the chemist one better than the superhero one."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1950
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_231faf9e:

    # mad "*Risa* El de superhéroe se quedará en mi pared cuando lo acabe. Lo dejé apartado mientras pintaba el de químico."
    mad "*Laugh* The superhero one will stay on my wall when I finish it. I set it aside while I painted the chemist one."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1952
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_c3a76666:

    # deb "¿Interrumpo algo?"
    deb "Am I interrupting anything?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1953
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_5dfa73fe:

    # mc "No, Debbie, estábamos hablando de las fotos de [emm]."
    mc "No, Debbie, we were talking about [emm]'s photos."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1955
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_715a205e:

    # deb "¡Oh! ¡Son fantásticas! Tiene muy buen ojo para la composición y la luz... al menos eso dice Lisa. Yo no entiendo de fotografía."
    deb "Oh, they're terrific! She has a very good eye for composition and light... at least that's what Lisa says. I don't understand photography."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1956
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_be516646:

    # deb "Yo sólo sé si una foto me gusta o no. Y las de [emm] me gustan. Igual que tus cuadros, Maddie. Son super bonitos y muy graciosos."
    deb "I only know if I like a photo or not. And I like [emm]'s. Just like your paintings, Maddie. They're super cute and very funny."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1958
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_3bc2500a:

    # mad "Gracias. Fue muy divertido pintarlos y disfrazar a Zeus."
    mad "Thank you. It was a lot of fun painting them and dressing up Zeus."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1960
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_d403ee6e:

    # deb "¿Lo has traído también?"
    deb "Did you bring him too?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1962
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_aceede83:

    # mad "¿A qué te refieres?"
    mad "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1964
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_6abc1eb1:

    # deb "Has traído al otro gato, ¿no? Por eso preguntaba si habías traído a Zeus."
    deb "You brought the other cat, didn't you? That's why I was asking if you brought Zeus."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1966
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_4c5b75ff:

    # mad "No... solo tengo a Zeus... bueno \"tengo\"... Él seguramente pensaría diferente. ¿Por qué?"
    mad "No... I only own Zeus... well, \"I own\"... He would surely think differently. Why?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1968
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_f900d9ac:

    # deb "Cuando he subido a mi habitación, por la ventana se ve el jacuzzi de [nor]. Me ha parecido que Alexia tenía un gato en el regazo."
    deb "When I went up to my room, I could see [nor]'s hot tub through the window. It looked like Alexia had a cat on her lap."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1969
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_2aadbf07:

    # mc "¿El jacuzzi nudista? ¿Un gato negro?"
    mc "The nudist hot tub? A black cat?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1971
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_24d0be7e:

    # deb "Sí, pero... ¿cómo... lo... sabes?"
    deb "Yes, but... how... do... you... know?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1973
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_e6423ea6:

    # deb "¡Oh! ¡No! ¡Era otro tipo de animal peludo!"
    deb "Oh! No! It was another kind of furry animal!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1975
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_54ef0908:

    # mad "*Risa* ¡Un conejo!"
    mad "*Laugh* Another kind of kitty!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1976
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_885c856a:

    # mc "*Risa* Puedes preguntarle a Alexia cómo se llama su mascota."
    mc "*Laugh* You can ask Alexia what her pet is named."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1978
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_a757e446:

    # deb "¡Por el amor de Dios! A veces soy tan pardilla..."
    deb "For God's sake! Sometimes I'm such a dork..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:1979
translate english c19s004_MaddieDebbie_9c32f411:

    # mc "No pasa nada, supongo que a esa distancia no podías tener una buena vista."
    mc " It's okay, Deb. I guess at that distance you couldn't get a good view."

