    # kia "Que Solomon quisiera pegarte, cuando lo único que hacías era ayudarme, fue la gota que colmó el vaso."
    kia "That Solomon wanted to hit you, when all you were doing was helping me, was the straw that broke the camel's back."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2254
translate english c19s005_Kiara_1646283b:

    # mc "Y me culpas por ello. Lo entiendo."
    mc "And you blame me for it. I understand."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2256
translate english c19s005_Kiara_32deec70:

    # kia "No, no te culpo por ello."
    kia "No, I don't blame you for that."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2257
translate english c19s005_Kiara_f92c920a:

    # kia "Tú tan solo me has enseñado que un castillo no tiene por qué ser opresivo. Que puede guardar cosas hermosas en su interior."
    kia "You have only taught me that a castle does not have to be oppressive. That it can hold beautiful things inside."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2258
translate english c19s005_Kiara_c1f7737f:

    # mc "¿Por eso me evitas? Ahora es cuando no entiendo nada."
    mc "Is that why you're avoiding me? Now is when I don't understand anything."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2260
translate english c19s005_Kiara_45638f5c:

    # kia "Aquí tenéis un castillo precioso. Pero también es un palacio. Nadie es prisionero en su propia casa."
    kia "Here, you have a beautiful castle. But it is also a palace. No one is a prisoner in their own home."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2261
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ddca5414:

    # mc "Sigo sin entender qué tiene que ver eso con que me evites."
    mc "I still don't understand what that has to do with you shunning me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2263
translate english c19s005_Kiara_47d2b49b:

    # kia "No sé si es agradecimiento o algo más, pero cada vez que hablo contigo pienso que la vida puede ser diferente de lo que he vivido con Solomon."
    kia "I don't know if it's gratitude or something else but, every time I talk to you, I think life might be different from what I've experienced with Solomon."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2266
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ecdc1086:

    # kia "Pero ya estás con mi hija... "
    kia "But you are already dating my daughter... "

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2268
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d4651e69:

    # kia "Pero ya estás con alguien. Una mujer a la que aprecio... Además saliste con mi hija y al volver de la universidad no habéis vuelto juntos."
    kia "But you're already with someone. A woman I appreciate... Besides, you dated my daughter and when you came back from college you didn't get back together."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2271
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ff4d60c8:

    # kia "Pero estás con más de una mujer. Una de ellas mi hija..."
    kia "But you are with more than one woman. One of them my daughter..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2273
translate english c19s005_Kiara_9d5c9c27:

    # kia "Pero estás con más de una mujer. Y pese a todo no has vuelto con mi hija después de volver de la universidad."
    kia "But you are with more than one woman. And, despite everything, you haven't gone back with my daughter after coming back from college."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2275
translate english c19s005_Kiara_022dd757:

    # kia "Pero saliste con mi hija. Y cuando has vuelto de la universidad no has querido volver con ella."
    kia "But you dated my daughter. And, when you returned from college, you didn't want to go back to her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2276
translate english c19s005_Kiara_2c060141:

    # kia "No puedo ni siquiera pensar en cómo se sentiría si tú y yo... No. No puedo hacerle eso. Ni siquiera planteármelo."
    kia "I can't even think about how she would feel if you and I... No. I can't do that to her. I can't even consider it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2277
translate english c19s005_Kiara_85297243:

    # mc "Si tú y yo... ¿Qué, Kiara?"
    mc "If you and I... What, Kiara?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2278
translate english c19s005_Kiara_52fc8bfa:

    # mcp "(Dilo, Kiara. Aclara las cosas y borra esta barrera que nos está separando.)"
    mcp "(Say it, Kiara. Set the record straight and wipe away this barrier that is pushing us apart.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2280
translate english c19s005_Kiara_6f6095b4:

    # kia "Nada... no es posible, con lo que no vale la pena ni siquiera hablarlo."
    kia "Nothing... it's not possible, so it's not even worth talking about it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2281
translate english c19s005_Kiara_9ed7ad67:

    # kia "Mañana es el cumpleaños... el de verdad... de [eri] y [dap]. No quiero fastidiárselo. Pero mañana mismo empezaré a buscar algún sitio a donde mudarme."
    kia "Tomorrow is [eri] and [dap]'s birthday... the real one. I don't want to spoil it for them. But tomorrow I'll start looking for somewhere to move to."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2282
translate english c19s005_Kiara_6d4a8883:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Qué es tan importante como para querer irte de un sitio en el que estás a gusto y donde todo el mundo te quiere?"
    mc "Why? What is so important that you would want to leave a place where you are comfortable and where everyone loves you?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2284
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ca2e8356:

    # kia "No sé si es que no lo estás entendiendo, si tienes un ego tan enorme que me lo quieres oír decir, o si quieres que lo diga para evitar malentendidos."
    kia "I don't know if you're just not getting it, if you have such a huge ego that you want to hear me say it, or if you want me to say it to avoid misunderstandings."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2285
translate english c19s005_Kiara_830d976e:

    # mc "Puede haber más razones para querer oírtelo decir."
    mc "There may be more reasons to want to hear you say it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2286
translate english c19s005_Kiara_9a8dbc47:

    # mc "Quizás para poder rebatir tu idea de marcharte."
    mc "Maybe so I can counter your idea of leaving."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2288
translate english c19s005_Kiara_cc5662f9:

    # kia "No vas a lograr convencerme..."
    kia "You're not going to convince me..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2289
translate english c19s005_Kiara_2ce614d9:

    # mc "Dime tus razones para irte y yo te expondré mis argumentos para que te quedes."
    mc "Tell me your reasons for leaving, and I will make my case for you to stay."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2290
translate english c19s005_Kiara_093b0f53:

    # mc "Si no te puedo hacer cambiar de opinión, no volveré a insistir."
    mc "If I can't change your mind, I won't insist again."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2292
translate english c19s005_Kiara_f8804faf:

    # kia "¡Vale! Vas a conseguir que me avergüence a mí misma como una colegiala, pero si es lo que quieres..."
    kia "Okay! You're going to get me to embarrass myself like a schoolgirl, but if that's what you want..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2294
translate english c19s005_Kiara_c9ea3afc:

    # kia "¿Sabes lo que sentí el otro día? ¿Cuándo me defendiste delante de Solomon?"
    kia "Do you know what I felt the other day, when you stood up for me in front of Solomon?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2295
translate english c19s005_Kiara_f52b80de:

    # mc "Me lo puedo imaginar. Te sentiste protegida."
    mc "I can imagine. You felt protected."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2297
translate english c19s005_Kiara_42360f8c:

    # kia "Como no me había sentido nunca..."
    kia "Like I've never felt in my life..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2299
translate english c19s005_Kiara_06ad52c3:

    # kia "Esto no lo sabe nadie, pero hace unos años, fuimos a San Francisco para nuestro aniversario a pasar un fin de semana."
    kia "No one knows about this but, a few years ago, we went to San Francisco for our anniversary, for a romantic weekend."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2300
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ddc24f51:

    # kia "Nos perdimos y acabamos en un sitio sospechoso. Un tipo nos intentó atracar."
    kia "We got lost and ended up in a shady place. A guy tried to mug us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2301
translate english c19s005_Kiara_656b5e8a:

    # kia "¿Sabes lo que hizo Solomon?"
    kia "Do you know what Solomon did?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2302
translate english c19s005_Kiara_6107583b:

    # mc "Supongo que nada. Darle el dinero. Y entonces llegó la policía."
    mc "I guess he did nothing. Gave him the money. And then the police arrived."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2304
translate english c19s005_Kiara_18924225:

    # kia "¿Qué? ¿Cómo sabes lo de la policía? Nunca se lo contamos a Eileen..."
    kia "What? How do you know about the police? We never told Eileen..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2305
translate english c19s005_Kiara_433b7cee:

    # mc "Has dicho que el tipo intentó atracaros, no que os atracara. He supuesto que, después de que Solomon le diera el dinero, llegó la policía."
    mc "You said the guy tried to mug you, not that he did mug you. I assumed that, after Solomon gave him the money, the police arrived."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2307
translate english c19s005_Kiara_c11a7aaf:

    # kia "Casi has acertado. No le dio el dinero. Me dijo \"corre\" y empezó a correr él también."
    kia "You almost got it right. He didn't give him the money. He told me to \"run\" and he started running."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2308
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ca58b031:

    # kia "Sin mirar atrás. Sin comprobar si le seguía."
    kia "Without looking back. Without checking to see if I was following him."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2310
translate english c19s005_Kiara_454935c8:

    # mc "¡Qué hijo de puta!"
    mc "What a son of a bitch!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2311
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3fae328f:

    # kia "Corrimos durante dos manzanas. Solomon cada vez más lejos. El atracador cada vez más cerca. Yo gritando, pidiendo ayuda."
    kia "We ran for two blocks. Solomon farther away with each step. The robber getting closer with each stride. I was screaming, calling for help."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2313
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3f6420e1:

    # kia "Y me topé de bruces con dos policías. Solomon había pasado corriendo por su lado sin pararse."
    kia "And I bumped into two policemen. Solomon had run past them without stopping."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2315
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3db11475:

    # mc "Y el atracador desapareció. Y el hijo de puta de tu marido también."
    mc "And the mugger disappeared. And so did your bastard husband."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2317
translate english c19s005_Kiara_e4c3f2f1:

    # kia "Exacto. Llegó corriendo al hotel. Estaba a cinco o seis manzanas de donde encontré a los policías."
    kia "Exactly. He arrived at the hotel, running. It was five or six blocks from where I found the cops."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2318
translate english c19s005_Kiara_348a690d:

    # kia "Sólo entonces se le ocurrió mirar atrás y descubrió que no estaba. Me llamó al móvil... para ver si estaba bien."
    kia "Only then he happened to look back and discovered I wasn't there. He called me on my cell phone... to see if I was okay."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2319
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ce1483e1:

    # mc "No sé cómo no le pediste el divorcio en ese mismo momento."
    mc "I don't know how you didn't ask him for a divorce right then and there."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2321
translate english c19s005_Kiara_757196fc:

    # kia "Eileen tenía siete años, [mc]. Yo no tenía trabajo y Solomon aún no bebía como hizo tiempo después."
    kia "Eileen was seven years old, [mc]. I didn't have a job and Solomon wasn't yet drinking like he did some time later."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2322
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3ac895a6:

    # kia "Le hubieran concedido la custodia a él. Hubiera perdido a mi hija. Ya me había amenazado con eso..."
    kia "They would have awarded custody to him. I would have lost my daughter. He had already threatened me with that..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2323
translate english c19s005_Kiara_111b30e7:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Cuándo?"
    mc "What? When?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2325
translate english c19s005_Kiara_f1630e7f:

    # kia "Unos meses después de que naciera Eileen. Cuando empecé a ver a mis amigas de nuevo. Me dijo que ya era una mujer con una hija."
    kia "A few months after Eileen was born. When I started seeing my friends again. He told me I was already a woman with a daughter."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2327
translate english c19s005_Kiara_924f253f:

    # kia "Que mi lugar estaba en casa con mi hija, no paseando a la niña y quedando con mis amigas. Si le tenía que dar el sol, teníamos un jardín."
    kia "That my place was at home with my daughter, not walking the child and hanging out with my friends. If she needed to be in the sun, we had a garden."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2328
translate english c19s005_Kiara_b6b9daed:

    # kia "Que si no quería comportarme como una mujer casada, pediría el divorcio y se quedaría con la niña porque yo no la podía mantener."
    kia "That, if I didn't want to behave like a married woman, he would file for divorce and keep the girl because I couldn't support her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2330
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3f529544:

    # mc "Me estoy arrepintiendo de no haberle pegado el jueves."
    mc "I'm regretting not hitting him on Thursday."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2332
translate english c19s005_Kiara_7a917878:

    # kia "No tienes que rebajarte a su altura..."
    kia "You don't have to stoop to his level..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2333
translate english c19s005_Kiara_a4c31c35:

    # kia "Pero volviendo a San Francisco... Volví al hotel con los policías. No había denuncia que presentar. Por mi vida no podría recordar el aspecto del atracador."
    kia "But back to San Francisco... I returned to the hotel with the cops. There was no report to file. For the life of me I couldn't remember what the mugger looked like."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2334
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3af2f1b2:

    # kia "Y cuando llegué, ¿sabes qué pasó?"
    kia "And when I arrived, do you know what happened?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2335
translate english c19s005_Kiara_92519760:

    # mc "Me puedo llegar a imaginar cualquier cosa. Espero que no te pegara encima de haberte dejado sola."
    mc "I can imagine anything. I hope he didn't hit you, besides leaving you alone."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2337
translate english c19s005_Kiara_1f44fd04:

    # kia "No, por entonces aún no se emborrachaba y no era violento. Pero estaba enfadado."
    kia "No, back then he wasn't a drunkard yet and he wasn't violent. But he was angry."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2338
translate english c19s005_Kiara_e81d91e4:

    # kia "Se había puesto nervioso al ver que yo no llegaba al hotel. Estaba enfadado porque yo lo había dejado solo. Porque no había corrido lo suficiente."
    kia "He got nervous when he saw that I didn't arrive at the hotel behind him. He was angry because I had left him alone. Because I hadn't run fast enough."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2340
translate english c19s005_Kiara_b1884c43:

    # kia "Empezó a gritarme... y se fue sin decirme a dónde."
    kia "He started yelling at me... and left without telling me where he was going."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2341
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3b3b52d4:

    # kia "En nuestro aniversario cenó él solo en el restaurante que había reservado para nosotros y después fue de bar en bar hasta que volvió al hotel."
    kia "On our anniversary, he had dinner by himself at the restaurant he had booked for us, and then went from bar to bar until he returned to the hotel."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2343
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ba1d6dc1:

    # kia "Mientras tanto, yo estaba en la habitación sin saber si volvería o cuándo lo haría."
    kia "Meanwhile, I was in the hotel room, not knowing if or when he would return."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2345
translate english c19s005_Kiara_61e563a9:

    # mc "¡Es increíble!"
    mc "That's unbelievable!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2347
translate english c19s005_Kiara_c41de8f0:

    # kia "Y catorce años después, por fin tuvo el valor de encararse con un hombre. Y fue el hombre equivocado."
    kia "And fourteen years later, he finally found the courage to stand up to a man. And it was the wrong man."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2348
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d8af1d8b:

    # kia "No estabas haciendo nada malo. Nos estabas ayudando a recoger nuestras cosas. Y quiso pegarte."
    kia "You weren't doing anything wrong. You were helping us pick up our stuff. And he wanted to hit you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2349
translate english c19s005_Kiara_9e3c4220:

    # mc "Estaba muy borracho."
    mc "He was too drunk."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2351
translate english c19s005_Kiara_da697a61:

    # kia "Podrías haberte apartado. Decir que no era tu problema. Salir corriendo..."
    kia "You could have stepped aside. You could have said it wasn't your problem. Run away..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2352
translate english c19s005_Kiara_168be713:

    # kia "Pero no lo hiciste. Me defendiste como no lo hizo mi marido cuando tuvo la oportunidad."
    kia "But you didn't. You stood up for me like my husband didn't when he had the chance."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2354
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d818f7ba:

    # kia "Nos diste un techo cuando más lo necesitábamos. Cuando no teníamos a donde ir."
    kia "You gave us a roof over our heads when we needed it the most. When we had nowhere else to go."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2355
translate english c19s005_Kiara_1048259e:

    # kia "Incluso nos dejaste tu cama el día que llegamos y fuiste a dormir a un sofá."
    kia "You even lent us your bed the day we arrived and went to sleep on a couch."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2356
translate english c19s005_Kiara_8c75bb40:

    # mc "Es lo menos que podía hacer, ¿no?"
    mc "It was the least I could do, wasn't it?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2358
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d6e12a48:

    # kia "No tenías que hacer nada. No tenías que cedernos tu cama. Ni pelearte con mi marido."
    kia "You didn't have to do anything. You didn't have to give us your bed. Nor fight with my husband."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2359
translate english c19s005_Kiara_20e185dc:

    # kia "No tenías ninguna obligación."
    kia "You had no obligation towards us. Towards me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2360
translate english c19s005_Kiara_bf0c59d8:

    # mc "Sí que la tenía, aunque sólo fuera por decencia humana."
    mc "Yes, I had, if only out of human decency."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2361
translate english c19s005_Kiara_818942b0:

    # mc "Aunque hubiera hecho lo mismo sin esa obligación. Necesitabais mi ayuda y yo estaba ahí para prestárosla."
    mc "I would have done the same thing without that obligation, though. You needed my help, and I was there to provide it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2363
translate english c19s005_Kiara_35b1109c:

    # kia "A eso me refiero, [mc]. Mi marido salió corriendo en nuestro aniversario. Y un chico sin ninguna obligación lo dejó todo y se enfrentó a él por nosotras."
    kia "That's what I'm talking about, [mc]. My husband ran away on our anniversary. And a guy with no obligation dropped everything and stood up to him for us."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2364
translate english c19s005_Kiara_7a0746eb:

    # kia "Por mí."
    kia "For me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2365
translate english c19s005_Kiara_59c00afe:

    # mc "No sé cómo lo estás viendo tú, pero yo cada vez lo veo peor como razón para querer irte."
    mc "I don't know how you're looking at it, but it's getting worse and worse as a reason for wanting to leave."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2367
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ffcc8586:

    # kia "*Risa triste* No, esa es la razón que ha creado la razón para querer irme."
    kia "*Sad laughter* No, that's the reason that created the reason for wanting to leave."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2368
translate english c19s005_Kiara_73bd2b28:

    # kia "Después de sentirme tratada como un pedazo de mierda por mi marido durante años... llegas tú y me tratas como a una persona."
    kia "After feeling treated like a piece of shit by my husband for years... you come along and treat me like a person."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2369
translate english c19s005_Kiara_347e7179:

    # kia "Me enseñas cómo funciona una familia. Me lo enseñáis entre todos."
    kia "You show me how a family works. All of you teach me how it should be."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2370
translate english c19s005_Kiara_205ab6f1:

    # mc "Bueno, no se puede decir que seamos una familia ejemplar..."
    mc "Well, you can't say we're an exemplary family..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2372
translate english c19s005_Kiara_a46ab22c:

    # kia "No, pero todos os queréis y os protegéis. Todos os ayudáis. Y tú estás en todos sitios. Sólo había que verte durante la comida."
    kia "No, but you all love and protect each other. You all help each other. And you, [mc], are everywhere. One only had to observe how you behaved during lunch."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2373
translate english c19s005_Kiara_2f521a7e:

    # kia "¿Ha habido alguna chica con quién no hayas hablado hoy? ¿A alguien a quién hayas dejado de lado?"
    kia "Has there been a girl you haven't talked to today? Anyone you've neglected?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2374
translate english c19s005_Kiara_88558e50:

    # mc "Creo que no... y si lo ha habido debería compensarla."
    mc "I don't think so... and if there has been any, I should compensate her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2376
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ab896e98:

    # kia "Pues todas esas cosas hacen que esté empezando a albergar sentimientos por ti que no deberían estar ahí."
    kia " For all those reasons I'm starting to harbor feelings for you. Feelings that shouldn't be there."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2377
translate english c19s005_Kiara_caf7057f:

    # kia "Ya está. Ya lo he dicho."
    kia "That's it. I've said it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2379
translate english c19s005_Kiara_e903a592:

    # kia "Por eso te he estado evitando. No quiero que esos sentimientos crezcan."
    kia "That's why I've been avoiding you. I don't want those feelings to grow."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2381
translate english c19s005_Kiara_db2f0b58:

    # kia "Con la relación que tienes con mi hija, no puedo permitirme enamorarme de ti y... Sencillamente, no puedo."
    kia "With the relationship you have with my daughter, I can't afford to fall in love with you and... I simply can't."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2383
translate english c19s005_Kiara_e977573d:

    # kia "Después de la relación que tuviste con mi hija... no puedo permitirme enamorarme de ti. ¿Cómo se sentiría después de que no hayas vuelto con ella?"
    kia "After the relationship you had with my daughter... I can't afford to fall in love with you. How would she feel after you didn't get back with her?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2384
translate english c19s005_Kiara_8f240a7e:

    # mc "Y ¿cómo llevas lo de que los sentimientos no crezcan? Ya llevas tres días evitándome."
    mc "And how are you handling the feelings not growing? You've been avoiding me for three days now."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2386
translate english c19s005_Kiara_82754d03:

    # kia "Fatal... Sólo espero que cuando me mude podamos seguir siendo amigos."
    kia "Terribly... I just hope that, when I move out, we can still be friends."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2400
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d470a96f:

    # mc "Yo también estoy empezando a albergar sentimientos por ti. Pero en mi caso, no me avergüenzo de ellos."
    mc "I'm starting to harbor feelings for you, too. But in my case, I'm not ashamed of them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2402
translate english c19s005_Kiara_c517504e:

    # kia "¿Qué? ¿Desde cuándo?"
    kia "What? Since when?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2403
translate english c19s005_Kiara_1023e69c:

    # mc "Desde que he tenido la oportunidad de conocerte mejor. Conocerte como mujer, no como la madre de mi novia del instituto."
    mc "Since I've had a chance to get to know you better. To know you as a woman, not as my high school girlfriend's mother."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2404
translate english c19s005_Kiara_fa0d14d4:

    # mc "Desde que sé por lo que has pasado. Desde que pude ver a Solomon en el momento en que más asco daba."
    mc "Since I know what you've been through. Since I got to see Solomon at the time he was at his most sickening moment."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2405
translate english c19s005_Kiara_f6a5b899:

    # mc "Llámalo complejo del caballero de brillante armadura o como quieras. Pero aquel día algo hizo clic en mí."
    mc "Call it a knight in shining armor complex or whatever you want. But that day something clicked in me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2407
translate english c19s005_Kiara_f695a937:

    # kia "Pero... ¿qué pasa con Eileen?"
    kia "But... what about Eileen?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2409
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3e500748:

    # mc "Podemos hablar con ella. Si a ninguna de las dos os importa que la otra esté conmigo, no veo dónde puede estar el problema."
    mc "We can talk to her. If neither of you mind the other being with me, I don't see where the problem can be."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2411
translate english c19s005_Kiara_a3e56306:

    # mc "Ella y yo tuvimos nuestro momento. Fuimos felices. ¿Crees que, si quieres estar conmigo, te va a negar la oportunidad de tener la felicidad que ella tuvo?"
    mc "She and I had our moment. We were happy. Do you think that, if you want to be with me, she's going to deny you the chance to have the happiness she had?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2412
translate english c19s005_Kiara_2d097cac:

    # mc "Creo que es algo que podemos hablar los tres, si quieres."
    mc "I think it's something the three of us can talk about, if you want."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2413
translate english c19s005_Kiara_777ceb0e:

    # mcp "(Sabiendo que Eileen quiere que estés lo más lejos posible de Solomon, va a superar cualquier reparo que tenga.)"
    mcp "(Knowing that Eileen wants you to be as far away from Solomon as possible, she's going to overcome any qualms she has.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2416
translate english c19s005_Kiara_2c78da6b:

    # kia "¿Y con tu novia? No podría aceptar ser \"la otra\", ni hacerle daño o engañarla a sus espaldas."
    kia "What about your girlfriend? I couldn't agree to be \"the other one\", or hurt her, or cheat on her behind her back."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2417
translate english c19s005_Kiara_f376de56:

    # mc "Podemos hablar con ella también. Si a ella no le importa, y a ti tampoco, no veo dónde puede estar el problema."
    mc "We can talk to her too. If she doesn't mind, and neither do you, I don't see where the issue could be."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2419
translate english c19s005_Kiara_a1a393a8:

    # kia "¿Y con tu harén?"
    kia "And with your harem?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2420
translate english c19s005_Kiara_e2468207:

    # mc "¿Crees que no te van a aceptar en el harén? ¿Has visto algún problema con las revelaciones de hoy?"
    mc "Do you think they won't accept you into the harem? Have you seen any problems with today's revelations?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2422
translate english c19s005_Kiara_045e22dc:

    # kia "Haces que todo parezca tan fácil... pero no lo es."
    kia "You make everything look so easy... but it isn't."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2423
translate english c19s005_Kiara_eb6bb8e6:

    # mc "Hagamos una cosa... empecemos hablando con Eileen. Después puedes tomar una decisión. Pero que esa decisión no incluya mudarte, por favor."
    mc "Let's do one thing... let's start by talking to Eileen. Then you can make a choice. But let that decision not include moving, please."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2425
translate english c19s005_Kiara_626625d7:

    # mc "Siempre vamos a ser amigos, Kiara. A mí siempre me has caído bien, pero no creo que debamos ir más allá de ser amigos."
    mc "We're always going to be friends, Kiara. I've always liked you, but I don't think we should go beyond being friends."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2427
translate english c19s005_Kiara_087874d0:

    # kia "Eso ayuda..."
    kia "That helps..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2429
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d8d56bc4:

    # kia "Después de ver que sales con más de una mujer... casi había empezado a albergar esperanzas. Aunque me negara a aceptarlas."
    kia "After seeing you date more than one woman... I had almost begun to harbor hope. Even if I refused to accept it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2430
translate english c19s005_Kiara_df5fd914:

    # mc "Te quiero, pero no así. Te quiero porque eres una mujer maravillosa y siempre me vas a tener a tu lado para lo que necesites."
    mc "I love you, but not like that. I love you because you are a wonderful woman, and you will always have me by your side for whatever you need."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2431
translate english c19s005_Kiara_75ab4beb:

    # mc "Pero no puedo tener una relación contigo. Comparto varios de tus reparos."
    mc "But I can't have a relationship with you. I share several of your qualms."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2433
translate english c19s005_Kiara_81a0ebac:

    # kia "Y hasta aquí ha llegado esta conversación, ¿no?"
    kia "And this is as far as this conversation has gone, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2434
translate english c19s005_Kiara_9d640a05:

    # mc "Aún queda lo de irte de la casa. Yo me voy a ir a Aruba en unas semanas, con lo que no creo que debas hacerlo. Vas a estar mejor aquí que en cualquier otro sitio."
    mc "There is still the matter of moving out of the house. I'm going to Aruba in a few weeks, so I don't think you should. You're going to be better off here than anywhere else."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2436
translate english c19s005_Kiara_98195484:

    # kia "Creo que debería irme igualmente. De todas formas, en septiembre deberemos dejar la habitación libre para las estudiantes nuevas..."
    kia "I think I should leave anyway. Plus, in September we'll have to vacate the room for the new students..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2437
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d85b58bd:

    # mc "Pero yo no estaré. Podéis usar mi habitación mientras esté en Aruba. No hay ninguna prisa en que os vayáis."
    mc "But I won't be around. You can use my room while I'm in Aruba. There is no hurry for you to leave."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2439
translate english c19s005_Kiara_d34be1e0:

    # kia "Pero volverás. No podemos pedirte que duermas en el sofá eternamente. Igualmente tendremos que irnos a algún sitio."
    kia "But you will return. We can't ask you to sleep on the couch forever. We'll have to go somewhere eventually."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2440
translate english c19s005_Kiara_fb061c9a:

    # mc "Lo entiendo, pero no tomes ninguna decisión precipitada. Creo que se me está ocurriendo una idea."
    mc "I understand, but don't make any rash decisions. I think I'm coming up with an idea."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2442
translate english c19s005_Kiara_70cb7ff7:

    # mad "Hola, ¿interrumpo algo?"
    mad "Hello, am I interrupting anything?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2443
translate english c19s005_Kiara_5423af24:

    # mc "Hola de nuevo, Maddie. No, no te preocupes. ¿Necesitas algo?"
    mc "Hello again, Maddie. No, don't worry, do you need anything?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2445
translate english c19s005_Kiara_0d69ec4c:

    # mad "Estamos haciendo un juego en el Jacuzzi y venía a preguntarle a Kiara si se quería apuntar."
    mad "We're playing a game in the Jacuzzi, and I was coming to ask Kiara if she wanted to join in."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2446
translate english c19s005_Kiara_3643a8af:

    # mc "¿Sólo Kiara?"
    mc "Just Kiara?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2447
translate english c19s005_Kiara_ccd329d1:

    # mad "Es un juego solo de chicas, [mc]. Lo siento. Algo para crear más vínculos entre nosotras."
    mad "It's a girls-only game, [mc]. Sorry. Something to help us bond with each other a little bit more."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2449
translate english c19s005_Kiara_eddcc4ea:

    # kia "¡Me apunto! ¿De qué va el juego?"
    kia "I'm in! What's the game all about?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2451
translate english c19s005_Kiara_71fc6a2a:

    # mad "Mejor te lo explico por el camino. Ya estamos unas cuantas allí."
    mad "I'd better explain it to you on the way. There are a few of us already there."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2453
translate english c19s005_Kiara_a96c5624:

    # kia "Te veo luego, [mc]. Me tienes que explicar esa idea que has tenido."
    kia "See you later, [mc]. You have to explain to me that idea you had."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2454
translate english c19s005_Kiara_de4d03e5:

    # mc "Perfecto."
    mc "Perfect."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2456
translate english c19s005_Kiara_8aa8992c:

    # "Kiara cruza la piscina a nado y se va junto a Maddie hacia el Jacuzzi."
    "Kiara swims across the pool and goes along with Maddie to the Jacuzzi."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2457
translate english c19s005_Kiara_13a99306:

    # mcp "(Al menos ha quedado aclarado el tema de Kiara. A ver cómo evoluciona.)"
    mcp "(At least the Kiara issue has been cleared up. Let's see how it evolves)."

