# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2680
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_a14f4e32:

    # eil "Si hubiera sabido antes a qué estaban jugando, me hubiera apuntado sin que me vinieran a buscar."
    eil "If I had known earlier what they were playing at, I would have joined without them coming for me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2681
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_f05287fa:

    # eil "Es una forma genial de conocernos más entre nosotras."
    eil "It's a great way for us to get to know each other better."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2682
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_1adb1d1b:

    # mc "Antes de que os vayáis, ¿puedo hablar un momento contigo, Eile?"
    mc "Before you go, can I talk to you for a moment, Eile?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2684
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_68d73158:

    # lis "Os espero aquí. No puedo volver con las manos vacías o volveré a perder mi top."
    lis "I'll wait for you here. I can't go back empty-handed, or I'll lose my top again."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2685
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_49f00a56:

    # mc "Solo serán dos minutos, no te preocupes."
    mc "It will only take two minutes, don't worry."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2687
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_0c6631c5:

    # eil "Dime, supongo que es sobre mi madre."
    eil "Tell me, I guess it's about my mother."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2688
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_2b70e735:

    # eil "Os he visto antes, hablando."
    eil "I saw you before, talking."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2689
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_d2517362:

    # mc "Sí, sigue empeñada en mudarse. Al menos ya no quiere volver a vuestra casa."
    mc "Yes, she's still determined to move out. At least she doesn't want to move back into your house anymore."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2690
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_ff59076c:

    # mc "He conseguido que retrase la decisión. Al menos unos días."
    mc "I got her to delay the moving out. At least for a few days."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2692
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_45024033:

    # eil "Gracias, [mc]. No sé cómo lo has conseguido, pero gracias."
    eil "Thank you, [mc]. I don't know how you did it, but thank you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2693
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_b1824f5d:

    # eil "Estar aquí le está haciendo mucho bien, e irnos ahora sería un error."
    eil "Being here is doing her a lot of good, and leaving now would be a mistake."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2694
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_1dd81765:

    # mc "Tengo una idea que podría resolverlo todo, pero tengo que atar unos cabos sueltos antes."
    mc "I have an idea that could solve everything, but I have to tie up some loose ends first."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2696
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_b35f9ed3:

    # eil "¿Que nos mudemos con Tía Betty y Oma Olivia?"
    eil "Move in with Aunt Betty and Yaya Olivia?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2697
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_dca83863:

    # mc "¿Oma Olivia? ¡Eso es nuevo!"
    mc "Yaya Olivia? That's new!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2699
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_bd429a58:

    # eil "*Risa* Sí. Lexi ha empezado a llamarla así. Oma es abuela en Colombia, creo. Pienso que se le va a quedar el nombre."
    eil "*Laugh* Yes. Lexi has started calling her that. Yaya is a grandmother in Colombia, I think. I think she's going to keep the moniker."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2700
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_dfee4cac:

    # mc "¡Es genial! Eso muestra que el cariño en esta familia va en todos los sentidos."
    mc "That's great! That shows that the affection in this family goes all the way around."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2701
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_c842883c:

    # mc "Meemaw se ha emocionado mucho con todos los abrazos."
    mc "Meemaw has become very emotional with all the hugs."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2703
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_7f4c599f:

    # eil "Claro que va en todos los sentidos. Todas nos hemos sentido aliviadas cuando ha unido las palabras cancer y limpia."
    eil "Of course it goes all the way around. We were all relieved when she put the words cancer and clean together."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2704
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_81bfafc9:

    # eil "Pero a lo que íbamos. ¿Esa ha sido tu idea? ¿Que nos mudemos con ellas?"
    eil "But what we were getting at. Was that your idea? That we should move in with them?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2705
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_10287fce:

    # mc "Sí, sería bueno que hablarais sobre ello."
    mc "Yes, it would be a good idea if you talked to them about it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2707
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_ec47dea0:

    # eil "A mí también se me había ocurrido y quería hablar con ellas un día de estos. Pagarles un alquiler o algo por una habitación."
    eil "I had thought of that too, and I wanted to talk to them one of these days. Pay them rent or something for a room."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2708
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_6837067a:

    # mc "Las grandes mentes piensan igual. *Risa*"
    mc "Great minds think alike. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2710
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_dfb9a44b:

    # mc "Hay otra cosa..."
    mc "There is something else..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2712
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_158d3825:

    # eil "Me das miedo cuando lo dices así. ¿Qué ha pasado?"
    eil "You scare me when you say it like that. What happened?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2715
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_ffc1d4b8:

    # mc "Ya has visto que sólo estoy contigo..."
    mc "You saw that I'm only dating you..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2717
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_4490f0cd:

    # eil "Sí..."
    eil "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2718
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_5bbf18c6:

    # mc "Pero aquel día, en el bosque, hablaste de un harén, y de ser la Primera Concubina..."
    mc "But that day, in the forest, you spoke of a harem, and of being the First Concubine..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2719
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_4490f0cd_1:

    # eil "Sí..."
    eil "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2721
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_97804d23:

    # mc "Ahora ya sabes quién forma parte del harén..."
    mc "Now you know who is part of the harem..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2723
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_4490f0cd_2:

    # eil "Sí..."
    eil "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2724
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_c3027cf4:

    # mc "Recuerdo aquel día, en el bosque, cuando hablaste de ser la Primera Concubina..."
    mc "I remember that day, in the forest, when you talked about being the First Concubine..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2725
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_4490f0cd_3:

    # eil "Sí..."
    eil "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2727
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_8b0c7515:

    # mc "Tú y yo fuimos felices en el instituto..."
    mc "You and I were happy in high school..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2729
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_4490f0cd_4:

    # eil "Sí..."
    eil "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2730
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_c85d7a93:

    # mc "Y, cuando rompimos, prometimos no inmiscuírnos en las futuras relaciones del otro..."
    mc "And, when we broke up, we promised not to interfere in each other's future relationships..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2731
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_4490f0cd_5:

    # eil "Sí..."
    eil "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2732
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_1c83c84a:

    # mc "Creo que deberías hablar con Kiara sobre ello."
    mc "I think you should talk to Kiara about it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2734
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_4f31b07d:

    # eil "¿Qué? ¿Tú y mi madre?"
    eil "What? You and my mother?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2735
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_67858e4c:

    # mc "No, no estamos juntos, no te preocupes."
    mc "No, we're not together, don't worry."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2737
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_3ecc353d:

    # eil "No entiendo de qué quieres que hable con ella, entonces."
    eil "I don't understand what you want me to talk to her about, then."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2738
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_a4aaae33:

    # mc "De cual sería tu posición si lo estuviéramos."
    mc "About what your position would be if we were."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2740
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_f5c04f5d:

    # eil "¿Me estás pidiendo permiso para salir con mi madre? *Risa* ¿No solía ser al revés?"
    eil "Are you asking me for permission to date my mother? *Laugh* Didn't it used to be the other way around?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2741
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_7479b5a5:

    # mc "En cierto modo, sí. También te estoy pidiendo que hables con ella para despejar sus dudas sobre cómo te sentirías si lo hicieramos."
    mc "In a way, yes. I'm also asking you to talk to her to clear up her doubts about how you would feel if we did."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2743
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_e61ce099:

    # eil "Sabes que va a ser raro tener esa conversación, ¿verdad?"
    eil "You know that conversation is going to be a weird one to have, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2744
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_19622137:

    # mc "Me lo imagino, pero a ella le preocupa."
    mc "I can imagine, but she's worried about it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2746
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_e3115916:

    # mc "Le preocupa como te sentirías si ella y yo empezaramos algo teniendo en cuenta que tú y yo no hemos vuelto."
    mc "She's worried about how you would feel if she and I started something considering you and I haven't gotten back together."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2748
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_49d206e0:

    # mc "Le preocupa que la percibas como \"la otra\". Cómo te sentirías si saliera con las dos."
    mc "She is concerned that you perceive her as \"the other one\". How you would feel if I dated both of you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2750
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_a6b63113:

    # mc "Le preocupa tener que compartir harén contigo."
    mc " She's worried about having to share a harem with you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2753
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_24380e09:

    # eil "¡Joder! ¡A mí también me preocuparía! ¡Compartir hombre con mi madre no es normal!"
    eil "Fuck! I'd be worried too! Sharing a man with my mother is not normal!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2755
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_2d8661b4:

    # eil "¡Joder! ¡A mí también me preocuparía! ¡Primero sales con la hija y después con la madre!"
    eil "Fuck! I'd be worried too! First you date the daughter and then the mother!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2775
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_cdba0774:

    # eil "Aunque no seamos la primera pareja madre e hija con la que estás."
    eil "Even if we're not the first mother-daughter pair you've been with."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2779
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_904c6474:

    # eil "Sólo te quedarían Olivia y [nor], y Olivia y [mar]."
    eil "You would only have Olivia and [nor], and Olivia and [mar] left."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2781
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_857de542:

    # eil "Y con las hijas ya estás... te faltaría añadir a Olivia al harén."
    eil "And you already are dating the daughters... you just need to add Olivia to the harem."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2783
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_d6210b7a:

    # eil "Sólo te quedarían Olivia y [nor]."
    eil "You would only have Olivia and [nor] left."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2785
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_67eeb0bb:

    # eil "Y con [nor] ya estás... te faltaría añadir a Olivia al harén."
    eil "And you're already dating [nor]... you'd only have to add Olivia to the harem."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2789
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_b02930f2:

    # eil "Esto es muy raro, [mc]."
    eil "This is really weird, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2790
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_d59729c7:

    # mc "Lo es. Pero hablarás con ella, ¿verdad?"
    mc "It is. But you'll talk to her, right?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2792
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_514b4fed:

    # eil "¡Claro que hablaré con ella! Es raro, pero también creo que puedes ser muy bueno para ella."
    eil "Of course I'll talk to her! It's weird, but I also think you can be very good for her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2793
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_59628053:

    # eil "Y ella para ti. Aunque no va a ser una conversación fácil."
    eil "And she for you. It's not going to be an easy conversation, though."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2794
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_fc7a94eb:

    # mc "Gracias, Eileen."
    mc "Thank you, Eileen."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2796
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_dcd90d58:

    # eil "¿Sabes dónde está?"
    eil "Do you know where she is?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2797
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_6132fad6:

    # mc "En el jacuzzi. Maddie la ha venido a buscar para que se uniera al juego hace un rato."
    mc "In the hot tub. Maddie came to get her to join the game a little while ago."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2799
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_32de6297:

    # eil "Entonces voy a ir al jacuzzi antes de que Lisa empiece a morderse las uñas."
    eil "Then I'm heading to the hot tub before Lisa starts biting her nails off."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2800
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_523c95b6:

    # eil "A ver si tengo oportunidad de hablar con ella antes de que acabe la fiesta. Si no, hablaré con ella esta noche."
    eil "Let's see if I get a chance to talk to her before the party is over. If not, I'll talk to her tonight."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2803
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_927ad361:

    # eil "Si no hay nada más, voy a ir al jacuzzi antes de que Lisa empiece a morderse las uñas."
    eil "If there's nothing else, I'm going to go to the hot tub before Lisa starts biting her nails."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2804
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_108cf442:

    # mc "De acuerdo, Eileen. Hablamos luego."
    mc "Okay, Eileen. Talk to you later."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2806
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_da96b6bb:

    # "Las dos chicas se dirigen al jacuzzi, Lisa visiblemente con prisa."
    "Both girls head for the hot tub, Lisa visibly in a hurry."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2807
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_242c54f4:

    # mcp "(¿Tiene la tarea un tiempo establecido para cumplirla?)"
    mcp "(Does the task have a set time to complete it?)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2808
translate english c19s007_EileenLisa_9a8ce1f2:

    # "Ves que Megan se acerca a ti. ¿Son galletas lo que lleva?"
    "You see Megan coming towards you. Is she carrying a plate of cookies?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2812
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_0b398993:

    # mc "¿Te has quedado con hambre, Megan? No podrás quejarte si no entras en el vestido esta noche."
    mc "Are you hungry, Megan? You won't have the right to complain if you don't get into your dress tonight."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2813
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_fd0c7fb7:

    # meg "*Risa* No es para mí, es para Jamaal. Me ha pedido que le trajera algo para merendar."
    meg "*Laugh* It's not for me, it's for Jamaal. He asked me to bring him something to snack on."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2814
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_03d26645:

    # mc "¡Maldito tragón! *Risa* ¿Dónde está? Déjame ayudarte."
    mc "Damned glutton! *Laugh* Where is he? Let me help you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2816
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_86645f15:

    # meg "Ha aparcado detrás de casa. *Risa* Toma la leche, mi pulso no es el mejor"
    meg "He's parked behind the house. *Laugh* Take the milk glass, my hands aren't the steadiest ones."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2817
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_4fe65ae1:

    # meg "No sé cómo he llegado hast aquí sin derramar nada."
    meg "I don't know how I got here without spilling anything."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2818
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_63cd8ebd:

    # mc "Vamos."
    mc "Let's go."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2820
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_9efdb09b:

    # mc "He oído que alguien insaciable había pedido comida por aquí. Tragón."
    mc "I heard someone insatiable had ordered food around here. Glutton."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2821
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_a96131b7:

    # jam "¡Hey! No he comido demasiado durante la comida. ¡No he repetido de ninguno de los tres pasteles!"
    jam "Hey! I didn't eat that much during lunch! I didn't have seconds of any of the three cakes!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2822
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_a4be2fb1:

    # mc "Creo que voy a dejar de meterme contigo por hoy. Aunque sólo sea para agradecerte lo que has intentado hacer con el mensaje."
    mc "I think I'm going to stop picking on you for today. If only to thank you for what you tried to do with the message."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2824
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_3c3d3bb0:

    # jam "No lo he hecho por ti. *Risa* Creía que era de alguna de las chicas."
    jam "I didn't do it for you. *Laugh* I thought it was from one of the girls."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2825
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_a3f6d506:

    # jam "No de mi madre o de mi hermana, las dos estuvieron en casa ayer."
    jam "Not from my mother or sister; they were both home yesterday."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2828
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_6620eaab:

    # jam "Aunque sospechara que tenías algo con mi madre, ha sido una grata sorpresa confirmarlo, padrastro."
    jam "Even though I suspected you had something going on with my mother, it was a pleasant surprise to confirm it, stepfather."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2830
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_964befa8:

    # jam "Además nunca sospeché que estuvieras con mi madre."
    jam "Besides, I never suspected you were with my mother."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2833
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_200de895:

    # jam "Y lo de Simone no ha llegado ni a sorpresa. Desde aquel dia en el café me olía algo."
    jam "And the Simone thing didn't even come as a surprise. Ever since that day in the cafe I could smell something about you two."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2835
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_da426c82:

    # jam "Y Simone me ha dado un poquito de pena. Siempre le has gustado..."
    jam "And Simone made me feel a little bit sorry for her. She always liked you..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2837
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_45cbceeb:

    # jam "Y si estabas con alguna de las otras chicas, había que protegerlas, ¿no?"
    jam "And if you were with any of the other girls, they had to be protected, right?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2840
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_135d8630:

    # meg "Yo te lo agradezco. Si el mensaje lo hubiera enviado yo, me hubiera muerto de vergüenza mientras lo leía Samantha."
    meg "I thank you. If I had sent the message, I would have died of embarrassment as Samantha read it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2841
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_d26ebeda:

    # meg "Aunque nunca hubiera mandado un mensaje como ese. Has actuado como un buen amigo."
    meg "Although I would never have sent a message like that. You've acted like a good friend."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2843
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_974e0a19:

    # meg "Dudo que ninguna de las chicas de la familia enviara un mensaje como ese, pero has actuado como un buen amigo."
    meg "I doubt any of the girls in the family would send a message like that, but you've acted like a good friend."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2845
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_9f1d7bd0:

    # meg "Hubieras quedado mejor si Tía Betty no hubiera intentado lo mismo que tú, claro. *Risa*"
    meg "It would have looked better if Aunt Betty hadn't tried the same thing you did, of course. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2846
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_37aedb8f:

    # mc "Lo de Betty ha sido alucinante. Si no hubieran hablado a la vez, todo hubiera sido distinto."
    mc "Betty's thing was awesome. If they hadn't spoken at the same time, everything would have been different."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2848
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_79786450:

    # jam "Especialmente creo que Olivia no hubiera confesado sin lo de Tía Betty."
    jam "I especially think Olivia wouldn't have confessed without Aunt Betty's story."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2850
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_540c08c0:

    # mc "Ni el resto de las chicas, obviamente. Yo hacía tiempo que quería hacer algo así, aunque no de esta forma."
    mc "Nor the rest of the girls, obviously. I had wanted to do something like this for a long time, though not in this way."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2853
