    # "Ves que Megan se acerca a ti. ¿Es un plato de galletas y un vaso de leche lo que lleva en las manos?"
    "You see Megan coming towards you. Is that a plate of cookies and a glass of milk in her hands?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2828
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_06a72514:

    # "Mientras tanto, al otro lado de la casa..."
    "Meanwhile, on the other side of the house..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2834
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_28ba74d4:

    # meg "No sé cómo he llegado hasta aquí sin derramar nada."
    meg "I don't know how I got here without spilling anything."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2837
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_19e4cdeb:

    # "Por fin descubres dónde está la silla que faltaba. Jamaal es más culpable de lo que Olivia pensaba."
    "You finally find out where the missing chair was. Jamaal is more guilty than Olivia thought."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2851
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_bfa91bda:

    # jam "Y lo de Simone no ha llegado ni a sorpresa. Desde aquel día en el café me olía algo."
    jam "And the Simone thing didn't even come as a surprise. Ever since that day in the cafe, I could smell something about you two."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2874
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_5557efc0:

    # meg "Y Olivia tampoco lo hubiera hecho. Me alegro de que haya confesado. Es una mujer adorable."
    meg "And Olivia wouldn't have confessed either. I'm glad she did it. She's a lovely woman."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2879
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_c0af4d33:

    # meg "Por supuesto que no. Tenía la intención de hacerlo más adelante, pero no hoy."
    meg "Of course not. I intended to do it later, but not today."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2880
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_5557efc0_1:

    # meg "Y Olivia tampoco lo hubiera hecho. Me alegro de que haya confesado. Es una mujer adorable."
    meg "And Olivia wouldn't have confessed either. I'm glad she did it. She's a lovely woman."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2890
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_6e10c789:

    # jam "Olivia antes era adorable. *Risa* Como un sargento de instrucción."
    jam "Olivia used to be lovely. *Laugh* Like a drill sergeant."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2931
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_75e140a8:

    # meg "Lo sé, [mc]. No te preocupes. *Risa* Pero ver tu cara preocupándote por si me habías ofendido ha valido la pena."
    meg "I know, [mc]. Don't worry. *Laugh* But seeing your face worrying about whether you had offended me was worth it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2932
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_6d82eea4:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que pasas demasiado tiempo con Jamaal."
    mc "*Laugh* I think you spend too much time with Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2934
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_b4acabdb:

    # jam "¡Hey! Mi alianza con Kate y con Tía Betty ha sido un fracaso. Tengo que buscar nuevos socios. *Risa*"
    jam "Hey! My alliance with Kate and Aunt Betty has been a failure. I have to find new partners. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2935
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_513cff19:

    # mc "¿Desde cuándo necesitas aliados contra mí? ¿Ya no eres capaz de defenderte por ti mismo?"
    mc "Since when do you need allies against me? Are you no longer capable of standing up for yourself? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2937
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_72733f61:

    # jam "Tú has conseguido que Olivia se meta conmigo, yo tengo que conseguir que el resto de las chicas se metan contigo."
    jam "You got Olivia to mess with me, I have to get the rest of the girls to mess with you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2938
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_8e5c9e50:

    # mc "No, Jam. *Risa* Que Meemaw se meta contigo ha sido totalmente obra tuya."
    mc "No, Jam. *Laugh* Meemaw messing with you was totally your doing."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2940
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_744f25fa:

    # meg "Habláis de vosotros como si fuera una guerra. *Risa* Lo siento, Jamaal, pero los objetivos con poca movilidad suelen ser los primeros en caer."
    meg "You guys talk about yourselves like it's a war. *Laugh* Sorry, Jamaal, but targets with low mobility are usually the first to fall."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2941
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_59b3c26d:

    # mc "*Risa* Esa ha sido muy ingeniosa, Meg."
    mc "*Laugh* That was a very clever one, Meg."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2943
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_4c8f7969:

    # jam "¿Ves? Incluso la adorable Megan se mete conmigo ya. Y yo creía que era una buena chica."
    jam "See, even the adorable Megan is picking on me. And I thought she was a nice girl."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2945
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_3da0423a:

    # meg "Si no hubieras hablado de alimentarme para que produjera leche, quizás podría haber habido una alianza. *Risa* Tratarme como a una vaca no es una buena opción diplomática, Jam."
    meg "If you hadn't talked about feeding me to produce milk, maybe there could have been an alliance. *Laugh* Treating me like a cow is not a good diplomatic move, Jam."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2946
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_da436d1c:

    # mc "No digas palabras complicadas como diplomacia. Jam no las va a entender."
    mc "Don't say complicated words like diplomacy. Jam won't understand them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2948
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_40546258:

    # jam "¡Hey! Tengo las piernas inútiles, no el cerebro."
    jam "Hey! My legs are useless, not my brain."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2949
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_df4b5e92:

    # mc "¿Estás seguro de eso? *Risa*"
    mc "Are you sure about that? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2951
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_75f75a3e:

    # "Pasáis un rato riéndoos los unos de los otros. Megan uniéndose a vuestro deporte favorito es una grata sorpresa."
    "You spend some time laughing at each other. Megan joining your favorite sport is a pleasant surprise."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2952
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_d6e8cd1e:

    # "Después de, como dice ella, tratarla como una vaca, está más o menos a salvo de vuestras pullas. Al menos por hoy. Ha sido una buena estrategia por su parte."
    "After, as she says, treating her like a cow, she's more or less safe from your pulses. At least for today. It was a good strategy on her part."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2954
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_5e477e80:

    # mc "Os voy a abandonar un rato. Voy a comprobar si alguien necesita algo por ahí."
    mc "I'm going to leave you guys for a while. I'm going to check to see if anyone needs anything."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2955
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_d7551cfe:

    # meg "Pásalo bien, y acuérdate de guardar un poco de tiempo para ti."
    meg "Have a good time. And remember to reserve a little time for yourself."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2956
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_880cbdd4:

    # jam "Si pasas por la cocina de [nor], tráeme un trozo de pastel. Del de [eri]."
    jam "If you stop by [nor]'s kitchen, bring me a piece of cake. From [eri]'s."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2957
translate english c19s007_MeganJamaal_5ae61e06:

    # mc "¡Tragón!"
    mc "Glutton!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2961
translate english c19s006_Alexia_021299d1:

    # "Casi todo el mundo ha desaparecido de la piscina. Supones que deben estar en el jacuzzi de [nor]. Te diriges a la cocina a por el pastel de Jamaal."
    "Almost everyone has disappeared from the pool. You assume they must be in [nor]'s hot tub. You head to the kitchen to get Jamaal's cake."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2962
translate english c19s006_Alexia_7a30956d:

    # "A medio camino te encuentras con una visión sorprendente."
    "Halfway through you come across a surprising sight."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2964
translate english c19s006_Alexia_aca76b56:

    # mc "¿Ya os habéis cansado del juego?"
    mc "Have you had enough of the game?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2965
translate english c19s006_Alexia_e54cf16e:

    # bet "Ha sido muy divertido e instructivo. *Risa* Pero con Alexia, Amanda, y Eva ganando casi cada ronda, se estaba volviendo peligroso."
    bet "It's been a lot of fun and instructive. *Laugh* But with Alexia, Amanda, and Eva winning almost every round, it was getting dangerous."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2966
translate english c19s006_Alexia_43a80457:

    # kim "Van a poder hacer una colección de tops de bikinis. *Risa* Pero ha estado bien."
    kim "They're going to be able to make a bikini top collection. *Laugh* But it was nice."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2967
translate english c19s006_Alexia_cdbba342:

    # mom "Pero cuando casi no quedaban tops, hemos considerado que era mejor dejarlo."
    mom "But when there were almost no tops left, we felt it was better to stop."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2968
translate english c19s006_Alexia_7efa2fa8:

    # mc "Entonces, ¿ya puedo visitar el jacuzzi?"
    mc "So, can I visit the hot tub now?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2970
translate english c19s006_Alexia_b37b5a07:

    # kim "Yo no te lo recomendaría. Han decidido que sea zona exclusivamente nudista por el resto de la fiesta. *Risa*"
    kim "I wouldn't recommend it. They've decided to make it a nudist-only area for the rest of the party. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2971
translate english c19s006_Alexia_f9d14a88:

    # mc "¿Quienes? ¿Lo ha aprobado [nor]?"
    mc "Who? Did [nor] approve it?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2973
translate english c19s006_Alexia_b12bbbfb:

    # mom "Amanda, Alexia, y Eva. Era eso o que Betty perdiera sus braguitas. Todas lo hemos aceptado, con lo que [nor] estará de acuerdo."
    mom "Amanda, Alexia, and Eva. It was either that or Betty losing her panties. We all accepted it, so [nor] will agree with that."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2974
translate english c19s006_Alexia_f68a1bb8:

    # mc "*Risa* Veo que el juego se ha puesto serio."
    mc "*Laugh* I see the game has gotten serious."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2976
translate english c19s006_Alexia_b7b505e4:

    # bet "Y además yo voy sin recortar. *Risa* Demasiado pelo para los filtros del jacuzzi."
    bet "And I'm also untrimmed. *Laugh* Too much hair for the hot tub filters."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2977
translate english c19s006_Alexia_3b998b09:

    # mc "¿Tú también vas en modo Yeti?"
    mc "Are you in Yeti mode too?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2979
translate english c19s006_Alexia_47002ebd:

    # bet "*Risa* No creo que lo vayas a saber nunca."
    bet "*Laugh* I don't think you'll ever know."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2980
translate english c19s006_Alexia_333116f3:

    # bet "Hemos decidido volver a la piscina para tomar el sol un rato. ¿Te apuntas?"
    bet "We've decided to go back to the pool to sunbathe for a while. Are you joining us?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2981
translate english c19s006_Alexia_7e892226:

    # mc "Iba a llevarle un trozo de pastel a Jamaal."
    mc "I was going to bring Jamaal a piece of cake."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2983
translate english c19s006_Alexia_10af3067:

    # mom "No te preocupes, ya se lo llevo yo. ¿Dónde está?"
    mom "Don't worry, I'll bring one to him. Where is he?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2984
translate english c19s006_Alexia_00c11ac2:

    # mc "Con Megan, detrás de casa. Quiere un trozo del pastel de [eri]."
    mc "With Megan, behind the house. He wants a piece of [eri]'s cake."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2985
translate english c19s006_Alexia_08f24711:

    # mom "Ok. Te vemos luego en la piscina."
    mom "Ok. See you later at the pool."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2986
translate english c19s006_Alexia_a8dd5ffa:

    # mc "Primero voy a hablar un momento con esas chicas y a pasar por el jacuzzi."
    mc "I'm going to go talk to those girls for a minute first, and then I'll stop by the hot tub."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2987
translate english c19s006_Alexia_fcbcab5f:

    # mom "Por cierto, los pasteles están en nuestra cocina. En la nevera de [nor] no cabía nada más."
    mom "By the way, the cakes are in our kitchen. There was no room in [nor]'s fridge for anything else."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2989
translate english c19s006_Alexia_b7ae992a:

    # mc "Hola, chicas. ¿Vosotras tampoco teníais secretos jugosos que contar?"
    mc "Hey, girls, you didn't have any juicy secrets to tell either?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2990
translate english c19s006_Alexia_cbf28dcb:

    # eil "Yo no he perdido ninguna ronda. *Risa* Si lo hubiera hecho estaría arriba con las nudistas."
    eil "I haven't lost any rounds. *Laugh* If I had, I'd be up there with the nudist girls."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2991
translate english c19s006_Alexia_87e66fac:

    # kia "Estas chicas tienen cosas muy interesantes que contar. Yo he perdido una. Y no quería perderme nada, con lo que he rechazado la tarea."
    kia "These girls have very interesting things to tell. I lost one round. And I didn't want to miss anything, so I turned down the task."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2992
translate english c19s006_Alexia_ed2759a6:

    # kia "No pasaba nada por liberar a las gemelas. Éramos solo chicas. Lo que no sabía es que la ropa se la quedaban las vencedoras."
    kia "There was nothing wrong with releasing the twins. We were just girls. What I didn't know was that the clothes were kept by the victors."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2993
translate english c19s006_Alexia_f351a783:

    # sim "Yo he perdido dos, pero he ganado una y he recuperado una pieza."
    sim "I lost two, but I won one and got one piece back."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2995
translate english c19s006_Alexia_875fa564:

    # sim "¿Vas a venir a la piscina?"
    sim "Are you coming to the pool?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2996
translate english c19s006_Alexia_00e00ee7:

    # mc "Dentro de un rato. Ahora que habéis dejado de tener el jacuzzi solo para chicas, voy a relajarme un rato allí."
    mc "In a while. Now that you guys have stopped having the girls-only hot tub, I'm going to relax in there for a bit."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2998
translate english c19s006_Alexia_68002e97:

    # kia "No sé si te lo han dicho, pero ahora es zona nudista."
    kia "I don't know if you've been told, but it's now a nudist area."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:2999
translate english c19s006_Alexia_bd7d6075:

    # mc "Supongo que eso sólo se aplica a las que jugabais, ¿no?"
    mc "I guess that only applies to the ones who were playing, right?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3001
translate english c19s006_Alexia_b6fa9acb:

    # kia "Pues la verdad es que no lo sé... han dicho lo de la zona nudista y todas hemos estado de acuerdo para evitarle a Betty el tener que desnudarse."
    kia "Well, the truth is that I don't know... they said it was a nudist area and we all agreed to save Betty from having to get naked."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3002
translate english c19s006_Alexia_c67eeec9:

    # kia "Conociendo a esas chicas, es posible que lo quieran aplicar a todo el mundo, pero no tendría mucha lógica que el resto os vierais obligados si no jugabais."
    kia "Knowing those girls, they might want to apply it to everyone, but it wouldn't make much sense that the rest of you would be forced to, if you didn't play."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3003
translate english c19s006_Alexia_a5bcd400:

    # mc "Iré a preguntar y a aclararlo."
    mc "I'll go ask and clarify."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3005
translate english c19s006_Alexia_95ceb15d:

    # eil "Mientras tú vas, {b}mi madre y yo vamos a tener una conversación que tenemos pendiente{/b}. Y no es una propuesta, Mamá."
    eil "While you go, {b}my mother and I are going to have a conversation we have pending{/b}. And it's not a proposal, Mom."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3007
translate english c19s006_Alexia_4679029a:

    # kia "Pero... la piscina..."
    kia "But... the pool..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3009
translate english c19s006_Alexia_e270e33a:

    # eil "Va a seguir ahí cuando acabemos de hablar. Tengo sed, con lo que puedes... {b}vas a{/b} acompañarme a la cocina de [nor] a beber un poco de agua."
    eil "It's still going to be there when we finish talking. I'm thirsty, so you can... {b}you're going to{/b} come with me to [nor]'s kitchen to get a glass of water."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3011
translate english c19s006_Alexia_d41a5731:

    # kia "Vaaale..."
    kia "Okaaay..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3013
translate english c19s006_Alexia_b48f9698:

    # sim "Yo os espero a todos en la piscina. Tengo ganas de tomar el sol con las chicas libres."
    sim "I'll wait for you all at the pool. I feel like sunbathing with the freed girls."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3014
translate english c19s006_Alexia_57e3fe45:

    # mc "Os veo luego allí."
    mc "I'll see you there later."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3016
translate english c19s006_Alexia_c3b2bead:

    # mcp "(No quisiera estar en la piel de Kiara. Eileen puede ser muy asertiva cuando quiere.)"
    mcp "(I wouldn't want to be in Kiara's shoes. Eileen can be very assertive when she wants to.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3018
translate english c19s006_Alexia_24b67a97:

    # mc "Hola, chicas. Veo que os habéis quedado el jacuzzi para vosotras solas."
    mc "Hello, girls. I see you've kept the hot tub all to yourselves."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3019
translate english c19s006_Alexia_cab65e40:

    # oma "No para nosotras solas, sino para cualquiera que quiera estar en la nueva zona nudista."
    oma "Not at all for ourselves, but for anyone who wants to be in the new nudist area."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3020
translate english c19s006_Alexia_69c20b46:

    # mc "No sé si eso le va a gustar mucho a [nor]."
    mc "I don't know if [nor] is going to like that very much."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3021
translate english c19s006_Alexia_132018e5:

    # ama "No creo que le importe mucho. Solo va a ser por un rato."
    ama "I don't think she'll mind too much. It's only going to be for a little while."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3022
translate english c19s006_Alexia_47845bae:

    # eva "Esperábamos que se uniera, pero Betty ha perdido demasiado rápido como para a mandar a alguien a buscarla."
    eva "We were hoping she would join, but Betty lost too quickly to send someone to look for her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3023
translate english c19s006_Alexia_a5315640:

    # mc "¿Todos esos viajes de Lisa y Maddie eran porque habían perdido una de las rondas?"
    mc "All those trips by Lisa and Maddie were because they lost one of the rounds?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3025
translate english c19s006_Alexia_e850d3b7:

    # ama "Sí, algunas chicas han sido poco imaginativas con las tareas cuando alguien perdía. Querían que se uniera todo el mundo."
    ama "Yes, some girls have been unimaginative with the tasks when someone lost. They wanted everyone to join in."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3026
translate english c19s006_Alexia_4ede641c:

    # mc "Posiblemente no querían avergonzarlas, obligándolas a quitarse ropa."
    mc "Possibly they didn't want to embarrass them by forcing them to take off their clothes."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3028
translate english c19s006_Alexia_4080c842:

    # eva "No lo entiendes... ¿Has visto a Kiara, Simone, Betty, o Kim avergonzadas?"
    eva "You don't understand... Have you seen Kiara, Simone, Betty, or Kim embarrassed?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3029
translate english c19s006_Alexia_cc761816:

    # mc "No..."
    mc "No..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3030
translate english c19s006_Alexia_eff7f297:

    # eva "Sólo necesitaban un empujón para unirse al topless. Simone incluso ha llegado a estar totalmente desnuda un rato, hasta que ha ganado una ronda."
    eva "They just needed a push to join the topless crowd. Simone even went completely nude for a while, until she won a round."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3031
translate english c19s006_Alexia_8aa83788:

    # mc "Pero..."
    mc "But..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3033
translate english c19s006_Alexia_7a273aa0:

    # oma "Por eso hemos empezado el juego. Ninguna de ellas ha reclamado sus tops cuando ha acabado. Tampoco se los hubiéramos dado. Son nuestro botín. *Risa*"
    oma "That's why we started the game. None of them claimed their tops when it was over. We wouldn't have given them to them either. They're our loot. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3034
translate english c19s006_Alexia_a2c315be:

    # oma "Hemos conseguido que se sientan a gusto aquí, entre chicas. Ahora también lo estarán cuando tú estés alrededor."
    oma "We've made them feel comfortable here, among girls. Now they'll be comfortable when you're around, too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3035
translate english c19s006_Alexia_d0954521:

    # mc "Pero podría haberos explotado en la cara..."
    mc "But it could have blown up in your face..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3037
translate english c19s006_Alexia_e4301428:

    # ama "Podría, pero yo he perdido una de las primeras rondas... casi a propósito. Cuando he ganado varias rondas después no he reclamado mis braguitas."
    ama "It could, but I lost one of the first rounds... almost on purpose. When I won several rounds later I didn't claim my panties back."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3038
translate english c19s006_Alexia_5522cad1:

    # ama "Eso, y que Alexia estuviera desnuda desde el principio, les ha demostrado que no pasaba nada. Que todo era muy natural."
    ama "That, and Alexia being naked from the start, has shown them that there was nothing wrong. That it was all quite natural."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3039
translate english c19s006_Alexia_dabf8386:

    # mc "¿Me estás diciendo que teníais una estrategia antes de empezar?"
    mc "Are you telling me you had a strategy before you started?"

