translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_a0150e17:

    # sol "¿Tu familia? ¡Esa es mi familia! Solo quiero recuperarla."
    sol "Your family? That's my family! I just want to get it back."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3467
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_4c4b2720:

    # eil "¿Recuperarla? ¿Así?"
    eil "Get it back? This way?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3468
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_02e8ee48:

    # eil "Vienes aquí tratando a Mamá como mierda. Como has hecho siempre. Exigiéndole que vuelva a casa..."
    eil "You come here treating Mom like shit. Like you've always done. Demanding her to go back home..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3470
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_113e14c7:

    # kia "Llevo casi una semana aquí, Solomon. En una semana me han mostrado más respeto y cariño que tú en 22 años."
    kia "I've been here almost a week, Solomon. I've been shown more respect and affection in a week than you have in 22 years."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3471
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_9069d1ab:

    # kia "Esto es una familia. Lo que nosotros teníamos era una mala imitación de lo que debe ser una familia."
    kia "This is a family. What we had was a bad imitation of what a family should be."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3473
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_28d74db7:

    # eil "Mamá es feliz aquí. Nunca volverá contigo."
    eil "Mom is happy here. She'll never come back to you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3475
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_66e08abe:

    # sol "¡Estamos casados! ¡Nunca te daré el divorcio!"
    sol "We're married! I'll never let you get a divorce!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3476
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_5f892040:

    # sol "¡Estarás viviendo en pecado con este niñato!"
    sol "You'll be living in sin with this brat!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3477
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_98593f5b:

    # mc "A mí puedes insultarme. Esta vez."
    mc "You can insult me. This time."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3479
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_24bbc047:

    # kia "[mc] y yo no estamos juntos, Solomon. Tan solo lo estamos en tu imaginación."
    kia "[mc] and I are not together, Solomon. We are only together in your imagination."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3480
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_dd16249f:

    # kia "Vete a tu casa y déjanos en paz. Esta es una fiesta a la que no estás invitado."
    kia "Go to your house and leave us alone. This is a party you're not invited to."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3482
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_a0336692:

    # eil "No están juntos..."
    eil "They're not together..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3484
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_52feb4c8:

    # eil "Pero, si de mí depende, lo van a estar. Yo me ocuparé de ello."
    eil "But, if it's up to me, they will be. I'll take care of it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3486
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_6cc920fb:

    # eil "Pero podrían estarlo. [mc] es más y mejor hombre de lo que tú serás nunca."
    eil "But they might be. [mc] is more and a better man than you will ever be."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3488
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_2772c22a:

    # kia "¡Calla, Eileen!"
    kia "Shut up, Eileen!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3489
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_a50eb134:

    # mc "Puede opinar, Kiara. También es... era su familia."
    mc " She can have her say, Kiara. He also is... was... her family."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3491
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_a05bb931:

    # kia "Puede opinar sobre su padre. No sobre lo que yo haga con mi vida o con quién esté. Es mi vida, no la suya."
    kia "She can have a say about her father. Not about what I do with my life or who I'm with. It's my life, not hers."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3493
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_e30ddaa0:

    # mcp "(Parece que la conversación entre ellas no ha ido como Eileen esperaba.)"
    mcp "(It looks like the conversation between them has not gone as Eileen had anticipated.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3494
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_fc0388ef:

    # mc "Tienes razón. Es algo que solo tú puedes decidir."
    mc "You're right. It's something only you can decide."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3496
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_99d5d37c:

    # sol "¿Con quién estés? ¡Tienes que estar conmigo, maldita zorra! ¡Soy tu marido a los ojos de Dios!"
    sol "Who are you with? You have to be with me, you fucking whore! I'm your husband in the eyes of God!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3497
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_ab7fb63b:

    # mc "Te lo he advertido..."
    mc "I warned you..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3499
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_d1bab443:

    # sol "¡Oh, no!"
    sol "Oh, no!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3508
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_f5e6587d:

    # "La sensación de tu pie desnudo impactando en sus testículos es desagradable."
    "The feeling of your bare foot hitting his balls is unpleasant."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3509
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_a40dfba0:

    # "La sensación de darle su merecido es increíble."
    "The feeling of giving him his due is unbelievable."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3511
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_e2ab98af:

    # sol "*Voz aguda* ¡Cabrón!"
    sol "*Pitched voice* You bastard!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3512
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_d08ef8bb:

    # mc "No te vuelvas a levantar si no es para subirte al coche e irte."
    mc "Don't get up again unless it's to get in the car and go."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3513
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_38ec08ab:

    # mc "No vuelvas a abrir la boca. Ni siquiera para despedirte."
    mc "Don't open your mouth again. Not even to say goodbye."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3514
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_65c209ee:

    # mc "Esto ya está dejando de ser divertido."
    mc "This is no longer fun anymore."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3515
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_5349938f:

    # mcp "(Nunca he sido un tipo violento, y estoy disfrutando esto demasiado.)"
    mcp "(I've never been a violent guy, and I'm enjoying this too much.)"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3517
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_095a2187:

    # "Solomon te hace caso. Se levanta y se dirige al coche, con la cabeza baja, sin decir una palabra."
    "Solomon heeds your advice. He gets up and walks to the car, head down, without saying a word."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3519
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_753a8298:

    # "Se sienta en el coche, en silencio, durante unos segundos, antes de encender el motor."
    "He sits in the car, quietly, for a few seconds, before starting the engine."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3522
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_283f1067:

    # "Kiara te coge de los hombros y te gira hacia ella."
    "Kiara grabs you by your shoulders and turns you toward her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3523
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_158d2335:

    # kia "Gracias, [mc]. Tenías razón. No voy a estar mejor que en esta familia en ningún sitio."
    kia "Thank you, [mc]. You were right. I'm not going to be better off anywhere else, than here with this family."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3524
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_891b627e:

    # "Las piernas empiezan a temblarte. La adrenalina empieza a mostrar sus desagradables efectos secundarios."
    "Your legs start to shake. The adrenaline starts to show its nasty side effects."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3525
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_67d9bfb6:

    # mc "Siempre tendrás tu lugar aquí, Kiara."
    mc "Your place will always be here, Kiara."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3527
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b40e2d98:

    # kia "¡Gracias, [mc]! ¡Gracias a todos vosotros!"
    kia "Thank you, [mc]! Thank you all!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3528
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_5471c728:

    # "Tus piernas están temblando. Todo el cuerpo de Kiara tiembla como una hoja en un otoño ventoso."
    "Your legs are trembling. Kiara's whole body is shaking like a leaf in a windy Fall afternoon."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3529
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_c1aace3c:

    # "La abrazas fuertemente. Te abraza como si su vida dependiera de ello."
    "You hug her tightly. She hugs you like her life depends on it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3530
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_6f4b263a:

    # "Escuchas un sonido detrás tuyo. La puerta del coche de Solomon abriéndose."
    "You hear a sound behind you. Solomon's car door opening."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3531
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_714fc161:

    # ama "¡Cuidado!"
    ama "Watch out!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3532
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_adf0f7a9:

    # eil "¡[mc]!"
    eil "[mc]!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3533
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_439d3b98:

    # oma "¡Detrás tuyo!"
    oma "Behind you!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3534
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_85fbbe57:

    # todas "*Cacofonía de advertencias*"
    todas "*Cacophony of warnings*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3536
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_8bdc711a:

    # "Giras la cabeza en el último segundo. Tus brazos aún alrededor de Kiara."
    "You turn your head at the last second. Your arms still around Kiara."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3537
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_337ec51e:

    # sol "¡Hijo de la gran puta!"
    sol "You son of a bitch!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3538
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_f08408ee:

    # "Si esquivas el golpe se lo puede llevar Kiara. Te preparas para detener el golpe. Estás en situación de desventaja"
    "If you dodge the blow Kiara could take it. You prepare to parry the hit. You are at a clear disadvantage."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3539
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_ee71ee81:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3541
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_83dbbdbf:

    # sol "¿Qué?"
    sol "What?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3543
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_d5a56970:

    # "Amanda aparece de la nada, saltando la valla, y pegándole una patada a Solomon que parece salida de una película."
    "Amanda appears out of nowhere, jumping over the fence, and kicking Solomon like she's straight out of a movie."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3544
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_af65a8e7:

    # "¿De dónde ha salido el disparo?"
    "Where did the shot come from?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3546
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_755f8aaa:

    # "Eva te mira, con una mezcla de alivio, sonrisa, y disculpa en su cara."
    "Eva looks at you, with a mixture of relief, smile, and apology on her face."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3547
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_cf3fbc11:

    # "Sabe que [mar] no quiere armas en casa. ¿La tenía escondida entre las plantas?"
    "She knows [mar] doesn't want guns in the house. Did she keep it hidden in the plant box?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3548
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_7eaf563f:

    # "Por una vez, te alegra que su respeto por las normas sea más bien laxo."
    "For once, you're glad that their respect for the rules is rather lax."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3550
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_8b2fdf10:

    # ama "Sube al coche y vete, pedazo de mierda. A menos que quieras probar a hacer un Leroy Jenkins."
    ama "Get in the car and drive away, you piece of shit. Unless you want to try doing a Leroy Jenkins."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3551
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_00ba3df1:

    # ama "Mi hermana nunca falla. Si vuelves a intentar algo así..."
    ama "My sister never misses. If you ever try anything like that again..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3552
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b42a3937:

    # ama "Piensa que en este bosque hay mucho terreno donde enterrar un cadáver y que no lo encuentren nunca."
    ama "Think about it. In this forest there is plenty of ground to bury a corpse so it will never be found."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3553
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_899e0325:

    # "Habla tan calmadamente que da miedo."
    "She speaks so calmly that it's scary."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3555
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_aa925d4b:

    # "Solomon se levanta, cada vez más magullado. Mantiene la puerta de la camioneta entre él y Amanda. Como si le fuese a servir de defensa."
    "Solomon stands up, increasingly bruised. He holds the pickup truck door between him and Amanda. As if it will serve as a defense for him."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3556
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_c1ae4f17:

    # sol "¡Os voy a denunciar! ¡Me habéis disparado!"
    sol "I'm going to report you! You shot at me!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3557
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b95a66f9:

    # mc "Demuéstralo, gilipollas."
    mc "Prove it, shithead."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3559
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_e0428106:

