    sol "You'll pay for this..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3568
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_992d8a38:

    # mc "Te he dicho que no quiero volver a escuchar tu voz."
    mc "I told you I never want to hear your voice again."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3570
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_dcf06b9f:

    # "Solomon parece entrar en razón. O quizás su cerebro ha entendido que no le queda ninguna ventaja."
    "Solomon seems to come to his senses. Or maybe his brain has figured out that he has no leverage left."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3571
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_55b2617c:

    # "Entra en el coche sin decir una palabra. Se sienta en silencio, bajo la atenta mirada de Amanda."
    "He enters the car without saying a word. He sits quietly, under Amanda's watchful eye."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3574
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_7887c072:

