    # kia "No sé si las chicas del harén vais a odiarme o a aceptarme... Espero que sea lo último. Al menos con las que he tenido la oportunidad de hablar así ha sido."
    kia "I don't know if the girls in the harem are going to hate me or accept me... I hope it's the latter. At least the ones I've had the chance to talk to have been that way."

