    kia "It's time for me to stop fooling myself. For me to face my feelings..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3618
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_a0565c6d:

    # kia "Si me aceptas, me gustaría explorar los sentimientos de los que hemos hablado antes. No voy a conseguir que dejen de crecer."
    kia "If you accept me, I would like to explore the feelings we talked about earlier. I'm not going to get them to stop growing."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3619
