    # mc "Kiara, ¿aceptarte? Estaría loco si no lo hiciera. Y ya has hecho tú todo el trabajo..."
    mc "Kiara, accept you? I'd be crazy not to. And you've already done all the work..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3621
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_eabde2c9:

    # "Kiara se lanza a tus brazos otra vez. Esta vez no busca un abrazo, busca tus labios."
    "Kiara throws herself into your arms again. This time she's not looking for a hug, she craves your lips."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3622
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_5ee15f04:

    # "Tímidamente al principio. Con más énfasis mientras pasan los segundos..."
    "Tentatively at first. With more intensity as the seconds pass..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3623
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_0287327d:

    # "Los dos sabéis que es el primer beso de muchos, que va a hacer de tus labios su hogar."
    "You both know it's the first kiss of many, that she's going to make your lips her home."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3624
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_4565571c:

    # "Un hogar que, obviamente, nunca compartirá con Solomon."
    "A home that, obviously, she will never share with Solomon."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3626
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_d03b200e:

    # "Tan solo Amanda presta atención a la cara de sorpresa de Solomon."
    "Only Amanda pays attention to Solomon's surprised face."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3628
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_64ced3c3:

    # "Solo ella se da cuenta de que arranca el coche y se va."
    "Only she realizes that he starts the car and leaves."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3630
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b0cdee7e:

    # kia "*Susurrando* Creo que es lo más difícil que he hecho nunca. Pero sienta tan bien..."
    kia "*Whispering* I think it's the hardest thing I've ever done. But it feels so good..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3631
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_05625234:

    # mc "Me alegra que hayas dado este paso, Kiara."
    mc "I'm happy you've taken this step, Kiara."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3633
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_81b096b8:

    # emm "¡Ha sido tan romántico! ¡Parece el guion de una película romántica mala! Pero ha quedado tan bonito..."
    emm "That was so romantic! It looks like the script of a bad romantic movie! But it looked so cute..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3636
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_88eba539:

    # "Kiara se vuelve a lanzar a tus brazos en un abrazo lleno de agradecimiento."
    "Kiara throws herself back into your arms, in a hug filled with gratitude."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3638
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_08bd797a:

    # emm "¡Ha sido alucinante! ¡Parece el guion de una película romántica mala! Sólo ha faltado que os besarais..."
    emm "That was amazing! It was like the script of a bad romantic movie! The only thing missing was the kiss..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3640
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_622f6099:

    # "Solo Amanda se da cuenta de que Solomon arranca el coche y se va."
    "Only Amanda notices Solomon starting the car and driving off."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3642
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_d9c3e52d:

    # "Las chicas arrancan a Kiara de tus brazos y se la llevan hacia la piscina. Ellas también quieren consolarla."
    "The girls pull Kiara out of your arms and take her towards the pool. They want to comfort her too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3644
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_122e328a:

    # "O felicitarla por su decisión de dejar completamente atrás su pasado."
    "Or congratulate her on her decision to completely leave her past behind."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3646
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_07195c57:

    # ama "Nunca más vuelvas a hacerme esto, [mc]."
    ama "Don't you ever do this to me again, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3647
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_bd40a085:

    # ama "Nunca des la espalda a un enemigo, aunque parezca derrotado."
    ama "Never turn your back on an enemy, even if he looks defeated."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3648
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_bff1a070:

    # mc "Lo siento... y gracias."
    mc "I'm sorry... and thank you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3650
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_4ec51ccf:

    # eva "Y pídele disculpas a [mar] de mi parte por haber escondido algunas armas en su casa..."
    eva "Apologize to [mar] on my behalf for hiding some weapons in her house..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3651
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_d9b09568:

    # eva "A mí me da vergüenza... nos habéis tratado tan bien que... siento que os he traicionado... un poco."
    eva "I am ashamed... you have treated us so well that... I feel like I have betrayed you... a bit. A very little bit."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3652
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_3197866c:

    # mc "No creo que le importe en este caso."
    mc "I don't think she cares too much in this case."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3653
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_1f570604:

    # mc "Y gracias a ti también."
    mc "And thanks to you, too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3654
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b5724e16:

    # mc "¿Cuántas armas tienes repartidas por la casa?"
    mc "How many guns do you have hidden around the house?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3656
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_57e5295a:

    # eva "Siete... no, ocho... Pero nadie las ha encontrado nunca."
    eva "Seven... no, eight... But no one has ever found any of them."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3657
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_04eb13ec:

    # mc "Creo que sería bueno que las retiraras, o las pusieras en una caja fuerte o algo..."
    mc "I think it would be good if you removed them, or put them in a safe or something..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3659
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_691a5fed:

    # eva "Pero hoy han servido de algo... Si hubiera estado en una caja fuerte, dentro de casa..."
    eva "But today they served their purpose... If it had been in a safe, inside the house..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3660
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_de5dddd4:

    # mc "Por eso no le va a importar. Pero no va a querer armas por casa al alcance de cualquiera."
    mc "That's why she's not going to be upset. But she's not going to want guns around the house within reach of everyone."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3662
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_66cce053:

    # ama "No, no le va a hacer ilusión, pero tenemos que tener medios para proteger a la familia."
    ama "No, she's not going to be thrilled about it, but we need to have the means to protect the family."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3663
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_7d371bd8:

    # ama "Aunque hoy lo has hecho muy bien excepto por lo de darle la espalda. La violencia justa y, especialmente, necesaria. No te has excedido."
    ama " Although, you did very well today except for turning your back on him. Fair and, especially, necessary violence. You didn't overdo it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3665
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_647239d8:

    # eva "Yo seguramente hubiese dejado su cara hecha pulpa al segundo insulto. Me habría costado contenerme."
    eva "I would have surely beaten his face into a pulp with the second insult. I would have had a hard time restraining myself."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3666
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b0c58024:

    # eva "Y me ha costado no fallar cuando he disparado a la llave. Esa cabeza era un blanco tentador."
    eva "And I had a hard time not missing when I shot at the wrench. That head was a tempting target."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3667
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_05535524:

    # mc "*Risa* Ya has dicho antes que un asesinato podía fastidiar la fiesta. Limpiar sangre y esas cosas..."
    mc "*Laugh* You've said earlier that a murder could spoil the party. Cleaning up blood and stuff..."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3670
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_f815701b:

    # ama "Solo tengo una pregunta, [mc]."
    ama "I just have a question, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3671
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_1afe9f90:

    # mc "Dime."
    mc "Tell me."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3673
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_182b7480:

    # ama "¿Vamos a tener que ponernos en plan damisela en apuros nosotras también para conseguir un beso como ese?"
    ama "Are we going to have to get all damsel in distress ourselves too to get a kiss like that?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3676
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b547db77:

    # ama "¿Sabes que por un momento he pensado que Kiara iba besarte?"
    ama "Do you know that, for a moment, I thought Kiara was going to kiss you?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3677
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_76361516:

    # ama "He pensado que el modo damisela en apuros iba a forzarte a aceptarla."
    ama "I thought the damsel in distress mode was going to force you to accept her."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3679
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_196b4397:

    # ama "Y después he pensado en qué pasaría si nosotras también estuviéramos en esa situación."
    ama "And then I thought about what would happen if we were in that situation too."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3680
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_43256da6:

    # mc "*Risa* No os pegaría el papel de damisela en apuros, Amanda. O al menos no como lo estaba Kiara."
    mc "*Laugh* The damsel in distress role wouldn't suit you, Amanda. Or at least not the kind of damsel Kiara was."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3681
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_4f2b1bc1:

    # mc "Aún no sé si quiero tener una relación con vosotras y no lo voy a saber hasta que no resolváis lo que hablamos anoche."
    mc "I still don't know if I want to have a relationship with you, and I'm not going to know until you work out what we talked about last night."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3683
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_8cb4e257:

    # eva "¿Qué? ¿Aún no lo sabes?"
    eva "What? You don't know yet?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3684
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_106e7b58:

    # mc "No, Eva. Hasta que no me digáis qué condiciones va a tener esa relación... o esas relaciones."
    mc "No, Eva. I can't choose until you tell me what the terms of that relationship... or those relationships are going to be."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3686
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_2bfff79d:

    # eva "¡Entonces no hay tiempo que perder, Amanda!"
    eva "Then there's no time to waste, Amanda!"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3688
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_c4d99572:

    # eva "Nos vamos a algún lugar donde podamos hablar en privado."
    eva "We are going somewhere where we can talk in private."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3690
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_20ce56a9:

    # "Eva y Amanda se van, dejándote solo."
    "Eva and Amanda walk away, leaving you alone."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3691
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_b5e1b84a:

    # "El resto de las chicas están con Kiara."
    "The rest of the girls are with Kiara."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3693
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_5dd83e48:

    # "Solomon no ha conseguido su objetivo de que Kiara se fuera con él."
    "Solomon has not achieved his goal of getting Kiara to go with him."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3694
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_4566a869:

    # "Pero su aparición ha matado el ambiente de la fiesta de cumpleaños."
    "But his showing up has killed the mood of the birthday party."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3695
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_8a72d8c4:

    # "El resto de la tarde gira alrededor de su visita. Todo el mundo quiere apoyar a Kiara."
    "The rest of the afternoon revolves around his visit. Everyone wants to support Kiara."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3699
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_e1f3e549:

    # "Que Kiara se haya unido a las revelaciones del día tan solo ayuda a ello."
    "That Kiara joined in the day's revelations only helps."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3701
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_82bc7200:

    # "Es la primera vez que alguien pide permiso para entrar en el harén, lo cual lo hace especial en cierto modo."
    "It's the first time anyone has asked permission to enter the harem, which makes it special in a way."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3703
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_24af7778:

    # "Que haya mostrado el respeto suficiente hacia tu relación previa para pedir permiso, lo hace especial en cierto modo."
    "That she showed enough respect for your previous relationship to ask permission, makes it special in a way."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3705
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_1fd645c8:

    # "Amanda no es la única que ha pensado que Kiara iba a besarte."
    "Amanda's not the only one who thought Kiara was going to kiss you."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3707
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_05ab3366:

    # "Todas las chicas se acercan a ti en algún momento de la tarde, preocupadas por cómo te sientes tras lo que ha pasado."
    "All the girls come to you at some point in the afternoon, concerned about how you're feeling after what happened."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3708
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_1820d88b:

    # "Todas ellas saben que la violencia no va contigo y que has actuado movido por la necesidad."
    "They all know that violence does not suit you and that you acted out of necessity."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3709
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_a176d9c9:

    # "Ninguna sabe que has disfrutado cada bofetón, puñetazo, y patada."
    "None of them know you've enjoyed every slap, punch, and kick."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3710
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_d74e08bf:

    # "Lo ocultas haciendo bromas sobre la fiesta y los regalos. Evitas hablar de la visita de Solomon."
    "You hide it by making jokes about the party and the gifts. You avoid talking about Solomon's visit."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3712
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_f0df114b:

    # "Amanda y Eva se pasan el resto de la tarde charlando, intentando resolver sus diferencias."
    "Amanda and Eva spend the rest of the afternoon chatting, trying to work out their differences."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3713
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_06942bef:

    # "Prefieres no acercarte demasiado. Aún no estás preparado para tomar una decisión."
    "You'd rather not get too close. You're not ready to make that choice yet."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3715
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_5e5a1702:

    # "Cuando el sol deja de calentar, las chicas que viven en la ciudad empiezan a irse."
    "When the sun ceases to warm, the girls who live in the city start to leave."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3716
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_4cc0d06b:

    # "Excepto Maddie, que se queda para la partida de DnD."
    "Except for Maddie, who is staying for the DnD game."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3717
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_c0080cf2:

    # "Todas rechazan la invitación a quedarse a cenar, para tristeza de Jamaal."
    "They all decline the invitation to stay for dinner, much to Jamaal's sadness."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3718
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_09b6671c:

    # "Jamaal se lleva sobras para cenar. Sobras con las que cenarían cuatro o cinco personas."
    "Jamaal takes leftovers for dinner. Leftovers that could feed four or five people."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3720
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_5792b57a:

    # "Las que viven en casa pasan por la ducha haciendo turnos o duchándose en grupo."
    "Those who live at home take their showers, taking turns or showering in groups."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3721
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_1458e440:

    # "Tú te duchas en el gimnasio. Nadie intenta pillarte desnudo mientras lo haces."
    "You shower at the gym. No one tries to catch you naked while you're doing it."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3723
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_49031071:

    # "Una vez rechazadas las invitaciones a cenar, descubrís que nadie tiene hambre. Todos habéis comido demasiado."
    "Once the dinner invitations are declined, you discover that no one is hungry. You've all eaten too much."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3724
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_9e204a7d:

    # "Un día entero en la piscina os ha dejado a todos agotados. La mayoría de las chicas se retiran pronto a sus habitaciones."
    "A full day at the pool has left you all exhausted. Most of the girls retire early to their rooms."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3725
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_fb9e1b73:

    # "[emm] se queja de que una partida de DnD sin pizza va a ser rara. Alguien comenta que le apetecía pizza con kiwi."
    "[emm] complains that a DnD game without pizza is going to be weird. Someone comments that they were in the mood for pizza with kiwi."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3726
translate english c19s008_LeeroyJenkins_af00b4fc:

    # "Es un alivio que todos hayáis comido demasiado y no tengáis que pedir ese crimen contra la humanidad. Si la piña tiene mala fama en la pizza, el kiwi tiene que ser el peor invento de la historia."
    "It's a relief that you've all had too much for lunch and don't have to order that crime against humanity. If pineapple has a bad reputation on pizza, kiwi has to be the worst invention ever."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3729
translate english c19s009_Teaser_df652625:

    # "Te preparas para tu primera partida de DnD. No tienes ni idea de lo que esperar pese a que [dap] y Scarlett te lo han explicado cien veces los últimos días."
    "You're getting ready for your first DnD game. You have no idea what to expect despite [dap] and Scarlett explaining it to you a hundred times over the last few days."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3731
translate english c19s009_Teaser_1ec36538:

    # "Cuando llegas a la cocina, solo están [dap] y Scarlett. [dap] tiene un montón de cosas extrañas encima de la mesa."
    "When you get to the kitchen, it's just [dap] and Scarlett. [dap] has a bunch of weird stuff on the table."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3732
translate english c19s009_Teaser_0377f5a7:

    # "Deben ser los famosos dados para jugar a rol."
    "It must be the famous role-playing dice."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3733
translate english c19s009_Teaser_07138114:

    # dap "¡Qué puntual! Siéntate a ese lado, en la segunda silla. La primera es de Scarlett."
    dap " You're on time! Sit on that side, in the second chair. The first one is Scarlett's."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3735
translate english c19s009_Teaser_156bd6b7:

    # sca "Necesito estar al lado de [dap] para mover las figuras. Ella no llega."
    sca "I need to be next to [dap] to move the figurines. She can't reach the map."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3736
translate english c19s009_Teaser_43d47f54:

    # mc "Ningún problema. Así también me ayudas a mí. Soy el único novato."
    mc "No problem. That way you can help me, too. I'm the only newbie."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3738
translate english c19s009_Teaser_5643f7fe:

    # dap "¿Preparado para la mayor aventura de tu vida?"
    dap "Ready for the greatest adventure of your life?"

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3739
translate english c19s009_Teaser_306193d8:

    # sca "No te asustes, es posible que no sea tanto como esperas."
    sca "Don't panic, it may not be as great as you expect for your first time."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3740
translate english c19s009_Teaser_6e42abed:

    # dap "Tendrás que esperar un poco. Tienen que llegar el resto de las chicas."
    dap "You'll have to wait a bit. We need the rest of the girls here to start."

# game/scripts/c19/c19.rpy:3741
translate english c19s009_Teaser_91f128d3:

    # sca "Suelen ser más puntuales, pero [eri] se está cambiando con Maddie. Empezaremos en poco tiempo."
    sca "They're usually more punctual, but [eri] is changing with Maddie. We'll start shortly."

